<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- ARUM NT</book>
  <para style="h">Amatiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amatiyu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amatiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ama</para>
  <para style="mt1">Amatiyu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ikpi Tsifa</para>
  <para style="im">Kyangwri ata nza a ŋa amgbasho nana ata areh isa a ŋoh a bu Amatiyu, a bu kyangwri Yahuda, tasa za ŋoh a bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh. Amgbasho reh a tsana la a bu Yeso ŋa ta maka a bleh reh a gya la a ba tsi a sa reh a hwana reh, a bu ma aki a ŋoh za ata tsifa bleh a gya Nnoh na kyangwri mboh na kiri ta ka a su reh. Tsifa nana ata areh a bu Yahudawa mboh amoh tsene ata ta maka a mara Yeso ta a te agba na amoh reh kpeh, neh a bu inziyo amoh na agba ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amgbasho reh a jiji a tsana mara Yeso, tasa za a tsana a wra batisma a ŋoh reh tasa tsara ata agugu ta ka a tsara ŋoh reh, tasa za a ka a jiji ndohmoh hwra tsifa nana a ŋoh, tasa tsana, tasa nga wuwana ma kyangwri mboh ma Galili. Areh a treh feh amgbasho reh ka a tsana ndohmoh a ŋoh anyi Galili a gu a na Urushalima tasa za ka a gu a na atsi ata ta maka a kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh tasa hinga a ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsifa nana ata areh a tsana la Yeso a bu kyangwri tsana agba, ata nza a nati a tsana reh tsifa akpo afiya Nnoh ma inza reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">A zizi Chuhu Tsifa Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ata areh a bu amgbasho tsifa Yeso Kristi ata a zizi ŋoh, amehreh Dawuda, nza anyi ma alohsoh Ibrahim.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibrahim ka mara Ishaku,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:2">Ishaku ka mara Yakubu, Yakubu ka mara Yahuda mboh ma atsini mboh.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yahuda ka a mara Ferez tasa Zera. Akre amoh a bu Tamar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">Ferez ka a mara Hezron,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">Hezron ka a mara Aram,<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Aram ka a mara Amminadab,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:4">Amminadab ka a mara Nashon, Nashon ka a mara Salmon,<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon ka a mara Bowaz akre a bu Rahab,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:5">Bowaz ka a mara Obida akre bu Rutu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Obida ka a mara Yesse,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yesse ka a mara Dawuda za bu Agohmoh reh.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:6">Dawuda ka a mara Solomon akre tana bu afya Uriya,<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomon ka a mara Rehobowam,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehobowam ka a mara Abiya,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:7">Abija ka a mara A sa,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />A sa ka a mara Yehoshafat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehoshafat ka a mara Yoram, Yoram ka a mara Uzziya,<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzziya ka a mara Yotam, Yotam ka a mara Ahaz,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahaz ka a mara Hezekiya,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya ka a mara Manasse,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:10">Manasse ka a mara Amon,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon ka a mara Yosiya,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosiya ka a mara Yekoniya tasa atsini mboh, na ameh ata mata ka a fira mboh a nati te ahwra ma akpo afiya Babila reh.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Tama ka a fira mboh a na akpo afiya Babila reh,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:12">Yekoniya ka a mara Sheyaltiyel,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:12">Sheyaltiyel ka a mara Zerubbabel,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubbabel ka a mara Abihuda,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:13">Abihuda ka a mara Eliyakim,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliyakim ka a mara Azor,<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azor ka a mara Zadok,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:14">Zadok ka mara Akimu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:14">Akimu ka a mara Aliyudu,<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Aliyudu ka a mara Eleazara,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleazara ka a mara Matana,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 1:15">Matana ka a mara Yakubu,<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakubu ka a mara Yusufu atsifa Maryamu ata nza a mara Yeso reh, ata nza maka a fi ŋoh la Kristi reh.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Nza ka anyi na Ibrahim ka a ba na Dawuda reh a bu ika agrumavoh a hwa anneh mi. Anyi na Dawuda ka a ba na ameh ata mata ka a fira Israilawa mboh a na afiya ahwra ma Babila reh, a bu ika agrumavoh a hwa anneh, tasa za nza ka a gu anyi na ameh ata tama ka a fira Israila mboh a na ahwra ma Babila reh a ba na mara Kristi reh a bu ika agrumavoh a hwa anneh.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mara Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ma mara Yeso Kristi reh ma aki ata areh. ameh ata Yusufu ta ka a treh a leh a handa Maryamu la ŋoh ta a sa ŋoh reh, a ka sehreh la a bu na ivru huru zanana neh ma hehreh a sa itoh amoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Atsifa ŋoh Yusufu reh a bu kyangwri tufa Nnoh yehlehleh, tasa a kira ta a nga ŋoh na isa ma tomo kyangwri mboh kpeh, ka kohnoh la ŋoh ta ka a yi ŋoh ata gbalala ma, akyo ta kama a wina kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Nza ka buti kohnoh tsifa reh, amehreh tohmoh Ada anyi ka a kate ŋoh ma lohtoh, ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Yusufu amehreh Dawuda kama nyiri kpeh gu Maryamu ta bu afya anzoh, ivru a ŋoh reh anyi na huru zanana mi. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Ŋoh a nati a mara amehreh, ni nati gya ŋoh isa la Yeso, a bu ŋoh nza a nati a nga kyangwri mboh nvara anyi na kpakpana amoh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ma lisa amboh areh nambri la, tsifa Ada reh ta a su, ta ka a bleh anyi ma aniye kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh la, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Anyifa ata kǝ hehreh wina atsifa kpeh a nati a sa ivru ta a mara amehreh, ma a nati a gya isa a ŋoh la Immanuwel&gt;&gt; lomo isa Immanuwel reh la,&lt;&lt;Nnoh a bu na ambohroh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Yusufu nza ka a hinga anyi ma mla reh, ka a tufa tsifa amehreh tohmoh Ada reh. Yusufu neh ka a gu Maryamu ta ka bu afya ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />A sohroh a leh na ŋoh kpeh, nza ka a mara amehreh a ŋoh reh, ka a gya ŋoh isa la, Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Amboh Lomo Nza Akpukpa A wina ma Anyi Mgba nnoh Nerebi A ba Sene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Maka mara Yeso ma Batalami ata akpo afiya Yahudiya ameh ata Hirudus nza a bu Agohmoh reh, kyangwri amboh anyi nza ma a bu na lomo nza akpukpa, ma a nza akpukpa anyi na mgba nnoh nerebi maka a ba Urushalima, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />tasa maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Maka a mara Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh afeh reh mma? Mbohroh meh nza akpukpa a ŋoh nyi na mgba nnoh nerebi, tasa meh ba timi krumusu ŋoh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Agohmoh Hirudus nza ka a sehreh dehreh agohsoh a ŋoh ka a hinga, ka wa kyangwri Urushalima mboh za nambri. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ka a fi agba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh, ka luhu mboh atsi ata nza ma mara Kristi reh. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ma Batalami ata Yahudiya,&gt;&gt; ka bu dehreh kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh tana ŋa,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />&lt;Nnoh za Batalami ata inzi Yahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ni bu akehreh kpeh nimeh amboh de Yahuda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">a nati nyi nimeh anzoh ma a nati a mara Agohmoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">akyo ata nza a nati a sumu kyangwri mboh ma Israila,&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Hirudus ka fi sehneh mboh nza ma nyi mgba nnoh nerebi reh na ayuhu, ka luhu mboh ameh ta nza ma a nza akpukpa reh. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />A ka tohmoh mboh a na Batalami la, &lt;&lt;Na ni fa atsifi reh nza meh noh ve ma ikpi amehreh atisha reh, nza ni nza noh, ti ba bu gyuru bleh meh noh meh ti na ni krumusu ŋoh za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Nza maka a sehreh tsifa Agohmoh reh a treh nambri maka a na amoh hehndeh amoh. Akpukpa ata mata ka a nza anyi mgba nnoh nerebi reh a bu ma tohmoh amoh maka leh a tufa ŋoh, ka a na na a shi ma afiya ata nza ma a mara amehreh reh. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Mboh nza maka a nza akpukpa reh kǝ shi, maka johjoh gaga. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Nza maka aniye a na afiya reh maka a na na a nza amehreh atisha reh mboh ma akre Maryamu, maka a susuna ma tohmoh a ŋoh, maka krumusu ŋoh. Maka a hingre a kpanga awumu amoh maka a nga ŋoh ngǝnga ata hungroh zinariya, tasa awumu nyungo alindeh ata ma a lisa na agbeh mur. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Maka a gǝga aki anyi tse a na amoh akpo afiya amoh, tama akpi mboh ashotoh ma lohtoh la ma za gyuru a na ni hirudus za kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusufu Mboh ma Maryamu maka A gbo A na amoh Masar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Amboh lomo nza akpukpa mboh nza maka a na amoh reh, amehreh tohmoh Ada ka a kate ma Yusufu ma lohtoh, ka a bleh la.&lt;&lt;Hinga, ti gu ameh amehreh reh mboh ma akre ti gbo na nnoh akpo afiya Masar. Ti tuma noh ma a huru fya, nza meh bleh feh si ba nnoh mohnoh, nza Hirudus a leh a fa ameh amehreh reh la ŋoh ta mla a kwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Maka a de a hinga, maka a gu amehreh reh mboh ma akre ka a na amoh Masar, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />ka tuma ma a huru maka a sehreh kwo Hirudus feh. Ata areh ka bu dehreh la andromboh ata Ada ta ka a bleh ma aniye kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su la,&lt;&lt;Meh fi amehreh amya kate nyi Masar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma a mla Amehreh akǝkehreh Mboh A kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Hirudus nza ka a nza la sene amboh lomo nza akpukpa a wina mboh reh ma a gu ŋoh la ŋoh a duduna, ka a te gofo gaga, ka a tohmoh la, ma a mla amehreh tsifa mboh akǝkehreh nambri nza ma a yama ma Batalami kawa akanda, ka a gu anyi amboh ahushi afri ka tamba, ka tswa na ameh ata ta ka a sehreh anyi na sene amboh lomo nza akpukpa wina reh <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ka bu ameh wohroh tsifa Irimiya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su la,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />&lt;&lt;Tama a sehreh agba ma Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">agba hungwa agohsoh tasa ata kpanga a rinana ata wuwa agohsoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ka bu Rahila a leh a kpanga ma ikpi mara a ŋoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">a leke ta sa soh ivoh yira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">la mara a ŋoh mboh ma a yama za kpeh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A gyuru A ba Amoh Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Hirudus a kwo a treh feh amehreh tohmoh Ada ka a kate ma Yusufu ma lohtoh ma Masar, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />ka a bleh ŋoh, la &lt;&lt;Hinga ti gu ameh amehreh reh mboh ma akre ti gyuru na anzoh inzi Israila, amboh ata mata ka kira mata a gu fene amehreh reh ma kwo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />A ka a de a hinga ka a gu amehreh reh mboh ma akre ka a na a ŋoh akpo inzi Israila.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Nza ka a sehreh la a bu amehreh Hirudus, Arkilayus a de Agohmoh alehmeh, ka a de Yahudiya, ka nyiri ta a na ma a huru. Nza maka akpi ŋoh ashotoh ma lohtoh, ka a hwana a na a ŋoh akpo afiya Galili. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Ka a na na a tuma ma akpo afiya ata maka a fi la Nazaret, tsifa ata ma ta ka a bleh ma aniye kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nati a fi ŋoh la kyangwri Nazaret.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma A lisa Aki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:19-28">1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Na kiri reh, Ayohana kyangwri a wra batisma tana a ba ba a leh a hehndeh hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh ma hohroh bini Yahudiya mboh, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />ka a leh a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ta nnoh aki agugu amohnoh reh, kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh kǝ ba nda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ka a bu ata areh ŋa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a bleh tsifa a ŋoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;&lt;Agba anyi a leh a fi ma hohroh bini la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;lisa nnoh aki Ada reh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">ti lisa nnoh agohsoh amohnoh ta a bu yehlehleh na Nnoh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Kuri Ayohana nza were reh ma a lisa nashi na Nyama, tasa ka a lafa chuhu yira a ŋoh na rishi leda. Rya a ŋoh feh ka bu tawa tasa amwo to <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Kyangwri mboh maka anyi Urushalima, tasa Yahudiya, tasa akpokpo afiyafiya mboh nza ma a yama ma akachi Fini Urdu, maka a leh ka a ba na a ŋoh, <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Maka a leh a bleh ŋoh kpakpana amoh mboh, a ka leh a fira mboh a wra batisma ma Fini Urdu.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ayohana neh nza ka a nza kyangwri Farisiyawa mboh tasa sadukiyawa mboh maka a leh a ba gaga la ŋoh ta a wra batisma, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh alohsoh Anu mboh! A bu anyi ka a bleh noh la gbo nyi nnoh na gofo Nnoh ata nza a nati ba reh? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Lisa nnoh andromboh alindeh ata nza a nati a tsana la ni gyuruna ta nnoh aki agugu amohnoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Kama gu nnoh ma agohsoh amohnoh la, &lt;Ibrahim a bu atsiyoh amohnoh kpeh.&gt; Nnoh a nati a wina lisa ma Ibrahim amehreh na kpakpa amboh areh. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Ma a gu aniye ikeh a gya ma chuhu ariri agbeh, Agbeh ata nza a sohroh a mara alindeh kpeh ma a nati a biri a fi nimeh shira.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />&lt;&lt;Mya meh wra nnoh batisma na amwo la ti gyuruna ta nnoh aki agugu mohnoh reh. Ŋoh ta nza a kehmeh neh a nati a ba ma nyina mya, meh nati wina bara akpehtreh hwana a ŋoh kpeh. Ŋoh a nati a wra nnoh batisma na huru zanana tasa ni shira. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />A de kumu ma ivoh a ŋoh, a nati a lisa fi ta a blisa yohroh a ŋoh. A nati a fira yohroh alikama a gya a na nimeh lohkehreh, ta a fira atutu afya na shira ata nza ka a kwo na gbugbo kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batisma Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Na ameh wohroh Yeso a ka nyi Galili ka a ba na Ayohana ni Fini Urdu la ta a wra ŋoh batisma. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ayohana neh ka a kira ta a ha ŋoh, ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Mya meh kira meh ti ba na anzoh ti wra meh batisma, nnoh ni ba na amya tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Wra batisma reh ta a su dehreh ma nehnehreh. A bu ma aki wohroh meh nati lisa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira reh dehreh ka zohhoh meh ti lisa andromboh ata tufa yehlehleh,&gt;&gt;Ayohana neh ka a kira ka a wra ŋoh batisma.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Nza maka a wra batisma ma Yeso a treh reh, ka kate anyi nimeh amwo, inza ka a vuruna ka a nza huru Nnoh ka tamba tswanza ikukuba ma ikpi ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Maka a sehreh agba ka anyi inza la,&lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu amehreh Nnoh ata mya nza ni kira, ata agohsoh amya nza a kukuna na a ŋoh gaga reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ma A tsara Yeso A nza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mk 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Huru Nnoh neh ka a gu Yeso a na ma hohroh bini la agugu ta a tsara ŋoh a nza. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Nza ka de aniye ibi agrumavoh ida anneh kawa shini tasa nnoh, inyo ka a keh ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Tasa agugu reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni bu amehreh Nnoh zizi reh, bleh kpakpa amboh areh mata a bu noh irya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Tama a ŋa a gya la, &lt;A bu irya tsene kyangwri a nati a rya ta a hunji fene kpeh, nza bu tsifa ata nza a kate anyi ma aniye Nnoh feh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Agugu neh ka a gu ŋoh a na Urushalima afiya huru zanana ka a gu ŋoh a gya a na ma agboh ida Nnoh, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni bu amehreh Nnoh reh, hwa tamba nyi ma mareh, a bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">&lt;Nnoh a nati bleh mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh mata a shushwa nnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">ma a nati a haha nnoh na ivoh amoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">la ti kama kpa hwana ma kpakpa kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ma ŋa za la, &lt;Kama tsara Ada Nnoh anzoh kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Agugu reh ka a gyuru a gu ŋoh za a na ma ikpi agbohgboh agba anyi, ka a tsana ŋoh kpra Agohmoh alindeh tasa asabara inziyo mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Ka a gyuru a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati nga nnoh amboh reh nambri nza ni hwa susuna ma tohmoh amya ti krumusu meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga meh ma mareh, nnoh agugu! Tama a ŋa a gya la, &lt;Ni nati krumusu Ada Nnoh anzoh, ŋoh tsene ni nati tufa ŋoh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ma huru agugu reh ka ata ŋoh, amehreh tohmoh Nnoh mboh maka a ba ba a te ndohmoh shingi ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A jiji A te Ndohmoh A ŋoh ma Galili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yeso nza ka a sehreh la ma a de Ayohana a fi ma ida ka, ka a gyuru a na a ŋoh Galili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Nza ka ata Nazaret, ka a na a ŋoh Kafarnahum na tuma, akpo afiya ata nza a bu ma akachi fini Galili ma ikpi hohnoh Zebulun tasa Naftali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />La tsifa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su la,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />&lt;&lt;Inzi Zebulun tasa inzi Naftali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">nza a bu ma aki fini agba, na ba fini Urdu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galili amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Kyangwri amboh ata ma tuma nimeh shini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">maka a nza zanana mgbakaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">amboh ata ma a tuma ma inzi tasa ma aki Nnoh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">zanana tsifa Nnoh ka a ba mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ka a gu anyi na ameh ata, Yeso ta ka a jiji a leh hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ta nnoh aki agugu amohnoh reh, kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh kǝ ba nda&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A fi mara Tufa A ŋoh mboh amboh ata jiji ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yeso ka a leh a hehndeh ma akachi fini Galili, ka a nza kyangwri amboh anyi mboh ma atsini, Siman ata maka a fi ŋoh la Abitrusu tasa atsini Andarawus, ma a leh a were arishi de kpo ma fini, ndohmoh amoh a bu de kpo. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ba bu wa meh noh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh nati gyuru nnoh ti bu noh amboh fi kyangwri mboh ba na Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Maka a fira arishi de kpo amoh mboh reh a sangra nambri maka a tufa ŋoh heri. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ka a leh a rya tohmoh na hehndeh, ka a nza kyangwri amboh anyi mboh afri mboh ma atsini, Yakubu tasa Ayohana mara Zabadi mboh. Ma a bu nimeh gbogblondo amwo mboh ma alehmeh amoh Zabadi ma a leh a lisa arishi de kpo amoh, a ka a fi mboh. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Maka a hinga na gbugbo ata gbogblondo amwo reh maka tufa ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Amboh Bishi mboh Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yeso ka a hehndeh a treh atsifi ma inzi Galili, ka a leh a tsana mboh lomo tsifa ma ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh, ka a leh hwra a bleh mboh tsifa nana ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh. Ka a leh a nga wuwana ma amboh bishi mboh ma atsetse tasa amboh ata ma a wuwana kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Tsifa a ŋoh ka a treh atsifi ma inzi Suriya nambri, tasa kyangwri mboh maka a leh a fira amboh bishi mboh a ba na a ŋoh tasa amboh bishi mboh reh ma atsetse, kawa amboh ata ma a leh a wa iya za, tasa amboh bishi inyo mboh, tasa amboh ta itoh amoh mboh a kwo tamba mgba anyi, ka a leh a de wuwana a ba mboh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Duma agba maka a leh a tufa ŋoh anyi Galili, tasa Dikafolis tasa Urushalima, tasa inzi Yahudiya, tasa za maka anyi iba Fini Urdu.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso Ahwra Tsifa Nnoh A bleh Ma Ikpi Agbohgboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yeso nza ka a nza duma mboh gaga, a ka a na a ŋoh na a tuma ma ikpi agbohgboh. amboh tufa Yeso mboh maka a ba na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Ka a vuru aniye ka a leh a tsana mboh.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Agohsoh ata A zizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />&lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na amboh ata huru amoh nza anyinana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh a bu amohnoh.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Te atoh a bu na amboh ata nza ma a bu na hungwa yira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">Nnoh a nati a nga mboh wuwa agohsoh<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Te atoh a bu na amboh ata nza ma a bu na kuku ikpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">Ma a nati a nza nana andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya mboh ma inziyo reh.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Te atoh a bu na amboh ata inyo tasa yohroh amwo nza a de mboh ma kpi tufa yehlehleh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">ni nati hunu nnoh.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Te atoh a bu na amboh nza kwini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">ma a nati a nza kwini amoh za.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Te atoh a bu na amboh ata agohsoh amoh nza a bu na zanana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">ma a nati a nza Nnoh.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Te atoh a bu na amboh de tuma suhruna ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">ma a nati a fi mboh la mara Nnoh mboh.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Te atoh a bu na amboh nza ma a wa iya ma ikpi tufa yehlehleh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh a nati a bu amoh.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />&lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na amohnoh amboh ata kyangwri nza ma a kya nnoh, mata a nga noh iya, mata a huru tsifa ma ikpi amohnoh, mata a bleh tsifa agugu ni ikpi amohnoh, la tsifa amya. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Johjoh ti bibirina nnoh tasa agohsoh amohnoh ta ka a bu fyafya ma, firoh amohnoh a nati a bu gaga ma inza, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh za tama a jiji a wa iya ika wohroh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mma Tasa Zana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />&lt;&lt;Ni bu noh tswanza mma ata inziyo, nza mma reh a za wina de nana a ba za kpeh, ma a nati a lisa lele sa a gyuru a nana? Ma a nati a te andromboh na wohroh za kpeh, ma a nati a fira a sangra ma ta ka a huhuya na hwana. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Ni bu noh tswanza zanana ata inziyo. Afiya ata nza ma a mina ma ikpi agbohgboh a nati a bu ma huho kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Kyangwri maka a sohroh a mloh shira afitila a gya mata a hama na gbugba kpeh, neh maka a gya a na ma ikpoh kohhroh shira ta a zana kyangwri mboh ma afiya reh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ta nnoh zana amohnoh ta a de zanana a ba ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh, la mata a nza andromboh alindeh nza ni lisa noh reh, mata ka riri Ada mohnoh nza a yama ma inza reh.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana Yeso ma ikpi Akpi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />&lt;&lt;Kama kohnoh nnoh la meh ba meh ti va tsifa Akpi Musa tasa tsana ata amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh mboh reh sangra kpeh. Meh ba meh ti va sangra kpeh, meh ba neh la mata a lisa a su.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Meh bleh noh zizi, inza tasa inziyo areh a nati a gǝga, ma a nati a mishi a gu yohroh tsifa anyi, ha anene akroh ŋa mbimbi a kate nimeh tsana akpi Musa reh kpeh, awumu reh a nati a su nambri feh. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Akyo ata nza a leke ta tufa anyimbehreh nimeh doka reh tasa za ta ka a tsana mgbiri kyangwri mboh za la ma ta a leke tufa akpi reh, ma a nati a gu ŋoh ta a bu andromboh kpeh ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh. Akyo ata nza a tufa akpi reh yehlehleh tasa za ta ka tsana mgbiri mboh, ma a nati a gu ŋoh ta a bu agba ma afiya Nnoh ata inza reh. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Meh ti bleh noh, nza tufa yehlehleh amohnoh reh ta a keh ata amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa ata Farisiyawa mboh amoh kpeh, ni nati mishi niye nnoh nimeh kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana ma ikpi Gofo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />&lt;&lt;Ni sehreh noh tama a bleh ma kyangwri mboh na kiri la, &lt;Kama mla akyo kwo nnoh kpeh, akyo ata nza a mla akyo a kwo reh, ma a nati hwra akpi a ŋoh. Ha akyo ata nza a fi atsini la, &lt;Ni duduna!&gt; a nati aniye nimeh shira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Nehnehreh neh meh bleh noh, la akyo ata nza a te gofo na atsini, ma a nati ahwra akpi a ŋoh, tasa akyo ata nza a fi atsini la, &lt;Agba abibi!&gt; Ma a nati a de ŋoh a na na amboh hwra akpi mboh, tasa akyo ata nza a fi atsini la a duduna, a tswa mata a gu ŋoh a fi a na nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni kira ti de ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh na ma Nnoh ma bagadi, neh ti kǝ kohnoh la atsi anzoh a de noh ma agohsoh, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />ta andromboh nza ni de ba ma Nnoh reh ma tohmoh bagadi, ti na ni lisa tuma noh mohnoh ma atsi anzoh reh treh fya si gyuru de ngǝnga reh na ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />&lt;&lt;Nza akyo a fi aniye anzoh ma atsi hwra akpi, lisa tsifa na a ŋoh nza ni treh nnoh ma aki, kavoh kpeh reh neh ma a nati a de noh a na atsi hwra akpi. Nza ni bu ma a huru reh ma a nati a de noh a nga kyangwri hwra akpi, ŋoh a nati a de noh a nga ahwra a ŋoh mboh mata a de noh a ka ma ida ka. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Meh bleh noh zizi, ni nati wina kate nyi ma mareh kpeh, ni nati fanga hungroh nza ma a nati a gya nnoh reh a treh nambri fya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana Ma Ikpi Leh Ahondoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />&lt;&lt;Ni sehreh noh tama a bleh la, &lt;Akyo anyi ta a sohroh leh ahohndoh na akyo kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Mya neh meh bleh noh la, nza akyo ka a nza afiya ka a hwa amwo iyo, ŋoh kǝ leh ahohndoh na akyo ma agohsoh ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Nza iyo anzoh ata rya a kpa a nati a de noh lisa ti hwa, fufa iyo reh tavoh, a zohhoh ti fufa andromboh anyi tse kate ma itoh anzoh na ata mata a gu nnoh na agba ma a shebiri nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Nza ivoh anzoh ata rya a kpa a nati a de noh ti hwa, fufa ivoh reh tavoh, a zohhoh mata a fufa andromboh anyimbehreh a kate anyi ma itoh anzoh na ata mata a gu nnoh na agba ma a shebiri nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tsana ma Ikpi Katsi Afya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Ama 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mk 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Ma a bleh za la, &lt;Nza akyo ata nza a katsi afya a ŋoh ta a nga ŋoh amgbasho la ta a na a ŋoh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Meh bleh la akyo ata nza a katsi afya ŋoh, ta sohroh a de mboh ma atsi leh ahohndoh na akyo kpeh, ka a gu ŋoh a fi a na ma aki leh ahohndoh na akyo mboh mi. Akyo ata nza a sa ŋoh reh, a bu tswanza a zaka leh ahohndoh na akyo mi.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gu Faku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />&lt;&lt;Ni sehreh noh za la, tama a bleh ma kyangwri amohnoh mboh na kiri la, &lt;Kama gu faku ma kpi huru tsifa kpeh, nnoh neh ti lisa andromboh ata ni faku ma ikpi reh ma Ada.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Mya neh meh bleh noh, kama mishi fa nnoh aku kpeh: ha ni inza, inza reh a bu kpra Agohmoh Nnoh; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />ha ni inziyo, a bu atsi gya hwana a ŋoh, ha ni Urushalima, wohroh reh a bu afiya agba ata Agohmoh agba. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Kama faku na ikpi anzoh kpeh, ni nati wina lisa shina kpi anyimbehreh ta hungwa ha ta a kasa kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Andromboh nza ni nati a bleh noh reh ta bu &lt;Haa&gt; ha &lt;Uwa,&gt; andromboh ata nza a handa ata areh anyi na ŋoh ata nza bu agugu.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo ta bu ata Iyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Ni sehreh noh tama a bleh la, iyo ta bu ata iyo, anyini ta bu ata anyini. <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Mya neh meh bleh noh la, kama leke nnoh ŋoh ata nza bu agugu reh kpeh. Nza akyo ka a mla nnoh na mbiri itoh ata mgba ivoh ryakpa, nnoh ti gyuru ŋoh mbiri itoh ata mgba ivoh a mina ta a gyuru a mla nnoh za. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Nza akyo za a de noh a na ma tohmoh amboh hwra akpi mboh la ŋoh ta a sa kuri anzoh a hwana, nga ŋoh mishi wa kuri ata hama awo za. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Nza akyo ka a de noh na wuwana la ti hehndeh wa ŋoh na aki inda, wa ŋoh hehndeh na nnoh aki zeh. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Nza akyo ka a kwere nnoh andromboh nga ŋoh, nza akyo za a fa kohfoh na anzoh, kama ha ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kira Na Amboh Ata Ma A fi Nnoh Ma Tomwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6:27-28</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />&lt;&lt;Ni sehreh noh tama a bleh la, &lt;Kira na atohngoh anzoh, ti leke akyo ata nza a fi noh ma tohmoh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Nehnehreh neh meh bleh noh la, kira nnoh na amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh, kwere Nnoh ma amboh ata ma a leh a nga noh iya, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />la ti bu noh mara Ada amohnoh ata nza a bu ma inza, ŋoh ka a kira nnoh ta a zanana ma amboh agugu tasa amboh alindeh mboh, ka a de awi za a ba ma amboh tufa yehlehleh tasa amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa a kira kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Nza ni kira nnoh na amboh ata ma a kira na amohnoh ma reh, a bu firoh umbo ni nati hunji noh? amboh sa hungroh gandu za maka a lisa dehreh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Nza ni kǝ tsifa nnoh na atsi amohnoh mboh ma, a bu umbo ni lisa ata nza a keh mgbiri mboh amoh reh? Ŋoh amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh maka lisa ika wohroh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Nza bu dehreh ti kǝ bu noh yehlehleh ma tswanza Ada amohnoh ma inza nza a bu yehlehleh reh.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nga Amboh Nza ma A bu na Wohroh kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />&lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh, la tufa yehlehleh amohnoh reh ta a sohroh a bu ata kyangwri mboh mata a nza kpeh. Nza ni lisa noh dehreh Ada ma inza a nati a te nnoh atoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni nati nga andromboh ma akyo ata nza a bu na wohroh kpeh, kama hehndeh wri drumu ma ikpi kpeh, tswanza amboh agugu mboh maka a lisa nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh tasa ma ikpi aki la kyangwri mboh mata riri mboh. meh ti bleh noh zizi amboh wohroh reh maa sa fanga amoh na kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Nza ni nati shingi akyo ata nza a bu na wohroh kpeh, kama kira la ivoh anzoh ata a mina ta a wina andromboh ta ivoh rya a kpa a leh a lisa reh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Nza a bu dehreh ngǝnga anzoh ta ka a bu na ayuhu ma. Ada anzoh ata nza ka a nza andromboh ata ni lisa na ayuhu reh, ta ka nga noh firoh alindeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni nati kwere Nnoh reh, kama lisa nnoh tswanza amboh agugu mboh reh kpeh, nza maka kira mata ka a hinga shi nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh tasa ma atsitsifi aki la kyangwri mata a nza mboh. meh ti bleh noh zizi, amboh wohroh reh maa sa fanga amoh nayo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Nza ni nati de kwere Nnoh, niye na anzoh nimeh ida ti hama anida anzoh, ti de kwere anzoh na na Ada ata maka a nza ŋoh kpeh. Ada ata nza a nza noh ma atsi huho reh neh, ka a nati nga nnoh andromboh ata nza ni kwere reh. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni bu noh nimeh kwere Nnoh, kama bleh noh vara tsifa tswanza amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, amboh ta nza ma a gu la nimeh vara tsifa ŋa Nnoh ka a nati a sehreh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Kama lisa nnoh tswanza mboh reh kpeh, Ada amohnoh a wina andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh feh mohnoh si kwere nnoh.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Ni nati kwere Nnoh reh dehreh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">&lt;Ada ambohroh ata nza a bu ma inza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Isa anzoh ta bu agba,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Kpra Agohmoh anzoh ta ka a ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">meh ti lisa andromboh ata nza ni kira meh ti lisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">ma inziyo areh tswanza nza maka lisa nimeh inza reh.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ti nga reh awumu irya ambohroh ata andrehmeh.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ti gu kpakpana ambohroh te kohhroh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">tswanza mbohroh meh kǝ te kohhroh na kpakpana amboh ata maka kpakpa na na ambohroh reh.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Kama gu reh na ma atsi ata ma a nati a tsara reh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">nnoh neh ti sa reh hwana nyi na ŋoh ata nza bu agugu reh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Nza ni te nnoh kohhroh na kpakpana kyangwri mboh na amohnoh reh, Ada mohnoh nza yama ma inza za ka soh ivoh yira na mohnoh. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Nza ni te nnoh kohhroh ni kpakpana kyangwri mboh reh kpeh, Ada amohnoh nza a nati a soh ivoh ma yira na amohnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">De Aniye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni nati de noh aniye, kama lafa nnoh tohmoh tswanza amboh agugu mboh nza maka a lisa reh kpeh, mboh reh maka de tohmoh la kyangwri mboh mata a nza mboh la ma de aniye. meh ti a bleh noh zizi, amboh wohroh ma a hunji fanga amoh nambri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Nza ni de aniye reh, wra tohmoh anzoh ti wo amehneh ma ikpi. <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />La kyangwri mboh mata a sohroh a nza la ni de aniye kpeh, ta ka a bu Ada mohnoh nza a bu ma huho ka a nza andromboh ata nza ni lisa na reh ka a te nnoh atoh.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asabara Ma Inza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Kama gya nnoh asabara amohnoh mboh ma inziyo areh kpeh, atsi ata shinga mboh tasa hohngoh ma a nati a nasa, tasa za ayuhu mboh ma a nati a fira na ayuhu. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />mohnoh neh gya nnoh asabara amohnoh mboh ma inza, atsi ata shinga mboh tasa hohngoh ma a nati a wina nasa mata a fira na ayuhu kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Atsi ata asabara anzoh nza a yama reh agohsoh anzoh za a nati a bu ma a huru.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zana Ata Itoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />&lt;&lt;iyo a tswanza zanana afitila ata itoh, nza iyo anzoh a zohhoh, itoh anzoh nambri a nati a bu na zanana. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Nza iyo anzoh neh a zohhoh kpeh, itoh anzoh nambri a nati a bu shini ma. Nza zanana ata nza a bu nimeh anzoh a bu shini ma reh, shini wohroh ka a nati a bu gaga lele!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnoh Tasa Asabara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Akyo a nati a wina te ndohmoh ma Ada mboh afri kpeh, ka a nati a leke anyimbehreh ta kira anyimbehreh, ha ta a lisa ma anyimbehreh alindeh ta a rina anyimbehreh. A nati a zohhoh ti dohsoh nnoh tufa Nnoh tasa hungroh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama Kohnoh Nnoh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />&lt;&lt;Nza bu dehreh meh bleh noh la ti kama kohnoh nnoh na andromboh ata nza ni nati rya nnoh, ha andromboh ata ni nati wa ti hunji noh fene kpeh, ha kuri ata ni nati were nnoh ma itoh amohnoh kpeh. Fene a keh irya kpeh? Itoh amohnoh za a keh kuri kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Nza nnoh akuku avereh inza mboh reh. Mboh reh maka a biya kpeh, maka a de awumu aye a ba afiya kpeh, maka a gya andromboh nimeh lohkehreh kpeh, Ada amohnoh ma inza neh a ka nga mboh irya. mohnoh reh ni bu noh alindeh keh mboh nnoh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />A ka bu anyi amohnoh nimeh kohnoh a ŋoh a nati a wina mishi ma ikpi a ŋoh ameh tuma a ŋoh ma inziyo?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />&lt;&lt;Tasa za ni leh kohnoh nnoh ma ikpi kuri were tsifa umbo? Ni nza noh akru agbeh bini nza a leh a te agba reh, ma te ndohmoh andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Meh bleh noh la, ŋoh Agohmoh solomon za na agba ma, a sohroh a jimi tswanza anyimbehreh nimeh akru agbeh mboh reh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Nza Nnoh a ka a jimi mara bini mboh, ata ma a bu ni fene andrehmeh ikya neh maka afya mboh nimeh dashi shira, ŋoh reh ka a nati a jimi nnoh a keh kpeh? mohnoh amboh nga agohsoh shidi. <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Nza a bu dehreh kama kohnoh nnoh la, &lt;A bu umbo meh nati rya?&gt; ha &lt;A bu umbo meh nati wa?&gt; ha &lt;A bu umbo meh nati were mi itoh?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />A bu amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, mboh ŋa maka a fa awumu ika ata areh. Ada mohnoh nza yama ma inza ka a wina la ni kira nnoh awumu ika ata areh. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />mohnoh neh jiji fa nnoh kpra Agohmoh Nnoh, tasa aki tufa yehlehleh, awumu mboh reh nambri ma a nati a mishi nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Nza bu dehreh kama kohnoh nnoh ni ikpi ikya kpeh, ikya a nati a bu na kohnoh ikpi a ŋoh, ibi mboh reh ma atsetse ma a bu na iya ata ikpi amoh.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kama Shimba Nnoh Akpi Ma Akyo kpeh.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6:37-38</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />&lt;&lt;Kama hwra akpi ma akyo kpeh, la mohnoh za Nnoh ta a kama a hwra noh akpi kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Hwra akpi ata nza ni shimba nnoh ma kyangwri mboh reh, Nnoh za a nati a shimba nnoh ika wohroh za. Ni gbugba ata nza ni tsara nnoh ma kyangwri mboh ni wohroh reh, Nnoh a nati a tsara nnoh ni ika wohroh za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />A bu lele feh ni leh nza ameh avuvu nimeh iyo atsi anzoh, nnoh neh ni sohroh kohnoh na mgbiri agbeh agba ata nza a yama nimeh iyo anzoh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ha neh ti a bleh ma atsi anzoh la, &lt;Ta meh ti fufa nnoh ameh avuvu nimeh iyo anzoh,&gt; neh mgbiri agbeh agba ta ka a treh a yama nimeh iyo anzoh? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Nnoh kyangwri agugu reh, jiji fufa mgbiri agbeh agba nza a yama nimeh iyo anzoh reh fya, sa a zohhoh nnoh nza alindeh atsi fufa ameh avuvu nimeh iyo atsi anzoh reh.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />&lt;&lt;Kama nga noh avava mboh andromboh ata nza a bu na zanana kpeh, kama nga noh atambri afiya mboh andromboh ata nza a bu ni zanana kpeh, Nza ni nga mboh, ma a nati a huhuya na hwana amoh, mata a gyuru a hwahwashi nnoh a te alulu.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwere nnoh, Fa noh, Kpa nnoh anida.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Kwere nnoh ma a nati nga nnoh, fa nnoh ni nati hunji noh, kpa nnoh anida ma a nati a vuru nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Akyo ata nza a kwere ma a nati a nga ŋoh, akyo ata nza a fa a nati a hunji, tasa akyo ata nza a kpa anida ma a nati a vuru ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Anyi nimeh amohnoh, ata amehreh ŋoh nza a kwere ŋoh afohfohnoh, neh ka a gu kpakpa a nga ŋoh? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ha neh nza amehreh reh ka a kwere ŋoh kpo, neh ka a gu iyoh a nga ŋoh? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />mohnoh nza ni bu noh agugu mboh, ni wina nga noh mara amohnoh mboh awumu alilehndeh, Nnoh bu Ada mohnoh nza a yama ni inza, ka a nati nga andromboh alindeh ma kyangwri amboh ata ma luhu ŋoh! <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />&lt;&lt;Andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh kyangwri mboh mata a lisa nnoh, mohnoh za lisa mboh nnoh, ata areh a bu akpi tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh mboh reh nza ma a bleh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anida Anjuriri tasa Anida Fesena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />&lt;&lt;Niye noh ma anida anjuriri. Anida ata nza a nati a de noh a na atsi lofona reh a fesena, aki gǝga wohroh reh a bu na iya kpeh, amboh niye ma aki wohroh reh ma bu gaga. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Aki ata nza a nati a de noh a na ti hunji noh fene reh neh a bu njuriri ma, aki reh a bu ni iya ma atsi gǝga, amboh gǝga aki wohroh reh ma a bu gaga kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbeh tasa Maraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Te nnoh ve na amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa a bleh reh, ma a nati a ba na amohnoh na kuri atashi mboh, nimeh amoh neh ma a bu ava aye mboh ata ma a nati a rya nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Ni nati wina mboh nnoh ma aki ndohmoh amoh mboh, kyangwri mboh Maka a wina fira mara agbeh nana anyi ma atohtoh, ha mata a wina fira mara agbeh mgbungba anyi na atohtoh? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Ka a bu dehreh za na aki wohroh agbeh ata nza a bu alindeh neh a ka a mara mara agbeh alindeh, agbeh ata nza bu abibi ka mara mara agbeh abibi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Agbeh alindeh a nati a wina mara mara agbeh abibi kpeh, ka a bu dehreh za agbeh abibi a nati a wina mara mara agbeh alindeh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Agbeh ata nza a sohroh a mara mara agbeh alindeh kpeh ma a nati a biri mata a gu a shebiri a na nimeh shira. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />A bu dehreh, na biroh ndohmoh amoh ni nati nza mboh nnoh wina.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mya meh Sohroh Wina nnoh kpeh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />&lt;&lt;A bu akyo ata nza ka a leh a fi meh la, &lt;Nnoh, Nnoh&gt; a nati aniye a na kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh kpeh. Ka a bu ŋoh ata nza a lisa andromboh ata Ada amya nza a yama nimeh inza nza a kira reh. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Ibi hwra akpi reh kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati a bleh meh la, &lt;Ada, Ada, Mbohroh meh sa tsifa bleh nimeh isa anzoh, tasa Mbohroh meh katsi amboh huru inyo mboh nimeh isa anzoh, tasa za mbohroh meh lisa agbugba ndohmoh nga nyiri gaga ma kyangwri mboh nimeh sa anzoh kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Mya neh meh nati bleh mboh la, &lt;Mya meh wina noh kpeh. Ta meh noh, mohnoh amboh te agugu mboh!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh Mina Mboh Ata Lomo Tasa Ata Duduna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />&lt;&lt;Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, akyo ata nza a sehreh tsifa amya ka tufa mboh, ka tswanza kyangwri lomo ata nza a mina afiya a ŋoh ma ikpi fa. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Nza awi a ba, fini mboh ma a nati a su a kate, inyo neh ka afo afiya reh. A nati sohroh a hwa kpeh, la ma a mina ma ikpi fa. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Akyo ata nza a sehreh tsifa amya neh, ta a tufa mboh kpeh, a nati tswanza kyangwri duduna ata nza a mina afiya a ŋoh ma ikpi asehngeh. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Awi a ba neh, fini mboh maka a su a kate, inyo neh ka afo afiya reh a hwa a hwrana a te abibi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuwana Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yeso nza ka a bleh tsifa amboh areh a treh, duma mboh maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma ni tsana a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />La ŋoh ta tsana mboh tswanza kyangwri ata nza a bu na wuwana reh, a sohroh a tswanza amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Bishi Kohmoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yeso nza ka a tamba anyi agbohgboh, duma mboh maka a leh tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Kyangwri anyi a bu na bishi kohmoh, ka a ba ba krumusu ŋoh ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, nza ni kira reh, nga meh wuwana meh ti bu fyafya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yeso ka tsitsi ivoh a ŋoh ka a bara ŋoh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu na kira amya, mya meh lisa nnoh ti bu fyafya,&gt;&gt; Bishi kohmoh reh ka a kate ma hwana anyimbehreh. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza feh, kama a bleh ma akyo andromboh kpeh. Nnoh neh na, ti tsana ikpi anzoh ma Firist ta a nza noh, ti nga ŋoh ngǝnga ata Musa ta ka a bleh reh, nnoh ti bleh na aniye anzoh la kyangwri mata a nza a wina la ni hunji wuwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma Ahwra Agba Amboh De Ita Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yeso nza ka a na kafarnahum, agba amboh de ita Romawa mboh, ka a ba na a ŋoh ka a leh kwere ŋoh la, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />&lt;&lt;Ada, ahwra amya a wuwana kpeh, a leh a te iya ma afiya, itoh a kwo a tamba tasa itoh a rina ŋoh gaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Mya meh nati na meh ti de wuwana na ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Agba amboh de ita reh neh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, mya meh tswa nnoh ti ba ikpi afiya amya kpeh, nnoh bleh tsifa anyimbehreh ma mareh ma, meh wina ahwra amya a nati a hunji wuwana. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Mya za meh bu ma hohroh wuwana akyo, tasa za meh bu na amboh de ita mboh za ma hohroh hwana amya, meh kǝ wina a bleh ma ata areh la &lt;Na anzoh!&gt; ka a na, meh ti gyuru a bleh ma anyi la &lt;Ba!&gt; ka a ba, meh ti bleh ma ahwra amya la, &lt;Lisa andromboh ata areh.&gt; ŋoh ka a lisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yeso nza a ka a sehreh dehreh ka a ŋara aniye ma, ka a bleh ma amboh nza ma a leh a tufa ŋoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh zizi, nimeh kyangwri Israila nambri meh hehreh nza akyo nga agohsoh gaga ata a wuwana tswanza kyangwri ata areh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Meh bleh noh la vara kyangwri ma a nati anyi mgba nnoh nerebi tasa mgba nnoh Nvishi a ba, tama a tuma irya irya ma akpo anyimbehreh mboh ma Ibrahim, tasa Ishaku, tasa Yakubu ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />amboh ata nza ma a zohhoh mata a bu ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh, maka a leke, ma a nati a fira mboh sangra nimeh shini agba, ma ta ka a leh a kpanga a rya anyini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Yeso neh ka a bleh ma agba amboh de ita Romawa mboh reh la,&lt;&lt;Na anzoh, ma a nati a lisa nnoh tswanza nza ni sa tsifa reh kira.&gt;&gt; Ma huru heri ahwra a ŋoh reh ka a hunji nana itoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Kyangwri mboh Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yeso nza ka a ba afiya Abitrusu, ka a nza Amwana Abitrusu nza a leh bishi avoh ma inzi. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Ka a bara ivoh ŋoh, bishi avoh reh ka ata ŋoh, ka a de a hinga ta ka shingi ŋoh a te ndohmoh.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nvishi nza ka a ba reh, maka a leh a fira amboh bishi inyo mboh a ba na Yeso gaga. Yeso a bleh tsifa tsene ma amboh huru agugu mboh tasa ata mgbiri bishi mboh ma a hunji wuwana. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />A lisa ata areh la tsifa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">&lt;&lt;Ka a fira bishi ambohroh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">ka a fira bishi mboh a kate anyi ma itoh ambohroh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh ble la ma A nati A tufa Yeso Ma a nati a wa iya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yeso nza ka a nza vara kyangwri mboh nza ma a goh ŋoh reh, ka a bleh la ma tamba a na amoh akachi ba fini akre. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />amboh tsana akpi Musa reh anyi ka a ba na a ŋoh ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, meh nati tufa nnoh na atsi ata ni nati na reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yeso neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Avava bini mboh ma a bu na dashi amoh mboh tasa akuku inza mboh za ma a bu na avru amoh mboh, amehreh kyangwri neh a bu na atsi leh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh anyi ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh, jiji ta meh ti na ni nyifo Ada amya fya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Yeso neh ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Tufa meh, ti ta amboh kwo mboh mata anyifo kohmoh amoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A de Inyo Agba Akuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh neh amboh tufa Yeso maka a tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />A bu a bleh a gya kpeh, inyo agba anyi ka a ba na a kwere ni ikpi fini reh, amwo ka leh aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh. Yeso feh ka a leh a ŋoh mmla. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma mmla maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, nga reh nvara! Mbohroh meh nati lofona ma amwo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nyiri nnoh tsifa umbo? mohnoh amboh ata ni bu noh na nga agohsoh shidi ma,&gt;&gt;Ka a de a hinga a hwa inyo reh tasa a kwere amwo reh, ka a kukuna nambri.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a nyiri maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;ata areh a bu kyangwri ika atamaa? Inyo tasa amwo mboh ma a sehreh tsifa a ŋoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh Bishi Inyo mboh Afri ma A hunji Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yeso nza ka a hwana a na akpo afiya Garasina mboh reh, amboh bishi inyo mboh afri ma a kate anyi ikpi nyifo kyangwri mboh a ba ba a hunji ŋoh. Ma a bu na wuwana gaga maka a shwa aki reh akyo a za a wina gǝga za kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Heri heri maka a fehfehsehna la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kira umbo na ambohroh nnoh amehreh Nnoh reh? Ha ni ba la ti nga reh iya feh ameh ambohroh sa a tswa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Nyi gbugba shidi vara Atambri afiya mboh ma a leh a rya irya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Inyo mboh reh maka a kwere Yeso la,&lt;&lt;Nza ni nati katsi reh kate reh, tohmoh reh na ni vara Atambri afiya mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Na nnoh amohnoh!&gt;&gt; Maka kate ka a na na aniye nimeh Atambri afiya mboh reh, Vara Atambri afiya mboh reh maka a gbo a na amoh fini maka a na na a kwo nimeh amwo. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />amboh sumu Atambri afiya mboh reh maka a gbo, maka a na amoh afiya a na na a bleh mboh andromboh ata ma a nza, tasa andromboh ata nza a hunji amboh bishi inyo mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Kyangwri mboh na akpo afiya reh nambri maka a na na a hunji Yeso, maka kwere ŋoh la ta a na ŋoh ata mboh akpo afiya amoh reh.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Kyangwri Bishi Kwo Tamba Mgba anyimbehreh Anyi Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yeso ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo, ta ka a hwana fini ka a na ŋoh Kafarnahum, akpo afiya agba. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Kyangwri amboh anyi maka a de kyangwri anyi nza a kwo a tamba mgba anyimbehreh nza a leh ma atakpa. Yeso nza ka a nza nga agohsoh amoh, ka a bleh ma kyangwri ata nza a kwo a tamba mgba anyimbehreh reh la,&lt;&lt;Wuwa agohsoh, amehreh amya! maa a te kohhroh na kpakpana anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, mgbiri amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh, maka a bleh ma itoh amoh la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a kya Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />A wina agohsoh amoh, Yeso ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu mboh a te ni bu noh ni kohnoh agugu ma agohsoh amohnoh umbo? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />A bu atamaa ka a keh zohhoh, mata a bleh la,&lt;Ma a te kohhroh kpakpana anzoh mboh,&gt;ha mata a bleh la, &lt;Hinga hehndeh&gt;? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Mya neh meh kira meh ti tsana noh la, amehreh kyangwri anu na wuwana ta a te kohhroh na kpakpana mboh ma inziyo areh.&gt;&gt; Ma huru ka a bleh ma kyangwri ata nza a kwo a tamba mgba anyimbehreh reh la,&lt;&lt;Hinga, gu atakpa anzoh na anzoh afiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Kyangwri reh ka a de a hinga ka a na ŋoh afiya. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Duma mboh nza maka a nza dehreh, maka nyiri gaga, tasa za maka riri Nnoh, ata nza a nga kyangwri mboh wuwana reh.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A fi Amatiyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yeso nza ka a buti a rya tohmoh na hehndeh a ŋoh reh, ka a nza kyangwri sa hungroh gandu anyi isa a ŋoh nza a bu Amatiyu, a tuma ma ida sa hungroh gandu reh, ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Hinga wa meh,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Amatiyu reh ka a de a hinga ka a wa ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yeso nza ka a leh a rya irya ma afiya Amatiyu, vara amboh sa hungroh gandu mboh tasa &lt;&lt;amboh kpakpana mboh&gt;&gt;maka a ba ba irya rya mboh ma a ŋoh tasa amboh tufa ŋoh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Farisiyawa mboh nza maka a nza dehreh, maka a luhu amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh la,&lt;&lt;A bu mboh a te feh Kyangwri tsana amohnoh a rya irya mboh ma amboh sa hungroh gandu tasa amboh kpakpana mboh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yeso nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;A zohhoh na amboh wuwana mboh mata a nza kyangwri nga wra kpeh, a bu amboh bishi mi. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Na ti na ni fa nza noh andromboh ata amgbasho Nnoh nza atsifa ma ikpi reh la, &lt;Meh kira la ti nza noh kwini ma itoh amohnoh, a bu ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh ata woaye mboh kpeh.&gt;Meh ba meh ti fi amboh tufa yehlehleh kpeh, a bu tsifa la meh ti fi amboh kpakpana mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A luhu Yeso ma Ikpi De Aniye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />amboh tufa Ayohana maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A ka a bu lele feh mbohroh ma Farisiyawa mboh meh kǝ de aniye, amboh nza ma tufa nnoh neh maka a de aniye kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Iziza atsifa afya afeh mboh nimeh ida wa afya reh, ma a nati a hungwa yira na atsifa afya afeh reh neh a treh a yama na amoh? ameh a nati a ba atsifa afya afeh reh ma a nati a gu ŋoh a yi mboh ata; a huru feh masa ka de aniye.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Ma ka wono atsi hwashina kuri atono na hwashi kuri afeh kpeh, wono reh a nati a hingrena, hwashina reh ta ka a lisa a keh gaga. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ma a nati a wina were amwo inabi afeh a na nimeh amgbo atono kpeh. Nza ma a lisa dehreh, amgbo atono reh a nati a hwrana, amwo inabi reh a nati sangrana. Ma, maka a were amwo inabi afeh nimeh amgbo afeh, ma a nati a tuma a yanda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kohmoh Anyifa Tasa Afya Bishi Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Nza ka a bu nimeh bleh tsifa mboh reh, agba kyangwri Yahudawa anyi ka a ba ba a susuna na a gboro krumusu ŋoh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Anyifa amya a kwo nehnehreh. Ba neh ti bara ŋoh na ivoh anzoh, a nati a hunji fene yama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yeso ka a de a hinga a tufa ŋoh, tasa amboh tufa ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Afya anyi ka a yama a te ahushi agrumavoh a hwa afri a leh a kpa imya, a ka a ba na mgba nyina a ŋoh, ka bara anene kuri a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Ka a bleh ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh bara kuri a ŋoh tsene, meh nati hunji Nvara&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yeso nza ka a gyuruna ka a nza ŋoh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Wuwa agohsoh, anyifa mya!!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nga agohsoh anzoh kǝ nga nnoh nvara&gt;&gt;Ma a huru heri afya reh ka a hunji wuwana.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yeso nza ka a na afiya agba kyangwri reh. Ŋoh nza ka a nza amboh wri afifi mboh tasa amboh sengǝ mboh, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Na nnoh aki amohnoh, Anyifa reh a kwo kpeh, a zaka a leh mla ma.&gt;&gt; Mboh neh maka a wene ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Nza maka a katsi kyangwri mboh reh a kate ma inziyo, ka niye a na na a de ivoh anyifa reh, a de a hinga. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Tsifa reh ka a treh atsifi ma akpo inzi reh.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma Amboh Hama iyo mboh Afri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yeso nza ka a hinga anyi ma a huru, amboh nza maka a nza atsifi kpeh mboh afri maka a tufa ŋoh, maka a fi ŋoh a vuru agba a kate la, &lt;&lt;Nza kwini ambohroh, amehreh Dawuda!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Nza ka aniye a na afiya anyi, amboh nza ma a nza atsifi kpeh reh maka a ba na Yeso, ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni sa nnoh tsifa amya reh kira nnoh la meh nati wina lisa andromboh ata areh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ha, Ada&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Ka bara iyo amoh mboh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh reh ta ka bu dehreh ma na amohnoh&gt;&gt;; <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />iyo amoh ka a vuruna. Yeso ka akpi mboh ashotoh la, &lt;&lt;Mata kama a bleh ma akyo tsifa reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Mboh neh maka a na amoh atsi hehndeh hwra tsifa nana Yeso reh a bleh a treh atsifi ma akpo inzi reh.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma Kyangwri Anyi ata nza a wina Tsifa kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Nza maka a nati a na amoh neh, maka a de kyangwri duduna anyi a bu na bishi inyo a ba na Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Nza ka a katsi Huru inyo a kate reh, kyangwri nza a kpa ashotoh reh a ka atsifa. Duma mboh reh maka a bleh la mboh ma a hehreh a nza andromboh ika ata areh ma Israila kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Farisiyawa mboh neh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A katsi huru inyo mboh reh na wuwana agba Agohmoh amboh amwo mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nza Kwini Kyangwri mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yeso ka a leh a hehndeh a treh akpokpo afiyafiya agbugba mboh tasa akǝkehreh mboh, ka a leh a tsana mboh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh, ka a leh a hwra tsifa nana a bleh ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza tasa ka a leh a nga amboh bishi mboh wuwana. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />nza ka a nza vara kyangwri mboh reh, ka nza kwini amoh, la ma a leh a wa iya tasa ma yama ma akpo anyimbehreh kpeh, ma a tswanza atashi mboh akyo tufa mboh a yama kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ma huru ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Fasa awumu aye ba afiya reh a bu gaga amboh ndohmoh mboh reh ma bu shidi ma. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Kwere nnoh Ada ata fasa awumu ba afiya reh, ta a de amboh ndohmoh mboh a ba aye fasa awumu reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A fi Amboh Tufa a ŋoh mboh Agrumavoh A hwa afri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Ka a fi amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri, ka a nga mboh wuwana ata ma a nati a wina fira huru agugu mboh a kate tasa ka a nga amboh bishi mboh tasa amboh ata ma a wuwana kpeh wuwana.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Amboh areh ma bu isa amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a bleh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh: ata anyimbehreh, a bu Siman ata maka a fi ŋoh la Abitrusu tasa atsini Andarawus; Yakubu amehreh zabadi, tasa atsini Ayohana; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filibus tasa Bartalomi; Toma tasa Amatiyu kyangwri sa hungroh gandu; tasa Yakubu amehreh Halfa, tasa Taddiyus, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Siman kyangwri Kaana tasa Yahuda Iskariyoti ata za tana Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tohmoh Amboh tufa A ŋoh mboh Agrumavoh A hwa Afri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Mboh agrumavoh da afri reh Yeso a tohmoh mboh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kama na nnoh na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh ha ti na nnoh akpo afiya Samariya mboh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Mohnoh neh ti na nnoh na atashi amboh ata nza ma bleh ata Israila. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Nza ni na nnoh reh, hwra tsifa reh bleh mboh nnoh la: &lt;Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh kǝ ba whiri.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Nga noh wuwana ma amboh bishi mboh, ti a yiri nnoh amboh ata ma a kwo mboh reh, ti nga nnoh wuwana ma amboh bishi kohmoh mboh mata bu fyafya, ti katsi nnoh huru inyo mboh. Nnoh nga nnoh wusu, mohnoh za ti nga mboh nnoh wusu. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Kama gu nnoh hungroh zinariya, ha ata azurfa, ha ata tagulla lafa nnoh na rishi ma chuhu yira amohnoh mboh kpeh; <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />kama de noh a kpanga ma hehndeh amohnoh reh kpeh, ha kuri afri, ha akpehtreh hwana, ha ikpoh; kyangwri ndohmoh a tswa ta a hunji fanga a ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Nza ni na nnoh akpo afiya agba ha akehreh reh, fa nnoh kyangwri ata nza a bu na agohsoh ti tuma noh ma afiya ŋoh te nnoh ibi ata ni nati hinga nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Nza ni nati niye nnoh ma afiya reh ti a bleh noh la, nga ma nnoh aki. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Nza afiya reh ma a sa noh, tuma alindeh anzoh reh ta a tamba ma ikpi afya reh, nza afiya reh ma a sa noh kpeh, ti de noh tuma alindeh amohnoh reh na nnoh amohnoh. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Akyo ata nza a sa noh kpeh, ha ta a leke sehreh tsifa amohnoh reh, ti kpohkpoh huru were mboh nnoh ma a huru ti kate nnoh ma afiya reh na nnoh amohnoh. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Meh ti bleh noh zizi, ma a nati a nza kwini Sodom tasa Gomora a keh kyangwri mboh nza ma a bu ma akpo inzi agba reh ma ibi hwra akpi.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iya Ata A buti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mk 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />mya meh tohmoh nnoh kate tswanza atashi mboh nimeh Ava aye. Nza a bu dehreh ti bu noh amboh lomo mboh tswanza iyoh mboh, tasa za ti bu noh tswanza ikukuba ata nza a wina andromboh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Lisa nza noh kyangwri mboh reh feh, ma a nati a de noh a na ma ida ika, mata a mla nnoh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Ma a nati a de noh a na ma tohmoh amboh hwra akpi mboh tasa Agohmoh mboh ma ikpi amya, la ni nati bleh na aniye anzoh tsifa alindeh ma ikpi amya tasa ma tohmoh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Nza ma a de noh reh, kama kohnoh nnoh na andromboh ata ni nati a bleh noh reh kpeh. Ma a nati a nga noh andromboh ata nza ni nati a bleh noh reh na ameh wohroh. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />A bu mohnoh ni nati tsifa nnoh kpeh, a bu huru Ada mohnoh ma a leh atsifa nimeh amohnoh.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Atsi a nati a wina kama astini a na la mata a mla a tavoh, Ada za ta nga mboh amehreh ŋoh, amehreh za ma a nati a wuwa ikpi ma alehmeh amoh mboh, mata a mla mboh a sangra. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nati a leke nnoh tsifa isa amya, ŋoh ata neh nza a shi a wuwana a na trina ŋoh a nati nvara. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Nza ma a nga noh iya ma akpo afiya anyi reh, gbo na nnoh akpo anyi. Meh bleh noh zizi la ni nati hehndeh treh nnoh afiyafiya Israila mboh reh nambri feh amehreh kyangwri sa kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa mboh reh ka a wina a keh kyangwri tsana a ŋoh kpeh, ha ahwra ta a wina a keh Ada ida a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />A zohhoh anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ta a tswanza kyangwri tsana a ŋoh, ahwra ta a tswanza Ada ida a ŋoh. Nza maka a fi kyangwri afiya reh la Baalzabul, amboh afiya a ŋoh mboh reh mata ka a fi ŋoh la anyi?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akyo ata Meh nati Nyiri Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />&lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh kama nyiri mboh nnoh kpeh. Andromboh ata nza ma ma a hama a yama ata ma a nati a wina vuru kate kpeh, tasa za ha andromboh huho ata ma a nati a wina tsana kate kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Andromboh ata mya nza ni leh bleh noh nashi ni reh ni nati gyuru bleh kate nnoh na nnoh, tasa andromboh ata nza ma a bleh noh ma ashotoh reh, ka shi nnoh ma ikpi tsitsi ida feh si hwra bleh noh. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Kama nyiri nnoh amboh ata ma nati a wina mla itoh a kwo kpeh, mboh neh ma a nati a wina gu fene kpeh. Nyiri nnoh Nnoh ata nza a nati a wina mla itoh tasa fene nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Maka a rifa na ichuchiri afri kabo anyimbehreh kpeh? anyimbehreh neh nimeh amoh a nati a wina hwa ma inzi la Ada amohnoh ta a wina kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Shina ikpi amohnoh mboh za ma a bleh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Nza a bu dehreh, kama nyiri nnoh kpeh. Ni keh nnoh vara akuku ichuchiri mboh reh.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana la ni kira na Yeso Ma Tomwo Kyangwri mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Akyo ata nza a tsana la ŋoh a bu amya ni tohmoh kyangwri mboh, mya za meh nati tsana la ŋoh a bu amya ni tohmoh Ada amya nza a yama ma inza. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Akyo ata neh nza a tana la ŋoh a wina meh kpeh ni tohmoh kyangwri mboh, mya za meh nati tana la mi wina ŋoh kpeh ma tohmoh Ada mya nza a yama ma inza.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meh de Tuma Alindeh Ba kpeh A bu Mlana mi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Kama gu nnoh la meh ba meh ti de tuma alindeh ba nnoh ma inziyo areh kpeh, a bu tuma alindeh meh de ba kpeh, meh de ambya gara ŋa ba. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Meh ba neh meh ti gyuru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">&lt;&lt;Amehreh ta leke alehmeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">anyifa ta a leke akre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">afya amehreh ta a leke akre agba,<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh reh, a bu kyangwri amboh afiya anzoh mboh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza kira alehmeh ha akre a keh meh, a tswa ta bu amya kpeh; akyo ata nza a kira amehreh ŋoh ha anyifa ŋoh a keh meh a tswa ta bu amya kpeh; <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />tasa za akyo ata nza a nati a wina gu gbohrohgboh a ŋoh a tufa meh kpeh, a tswa ta bu amya kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Akyo ata nza a kira ta nvara na fene a ŋoh, a nati a hunji kpeh. Akyo ata nza a gu fene a ŋoh a tavoh tsifa amya, a nati a hunji.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Firoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mk 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a sa noh reh, a sa meh za, tasa za akyo ata nza a sa meh a sa akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh reh. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Akyo ata nza a sa kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh la ŋoh bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh, a nati a hunji firoh a ŋoh anyi na kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh, tasa za akyo ata nza a sa kyangwri tufa yehlehleh nimeh isa tufa yehlehleh, a nati a hunji ngǝnga anyi na kyangwri tufa yehlehleh reh. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Akyo ata nza a nga ma anyimbehreh nimeh akǝkehreh amboh areh hohndoh amwo agbalala nimeh isa amboh tufa amya mboh reh, meh ti bleh noh zizi, ngǝnga a ŋoh reh a nati a gǝga ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Amboh sa tohmoh mboh nyi na Ayohana Kyangwri wra Batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yeso nza ka a gohroh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri a treh reh, a ka a hinga anyi ma a huru a na a ŋoh atsi tsana tasa atsi hwra tsifa Nnoh bleh ma akpokpo afiyafiya Galili mboh.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Ayohana nza a bu ma ida ka reh, a ka sehreh andromboh ata Kristi nza a leh a lisa reh, ka tohmoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh a na na a ŋoh, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />tama luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh wohroh ata nza ni nati ba reh, ha meh ti kya iyo na akyo nyi tse?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yeso kira la, &lt;&lt;Gyuru na ni bleh noh ma Ayohana reh andromboh ata nza ni sehreh noh tasa andromboh ata nza ni nza noh: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />amboh hama iyo maka a hunji nza atsifi, amboh bishi kohmoh mboh za maka bu fyafya, amboh gbo na a gboro maka a hinga a hehndeh, amboh kpa ashotoh maka a sehreh, amboh kwo mboh za maka gyuru a yiri mboh a ba na fene, tasa maka a bleh ma amboh te iya mboh za tsifa nana. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Te atoh a bu na kyangwri wohroh ata nza a nati a hwa kpeh ma aki tufa meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />amboh tufa Ayohana mboh nza maka a bu ti na amoh reh, Yeso ka a bleh ma duma mboh tsifa ma ikpi Ayohana reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kate nati nza noh umbo ma hohroh baba reh? A bu amgba bini ata inyo nza ka afo a kakama reh? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Nza bu dehreh kpeh, ni kǝ nati nza noh umbo? ni kǝ nati nza noh kyangwri na akuri alilehndeh? Uwa, amboh were akuri alilehndeh ma a kasa ma afiya Agohmoh mboh mi. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Feh ni kǝ nati nza noh umbo? Kyangwri sa Tohmoh Nnoh a bleh? Haa, Meh bleh noh, a keh kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Areh a bu ŋoh Ayohana mata ka a ŋa la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">&lt;Meh nati jitomo kyangwri tohmoh amya ba na amohnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">a nati a ba ti a jiji a lisa nnoh aki amohnoh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />meh bleh noh zizi, Nimeh amboh ata afya nza a mara mboh, ma a hehreh a mara akyo ata nza a keh Ayohana kyangwri a wra batisma reh kpeh; Nimeh akehreh amoh neh amboh ata nza ma a bu ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a keh ŋoh agba. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Nza ka anyi na ameh ata Ayohana kyangwri a wra batisma ta ka a leh ahwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh reh a gu a ba te nehnehreh, kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a tuma kputuna, amboh kputu reh ma a kira la mata a sa kpra Agohmoh reh na wuwana. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh mboh reh nambri tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh tama sa tsifa bleh ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh a gu a ba a te na Ayohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Nza ni nati kira ti sa nnoh, ŋoh areh a bu Iliya ata ta ka a nati a ba reh. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh, ta a sehreh.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />&lt;&lt;Meh nati tsara ika ata areh ni umbo? Ma a tswa nza amehreh mboh ma a tuma ma kpakpranda ka a fi amoh mboh:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />&lt;&lt;Meh wri afifi gu afya kavoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">ni sohroh kira nnoh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">ma gu amumu kwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">ni sohroh kpanga nnoh kpeh&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ayohana tana a ba dehreh a rya irya kpeh tasa a wa amwo kpeh, maka a bleh la, &lt;A bu na huru inyo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Amehreh Kyangwri ta ka a ba reh, tana a rya irya tasa ta a wa, maka a bleh la, &lt;Nza nnoh kyangwri ata areh! A rya irya tasa za a wa ni nza kpeh, a de iza na amboh sa hungroh gandu tasa amboh kpakpana mboh!&gt; Lomo Nnoh reh neh a tsana la a bu zizi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ye na Akpokpo Afiyafiya Amboh ata Nza ma ta Akeki Agugu Amoh Mboh Kpeh reh.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Yeso neh ka a buti kpi ashotoh ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh atsi ŋoh nza na a lisa agbugba ndohmoh a ŋoh mboh ata nga nyiri reh, telema ma la a leke mata ta aki agugu amoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, kyangwri korasinu mboh! iya agba na amohnoh, kyangwri Betsaida mboh! Agbugba ndohmoh mya nza ni lisa na amohnoh ma a bleh la meh ti ni lisa ma Taya tasa Sidon reh, bu kyangwri tama a gyuruna ta aki agugu amoh mboh reh mata kpanga a were akuri hwahwashina na atoh shira mboh ma itoh. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ta meh ti bleh noh zizi la, Nnoh a nati a keh nza kwini kyangwri Taya mboh tasa amboh Sidon mboh ibi hwra akpi reh a keh nnoh mohnoh. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Mohnoh kyangwri Kafarnahum mboh! Ni kira nnoh la Nnoh ta a gu nnoh a ka ma avereh inza? Uwa, a nati a gu nnoh a shebiri a na ma inziyo kwo! Bu tama a bleh la agbugba ndohmoh mboh mya nza ni lisa na amohnoh reh ma a lisa ma Sodom mboh, bu tama a treh a yama a gu a ba a te andrehmeh areh. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ta meh ti bleh noh zizi la, Nnoh a nati a keh nza kwini inzi Sodom mboh ibi hwra akpi reh a keh nnoh mohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba Nnoh na Amya Ti Ba bu Tuma Fo Nnoh.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Na ameh wohroh Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mi riri nnoh, Ada, Nnoh ata inza tasa ata inziyo, ni huho awumu amboh areh ma amboh wina lomo tasa amboh kpeh amgbasho, ni vuru ma amehreh akǝkehreh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Haa, Ada, ata areh a bu andromboh ata nza akuku nnoh ahroh ti lisa.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />&lt;&lt;Ada amya a nga meh awumu mboh reh nambri. Akyo mishi a wina amehreh a ŋoh kpeh a bu alehmeh ma, tasa akyo a mishi a wina alehmeh a ŋoh kpeh a bu amehreh a ŋoh ma tasa amboh ata amehreh Nnoh nza a seh mboh ta vuru ikpi a ŋoh a kate mboh reh.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />&lt;&lt;Ba nnoh na amya nambri ma amohnoh amboh kohhoh tasa amboh gugu, meh nati nga nnoh fo. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Gu nnoh iya amya reh ma ikpi amohnoh, ti nza nyi nnoh na amya, mya reh meh bu ve tasa agohsoh amya a kukuna, tasa za ni nati hunji fo ma fene anzoh. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Tsifa iya amya reh a bu na iya kpeh tasa gugu amya reh arishi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nnoh Ata Ibi Asabar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Na ameh wohroh Yeso nza ka a gǝga ma inzi akroh ma ibi asabar. amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh inyo ka a keh mboh maka a leh a tanga yohroh akpi akroh reh a rya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Farisiyawa mboh reh nza maka a nza dehreh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza! amboh tufa anzoh mboh reh ma a bu ti lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh mata a lisa ma ibi asabar kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />A ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni hehreh a bleh nza noh andromboh ata Dawuda ta ka a lisa na ameh ata ŋoh tasa ziza mboh nyo ta ka a keh mboh reh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Ka aniye a na ma ida Nnoh, ŋoh tasa ziza mboh maka rya irya ata nza ma a kehsheh a gya ma Agba Firist mboh tsimoh, a zohhoh mata a lisa dehreh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ha, ni hehreh bleh nza noh nimeh amgbasho akpi reh la, ma ibi asabar Agba Firist mboh nimeh ida Nnoh maka a kputu akpi ata ibi asabar, wohroh reh ma a de mboh na kpakpana kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Meh ti bleh noh, akyo ata nza a keh ida Nnoh reh a bu uwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ma a bleh la tini wina noh tsifa Nnoh ta ka a bleh reh, &lt;Meh kira nza kwini, a bu ngǝnga nana agohsoh ata woaye kpeh,&gt; Bu ma a bleh la ni wina noh ata areh, ni nati lofo nnoh nnoh amboh ata nza ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh reh. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />A bu amehreh Kyangwri reh nza a bu Ada ata ibi asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri ata Ivoh a ŋoh Anvinvina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Nza ka a hinga anyi ma a huru, a ka aniye a na ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Kyangwri anyi ivoh a ŋoh anvinvina kǝ shi ma a huru, a bu ti bana la, mboh mata a de Yeso ni kpakpana, maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A zohhoh mata a nga wuwana ma kyangwri bishi ibi asabar?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />A ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Anyi amohnoh a bu na atashi neh a ka a hwa ma itsiyo ibi asabar, ni nati kpi kate nnoh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Kyangwri a keh atashi! Nza a bu dehreh a zohhoh mata a lisa ndohmoh alindeh ma ibi asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ma huru a ka a bleh ma kyangwri ata ivoh ŋoh nza anvinvina reh la ta a sara ivoh a ŋoh reh a kate, a ka a sara a kate a ka a zohhoh a tswanza ata anyi reh. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Kyangwri Farisiyawa mboh neh maka a kate, maka a fa akeki ata ma a nati a mla Yeso reh A kwo.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bu Seh Ahwra Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Nza ka a wina dehreh, Yeso ka a kpina anyi a huru. Duma agba maka a tufa ŋoh, a ka nga wuwana ma amboh bishi mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Ka a bleh mboh la, ma a kama a na na a bleh akyo mboh ha ŋoh ba anyi kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Areh ka bu dehreh la tsifa anyi ma aniye Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Areh a bu ahwra amya ata mya nza ni seh ŋoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Areh bu ŋoh ata fene mya nza ni kira ata nza akuku meh ahroh reh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Meh nati were Huru amya na a ŋoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">tasa a nati a bleh tsifa hwra akpi a zizi a bleh ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />A nati a were gohroh ha la, ta a kpanga a kate kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">akyo a nati a sehreh agba ŋoh ma akeki mboh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Kokro ata kǝ ba whiri ta a kyana reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">a nati a wina kya kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">aluguni afitila ata kǝ ba whiri ta a kwo za,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">a nati a mlenze kpeh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">a nati a nata na hwra akpi a zizi ta a hunji rya tohmoh.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Nimeh sa ŋoh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma a nati gya agohsoh amoh na isa ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso mboh ma Baalzabul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mk 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ma huru maka a de kyangwri anyi a bu na bishi inyo a ba ŋoh, a nza atsifi kpeh, a wina tsifa kpeh Yeso ka a nga ŋoh wuwana, a ka a nza tasa ta ka a wina tsifa. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma maka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Areh a kama a nati bu amehreh Dawuda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Farisiyawa mboh neh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Areh a nati a bu na huru agba amoh Baalzabul ma, Agohmoh inyo mboh, kyangwri reh nza a wina katsi huru inyo mboh reh a kate.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yeso ka a wina kohnoh amoh a nza ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh ata inza ata nza a gafana ni itoh a ŋoh a nati a hwa, tasa akpo afiya agba ha afiya ata nza a gafana ni itoh a ŋoh a nati a shi kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Nza Agugu a katsi agugu a kate, a gafa na na itoh a ŋoh. A nati a te lele kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh ta a shi? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Nza mya meh katsi huru inyo mboh kate na wuwana Baalzabul, amboh tufa amohnoh mboh reh neh? a bu na wuwana anyi ma a katsi mboh a kate? A bu amboh tufa amohnoh mboh ma a nati hwra akpi amohnoh ma ikpi wohroh. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Nza a bu na huru Nnoh neh mya nza ni katsi huru inyo mboh reh kate, wohroh neh a ka bu kpra Agohmoh Nnoh kǝ tamba ba ma ikpi amohnoh.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />&lt;&lt;Akyo anyi a nati a wina vasa afiya kyangwri wuwana ta aniye a na na a fira awumu a ŋoh kpeh, a nati a jiji a de kyangwri wuwana reh a lafa feh kpeh? sa a wina vasa afiya a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na amya kpeh a fi meh tohmoh, tasa akyo ata nza a shingi meh a kpa a suhru kpeh a bu ti kpa sasara mi. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Tasa za meh ti bleh noh la ma a nati a wina te kohhroh na kpakpana kyangwri mboh reh ha bu ika tama tasa mata a kya Nnoh, kpakpana ata nza a bu ma ikpi kya huru Nnoh neh ma a nati a wina gu te kohhroh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Akyo ata nza a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi amehreh Kyangwri ma a nati a gu te kohhroh, Akyo ata nza a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi huru zanana ma a nati a gu a te kohhroh kpeh ha ika ata ameh ata areh ha ika ata ameh amboh ba.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbeh tasa Maraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />&lt;&lt;Lisa agbeh ta a zohhoh maraa za a nati a zohhoh, ha lisa agbeh ta a te abibi maraa za a nati a bu abibi, maka a nza agbeh a wina anyi na maraa. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mohnoh alohsoh anu mboh, ni nati lisa nnoh lele feh si bleh noh andromboh alindeh mohnoh neh nza ni bu noh agugu reh? Aniye ka a bleh andromboh ata nza a bu na su anyi ma agohsoh. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Kyangwri alindeh ka de andromboh alindeh a ba anyi ma ganzi alindeh a ŋoh reh, tasa agugu kyangwri ka a de andromboh nza a bu ata agugu a ba anyi ma ganzi ata agugu a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />&lt;&lt;Ta meh ti bleh noh, tsifa abibi ata nza bu wusu ma kyangwri mboh nza ma leh a bleh reh, ma a nati a bleh na aniye amoh ibi hwra akpi Nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Anyi na tsifa anzoh ma a nati a ta noh avoh, tasa anyi na tsifa anzoh ma a nati lofo noh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisiyawa mboh ma A luhu Kpra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mk 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ma huru mgbiri Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, meh kira la meh ti nza kpra agba anyi na anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />A ka kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh amboh ameh ata areh ni bu noh kyangwri abibi, tasa za ni lisa noh yehlehleh kpeh ma Nnoh! ma a kira mata a nza kpra, ma a nati a tsana mboh kpra anyi kpeh, a bu kpra ata Ayunana kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />A tswanza Ayunana ta ka a te ibi atatoh tasa shini atatoh nimeh yira kpo agba reh, a nati bu dehreh na amehreh Kyangwri za a nati a te ibi atatoh tasa shini atatoh nimeh agohsoh inziyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Kyangwri Nineba mboh ma a nati a hinga a shi ma ibi hwra akpi na ika amboh ata ameh ata areh mata a tsana mboh la ma a lisa yehlehleh kpeh, tsifa la maa ta aki agugu amoh mboh reh na ameh ata Ayunana ta ka hwra bleh mboh tsifa Nnoh reh, nehnehreh nza noh akyo ata nza a keh Ayunana reh a yama uwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Agohmoh afya mboh ata mgba afo a nati a hinga a shi ma ikpi hwra akpi na ika amboh ata areh mata la kpeh na a ŋoh; ŋoh anyi mgba trina inziyo la ŋoh a ba ŋoh ta a sehreh lomo Solomon, nehnehreh andromboh nza a keh Solomon reh a bu uwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Huru Agugu reh A gyuru a ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />&lt;&lt;Nza huru agugu reh a kate anyi ma itoh akyo, a nati a na a ŋoh ta a na na a hehndeh a kakamana a fa atsifi ŋoh ta niye a soh ikpi a ka a hunji kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />A nati a kohnoh la, &lt;Ta meh ti gyuru na afiya mya na amehmeh reh yama.&gt; Nza ka a gyuru a na reh, a ka hunji afiya reh wusu, kǝ bu fyafya tasa ma a lisa a gya alindeh. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />A ka a na na a fira ashidi huru agugu mboh atehrehkifi na anyi amboh nza ma a keh ŋoh te inyi, maka a na amoh na a tuma ma a huru. Trina kyangwri reh a te abibi a keh ata ta ka a jiji a yama reh. A nati bu dehreh na kyangwri ika ata ameh ata areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akre Yeso Mboh Ma Atsini Mboh.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yeso nza ka a treh atsifa ni duma, akre tasa atsini mboh maka a shi ma inziyo, ma bu ti kira ma ta atsifa na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Akyo anyi ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Atono tasa atsi anzoh mboh ma a shi ma inziyo, ma kira mata atsifa na anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu anyi a bu nna, tasa bu anyi mboh ma bu atsi amya mboh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ka a bu ti tsana ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;amboh areh ŋa ma bu nna tasa atsi mya mboh. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />A bu akyo wohroh nza a te ndohmoh Ada nza a bu ma inza ŋoh nza a bu atsi mya tasa asra mya tasa nna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kakranda ma Ikpi Biya Awumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ibi wohroh heri Yeso ka a kate anyi ma afiya ka a na a ŋoh na tuma ma akachi fini. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Duma agba maka a dohsohna a goh ŋoh a ka aniye a tuma nimeh gbogblondo amwo, neh kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a shi ma agboh inziyo ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ma huru ka a bleh kakranda mboh gaga, la, &lt;&lt;kyangwri hafa anyi a na atsi biya biroh a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Nza a bu ti hwina biroh reh, mgbiri tswa maka a hwa ma aki agba, akuku mboh maka a tanga a rya nambri. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />amboh mgbiri ma a hwa ma ikpi kpakpa mboh ma inzi, atsi ata avru nza a yama gaga kpeh. Ka a hinga a ka na gbugbo, avru reh anyina ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Neh nnoh nza ka a kate reh, ka afya mara bini mboh ma asho mboh reh, maka a fifirohna telema la ariri amoh aniye kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mgbiri amboh tswa maka a sangrana a na hohroh atohtoh mboh, atohtoh mboh reh maka a hinga a hahamba awumu mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Mgbiri biroh tswa zi za maka a hwa ma inzi alindeh, ma a huru awumu ka a zohhoh alindeh agrumavoh da agrumavoh, tasa agrumavoh da atehrehkifi tasa agrumavoh da atatoh a keh andromboh ata mata a ka a jiji a hwina reh. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sehreh tsifa reh, ta a sehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lomo Kakranda reh.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a ba ba a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa mboh feh ni kǝ kira ti tsifa ni kyangwri ni mgba kakranda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Ka kira la,&lt;&lt;Lomo wina tsifa ayuhu kpra Agohmoh inza reh ma a nga noh mohnoh mi, a bu mboh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Akyo ata nza a bu ni wohroh, ma a nati a nga ŋoh a mishi, amoh a nati kpiri a bu gaga. Akyo ata nza a bu ni wohroh kpeh, ata nza a bu ni wohroh shidi ma reh, ma a nati a sa a hwana anyi na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />A bu wohroh reh mi nza ni kǝ tsifa na amoh ni mgba kakranda mboh reh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">&lt;&lt;Ma a bu na iyo, maka a sohroh a nza kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">ma a bu na ashotoh, maka a sohroh a sehreh ha mata a sehreh a wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Areh la, tsifa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">&lt;Ni nati kǝ sehreh noh, ni kǝ nati sehreh wina noh kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">ni nati kǝ nza noh, ni kǝ nati nza wina noh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kyangwri amboh reh agohsoh amoh kǝ leh wuwana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">a te mboh iya mata a sehreh na ashotoh amoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">tasa ma a hama iyo amoh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">kavoh kpeh reh neh bu ma a nza na iyo amoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">mata a sehreh na ashotoh amoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">mata a wina na agohsoh amoh mboh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">mata a gyuruna, meh ti nga mboh wuwana&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Te atoh a bu na iyo amohnoh mboh, la maka a nza, tasa ashotoh amohnoh mboh, la maka a sehreh. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Mya meh bleh noh zizi, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh tasa amboh tufa aki yehlehleh mboh gaga tama a leh a fa la mboh mata a nza andromboh ata mohnoh nza ni nza noh reh, mboh neh tama a nza kpeh, la mboh mata a sehreh andromboh mohnoh nza ni sehreh noh reh mboh ma a nati a sehreh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso a lisa a bleh Tsifa ma ikpi Kakranda Kyangwri biya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />&lt;&lt;Sehreh nnoh kakranda biya biroh reh a tsana la: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh ma a sohroh a sehreh a wina kpeh, ŋoh ata nza bu agugu reh a ba ti sa andromboh ata nza ma a biya ma agohsoh amoh reh a hwana. amboh wohroh ma a bu biroh amboh nza ma a hwa ma ikpi aki agba gǝga reh. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />biroh amboh ata nza ma a hwa a na ma ikpi kpakpa reh ma a tswanza kyangwri nza a sehreh tsifa Nnoh ta a sa a de na johjoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />A bu na ariri kpeh, a shi a yanda kpeh. Iya neh ka a ba ikpi tsifa reh, a ka a hwa a na a ŋoh ni gbugbo. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />biroh amboh ata nza ma a hwa a na ma hohroh atohtoh reh ma a tswa nza kyangwri ata nza a sehreh tsifa Nnoh reh, kohnoh awumu inziyo ata ameh ata areh tasa kira asabara mboh reh ma a ha tsifa reh te agba, a ka za a bu na ndohmoh za kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />biroh ata nza a hwa a na ma inzi alindeh reh a tswa nza kyangwri nza a sehreh tsifa Nnoh reh a wina. A lisa awumu aye, a hunji agrumavoh da agrumavoh, agrumavoh da atehrehkifi ha agrumavoh da atatoh ta ka a hafa reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda ma ikpi Bini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yeso ka gyuru a bleh mboh kakranda anyi za: la, &lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh a tswanza kyangwri ata nza a biya biroh alindeh ma aye a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Nza maka a leh mla nambri ma amoh, ŋoh ata nza a fi noh ma tohmoh reh ka a biya bini abibi ma hohroh yohroh alindeh ma aye reh, ta ka a na ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Awumu reh nza ka a hinga a te akpi, mara bini mboh za maka a te.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />&lt;&lt;Ahwra kyangwri aye reh maka a ba na a ŋoh, maka a luhu la, &lt;Ada ambohroh, meh kama bleh la timi biya biroh alindeh ŋa ma aye reh? A te lele feh biroh bini abibi a gyuru anyi mma a ba ba a te?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Ka kira la, &lt;A bu agugu nza a fi noh ma tohmoh a te ndohmoh ata areh.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">&lt;&lt;Ahwra kyangwri reh maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;ni kira meh ti na ni titra bini reh?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Ka a kira la, &lt;Ma,&gt; &lt;Nza ni nati titra nnoh bini reh, ni nati gǝga mmla nnoh yohroh Alikama reh. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Ta nnoh bini tasa yohroh alikama mboh reh ma a hinga dehreh, tana a bu na ameh fasa feh. Na ameh wohroh meh ti bleh amboh fasa mboh reh mata a seh abibi reh a lafa ma avohvoh a were a na ma shira; amboh ata alilehndeh mboh reh mata a de mboh a na ma lohkehreh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Yohroh Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />A bleh mboh kakranda anyi za la, &lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh a tswanza yohroh agbeh kumu, ata kyangwri a gu a na na a biya ma aye a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />A bu akehreh nimeh biroh anzoh mboh reh nambri, nza kǝ a hinga a te agba a ka a keh agbeh mboh agba nambri ma aye reh, neh akuku mboh nza ma a yama ma avereh inza maka la avru amoh ma avohvoh asho mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakranda ma ikpi Yisti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />A bleh mboh kakranda anyi za la, &lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh a tswanza yisti ata afya nza ka a gu a tohfoh a na nimeh mgbokro gaga yisti reh ka a de mgbokro reh a te itoh ŋoh nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A te Ndohmoh na Kakranda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yeso a bleh ma duma mboh tsifa amboh areh nambri nimeh kakranda; a bleh mboh andromboh anyi a hinga kpeh ka a leh atsifa na amoh nimeh kakranda ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />La tsifa kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">&lt;&lt;Meh nati vuru aniye amya na mgba kakranda mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Meh nati a bleh kate andromboh mboh nza a bu mi huho nyi ameh ata mata ka a lisa inziyo agba areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tsana Kakranda Bini Ma Hohroh awumu reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />A ka ata duma mboh reh ka aniye a na a ŋoh mgba afiya. amboh tufa Yeso mboh maka a ba na a ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Vuru tsana reh lomo kakranda bini ma aye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Ka kira la, &lt;&lt;Ata nza a biya biroh alindeh reh a bu amehreh Kyangwri reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Aye reh bu inziyo agba, biroh alindeh reh ma bu amehreh kpra Agohmoh ata inza mboh. Bini abibi reh a bu ŋoh ata nza bu agugu reh, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />tasa akyo ata nza a fi noh ma tohmoh nza a biya biroh abibi reh, a bu ŋoh nza a bu agugu reh. Fasa awumu reh a bu trina inziyo, tasa amboh fasa mboh reh ma bu amehreh tohmoh Nnoh mboh.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />&lt;&lt;Tswanza nza ma atitra bini abibi a were a na nimeh shira reh, a nati bu dehreh na ameh trina inziyo reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />amehreh Kyangwri a nati tohmoh amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh mboh, ma a nati a dohdohsoh kpakpa kpa hwana ata nza ka a de kyangwri mboh kpakpana reh tasa amboh te agugu mboh nambri anyi ma kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Ma a nati a were mboh a na nimeh agǝgǝgri shira, atsi ata ma a nati kpanga a rya anyini. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Amboh tufa yehlehleh ma a nati a zana tswanza noh ma kpra Agohmoh Ada amoh. Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh, ta a sehreh.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Asabara ata Nza A bu ma huho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />&lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh inza reh a tswanza asabara ma a huho ma aye. Kyangwri anyi ka a hunji, ka a gyuru a gu a na a huho ma akpo anyi tse, nimeh johjoh a ŋoh a na ŋoh na rifa na awumu ŋoh nambri ta ka a sa aye reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakranda ma Ikpi Kpakpa Hungroh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />&lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh inza reh a tswanza ata areh, Kyangwri a hehndeh a fa kpakpa hungroh ata nza a bu alindeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Nza ka a hunji anyi a zohhoh ni nza kpeh, a ka a na a ŋoh na a rifa na awumu a ŋoh nambri ta ka a ba ba a sa.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda arishi de kpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />&lt;&lt;Tasa za, kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh a tswanza arishi de kpo ata nza ma a kya nimeh amwo ta a de biroh kpo mboh reh ma a sa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Nza arishi reh kǝ su, amboh kya arishi reh maka akpi a kate a ba ma akachi fini. Ma huru maka a tuma a seh kpo alilehndeh mboh reh a were a na nimeh akwri reh, mata a sangra na abibi mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />A nati bu dehreh ameh trina inziyo agba areh. amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh a nati a ba ta a gafa amboh te inyi anyi na amboh yehlehleh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Ma ta a were mboh a na nimeh shira ata agǝgǝgri ŋoh atsi ata ma a nati kpanga a rya anyini.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asabara afeh tasa Atono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yeso ka luhu la&lt;&lt;Ni sehreh kakranda mboh reh wina noh nambri?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">&lt;&lt;Haa,&gt;&gt; maka a kira.<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh, nimeh amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh nambri ata nza a bu kyangwri tufa ata kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh, a tswanza kyangwri afiya ata nza a fira awumu afeh tasa atono anyi ma ganzi a kate reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A leke Yeso Ma Nazaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yeso nza ka a bleh kakranda mboh reh a treh, a ka a hinga ata atsi wohroh <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />a na ŋoh akpo afiya a ŋoh. Ka a na leh a tsana kyangwri mboh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh, kyangwri ma a huru reh maka shi a ŋara aniye ma la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri reh ka a hunji lomo ata areh anyi ma? Tasa wuwana ata nza leh lisa agbugba ndohmoh ŋara aniye mboh reh? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Areh a bu amehreh kafita reh kpeh? A bu akre isa a ŋoh nza a bu Maryamu reh kpeh, tasa za a bu atsini mboh nza ma bu Yakubu, Yusufu, Siman tasa Yahuda reh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />A bu asra mboh nambri nza ma a bu na ambohroh reh kpeh? A ka a hunji amboh areh nambri anyi mma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ma ka a te gofo na ŋoh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu ma afiya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ka a hunji nga agba kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />A za a lisa agbugba ndohmoh mboh ma a huru reh za kpeh, tsifa la ma a bu na nga agohsoh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ma A biri Ikpi Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Na ameh wohroh Hirudus nza bu Agohmoh Galili reh ka a sehreh tsifa ma ikpi Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />A bleh ma ahwra a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Areh bu Ayohana kyangwri a wra batisma; ata nza ma a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh, a bu wohroh nza a hunji wuwana lisa agbugba ndohmoh ŋara aniye mboh areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Hirudus ta na a de Ayohana reh a fi ma ida ka ma ikpi Hirudiya, afya atsini Filibus. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Ayohana reh tana a leh a bleh ma Hirudus la, &lt;&lt;A zohhoh nnoh ti sa Hirudiya reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Hirudus reh a kira la ŋoh ta a mla Ayohana reh a kwo, ŋoh neh ka nyiri kyangwri Yahudawa mboh reh, tama a gu la Ayohana reh a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ibi mara Hirudus nza ka a su, anyifa Hirudiya reh ka a kira ajija kira a ka akuku agohsoh ma Hirudus veve kpeh <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />a ka bleh ŋoh a gya la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh gu faku la meh nati nga nnoh andromboh ata ni luhu meh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Akre neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, ta a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Nga meh ikpi Ayohana kyangwri a wra batisma reh nimeh gbugba areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Agohmoh reh ka a kputu agohsoh a ŋoh, neh ŋoh kǝ jiji gu faku ma tohmoh sehneh a ŋoh mboh reh, a ka tohmoh a na la ma nga anyifa reh andromboh ata nza a kira reh <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Maka a na na a biri ikpi Ayohana reh anyi ida ka. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Maka a de ikpi reh ma gbugba a ba ba ka a nga anyifa reh, ka a sa a de a na na a nga akre. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />amboh tufa Ayohana mboh reh maka a na na a gu mgbiri itoh ma a na na anyifo. Ma huru maka a na na a bleh Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Rya Ma Kyangwri mboh Dubu Atungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yeso nza ka a sehreh tsifa ma ikpi Ayohana reh, a ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo a na atsi ata nza bu shatata. Duma mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a tufa ŋoh na hwana anyi akpokpo afiyafiya mboh. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yeso nza ka a kate anyi ma gbogblondo amwo reh, ka a nza duma agba ma a dohsohna, a ka nza kwini amoh ta ka a nga wuwana ma amboh bishi mboh.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nvishi nza ka ba, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Atsi ata areh a bu hohroh bini, tasa za la, nvishi waka a ba. Tavoh duma mboh reh mata a na amoh ha handuhwa mata a na na a fa andromboh a rya ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A zohhoh mata a na amoh kpeh. Nga mboh nnoh andromboh mata a rya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ma ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh ma mareh meh bu na afohfohnoh atungu tasa kpo afri ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;De ba ma nnoh ni mareh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Tasa ka a bleh ma kyangwri mboh reh la mata a tuma ma ikpi mara bini mboh reh. Nza ka a gu afohfohnoh atungu tasa kpo afri reh ka a nza inza a ka, ta ka a te atoh feh sa ka a kya afohfohnoh reh a nga ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a sa a nga kyangwri mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Maka a rya hunu nambri ma amoh, amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh ma a fira ata nza a hwa reh a su akwri agrumavoh a hwa afri na su. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />amboh nza ma a rya reh ma bu tsifa dubu atungu ma kama a bleh ifiya mboh tasa amehreh mboh nza ma a yama reh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A hehndeh ma Ikpi Amwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Heriheri Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh tama aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh ka a hehreh a na a ŋoh na iba ari, ŋoh a treh a nati a tavoh duma mboh reh fya. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Nza ka a tavoh kyangwri mboh reh a treh, ka a ka a na a ŋoh agbohgboh na ikpi ŋoh atsi kwere Nnoh. Nvishi nza ka a ba reh, ŋoh ka a treh ma a huru ŋoh tsene, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />na ameh wohroh reh, gbogblondo amwo reh kǝ kpiri na a ŋoh gbugba nyi atsi hinga amoh ma inzi reh, inyo agba ka leh a fi mboh ma tohmoh nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ka a bu na mgba nnoh anneh ata nerebi feh Yeso ka a kate a ba na amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh, ka a leh hehndeh ma ikpi amwo. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh nza maka a nza ŋoh ti hehndeh ma ikpi amwo reh, maka a nyiri veve kpeh. Ma a bleh amoh la, &lt;&lt;A kama bu yafa,&gt;&gt; maka a kpanga nyiri.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Heriheri Yeso ka a bleh mboh: la, &lt;&lt;Bu nnoh na wuwa agohsoh! A bu Mya. Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Abitrusu ka a kira la,&lt;&lt;Ada, nza a bu noh reh neh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bleh meh meh ti ba na anzoh ma ikpi amwo reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Ba,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Abitrusu ka tamba anyi nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh, ka a hehndeh ma ikpi amwo a na atsi ata Yeso nza a bu reh. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Nza ka a nza inyo agba atsi fo neh, a ka nyiri, ŋoh ka bu ti niye bleh a na ŋoh nimeh amwo reh, a ka a kpanga kate, la, &lt;&lt;Ada, nga meh nvara zu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Heriheri Yeso ka atsitsi ivoh a ŋoh ka a de ŋoh. Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh nza ni bu na nga agohsoh shidi ma reh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A bu lele ma feh ni grehshi agohsoh anzoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Nza maka aniye ma gbogblondo amwo reh, inyo reh ka a hwa tamba. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nza ma a yama nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh maka krumusu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Zizi ni bu amehreh Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga wuwana ma Kyangwri Bishi anyi ma Janisarat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mk 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Nza maka a hwana iba fini reh, maka a tamba a ba amoh akpo inzi Janisarat, <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />ma a huru reh kyangwri mboh maka a nza Yeso a wina, maka a tohmoh a na akpokpo afiyafiya amoh mboh reh nambri la mata a fira amboh bishi mboh reh a ba na Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Maka kwere ŋoh la, mata ata amboh bishi mboh reh mata zaka a bara anene kuri ata hama awo a ŋoh reh ma, amboh nza ma a bara ŋoh reh nambri ma amoh maka a hunji wuwana.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Tsana Agbugba Amboh Kiri mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mk 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Mgbiri Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh ma anyi Urushalima a ba na Yeso maka a luhu ŋoh la, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />&lt;&lt;A bu lele feh amboh tufa anzoh mboh reh ma a tufa tsana agbugba kyangwri mboh reh kpeh? Maka a wra ivoh amoh mboh masa a rya irya reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu lele feh mohnoh za ni leke ti tufa nnoh doka Nnoh reh ti gyuru tufa nnoh tsana amohnoh mboh? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Nnoh neh a bleh la, &lt;Nga agba ma atsiyoh tasa atono&gt; tasa &lt;Akyo ata nza a kya alehmeh ha akre ma ta a mla a kwo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />mohnoh neh ni tsana noh la nza akyo a bu na ngǝnga ata nza a nati a nga alehmeh ha akre, neh ta ka a gyuru a bleh la, &lt;Andromboh ata mya meh nati nga nnoh reh meh nati nga Nnoh mi,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />a sohroh nga agba ma alehmeh kpeh. Ma aki wohroh reh ni kpa nnoh tsifa Nnoh reh srehehneh nnoh tsifa la ti tufa nnoh tsana ata ikpi amohnoh. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />mohnoh amboh agugu mboh! Ishaya reh tana sa tsifa bleh ma ikpi amohnoh reh zizi ta ka a bleh la,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />&lt;Kyangwri mboh reh ma a nga meh agba ma aniye ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">agohsoh amoh neh a bu gbugba na amya.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Ma krumusu meh wusu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">tsana amoh reh bu aki tufa kyangwri mboh mi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Andromboh Ata nza A nasa Kyangwri ma tomo Nnoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mk 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yeso ka a fi duma mboh reh a ba na a ŋoh ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Sehreh ti wina noh! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />A bu andromboh ata nza aniye a na ma aniye kyangwri ka a de ŋoh a te arishi kpeh, a ka bu andromboh nza a nati kate anyi ma aniye ŋoh a bu wohroh ŋa ka a de ŋoh a te arishi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba na a ŋoh maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni wina la Farisiyawa mboh ma a te gofo nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />A ka kira la, &lt;&lt;Nimeh biroh awumu asho mboh ata nza a bu Ada amya ma inza nza a biya kpeh reh, ma a nati kpikpi mboh a kate na ariri ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Ta mboh; ma amboh hama iyo la mboh ma a de ikpoh a tsana aki ma amboh hama iyo. Nza akyo a hama iyo ka wina de ikpoh a tsana aki ma akyo ata nza hama iyo, nambri ma amoh ma nati hwa a na njoro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Abitrusu ka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Tsana reh kakranda wohroh ka a tsana la mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni sohroh keh nnoh mgbiri kyangwri mboh reh lomo kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />&lt;&lt;Ni nza la andromboh ata nza aniye a na nimeh aniye ka a gǝga aniye nimeh yira tasa za ta a gyuru a kate anyi ma itoh a na ma ida abi reh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Andromboh nza a kate anyi ma aniye reh a kate anyi ma agohsoh, a bu wohroh ŋa ka a de akyo a te arishi ma tohmoh Nnoh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />A ka anyi ma agohsoh mi kohnoh agugu ka a kate, ti mla akyo kwo, ti leh ahohndoh na akyo, hehndeh te inyo, ayuhu, bleh huru tsifa ma ikpi akyo, tasa a kya Nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />A bu awumu amboh areh a nati a de kyangwri ta a bu na arishi ma tohmoh Nnoh, a sohroh a bu tsifa rya irya na ivoh arishi ka a de akyo a te abibi ma tohmoh Nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nga Agohsoh Afya Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mk 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yeso ka ata atsi wohroh, a ka kpina a na akpo Taya mboh tasa Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Afya Kaana anyi ma a huru ka ba na ŋoh, a kpanga a kate la, &lt;&lt;Ada mbohroh, amehreh Dawuda, nza kwini amya reh zu. Anyifa amya a bu ti nza iya gaga, a bu na bishi inyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Yeso neh a sohroh a bleh ŋoh andromboh kpeh. Ka bu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Katsi ŋoh ta na a ŋoh, a bu ti leh kpanga a tufa reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;ma a tohmoh meh a ba ti fa atashi israila amboh nza ma a bleh aki mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Afya reh ka a ba ba a susuna ma tohmoh a ŋoh ta ka krumusu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, shingi meh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yeso neh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A nati a zohhoh meh ti gu irya ata nza ma a nati nga amehreh mboh ma ta a gu a fi a na ma ava mboh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Afya reh ka a kira ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ha, Ada&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ava mboh za maka a fasa amumu irya ata nza ka a kpokprona a sangrana anyi ma gbugba a ba ma inzi reh a rya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Afya, ni bu ni nga agohsoh gaga! Andromboh ata nza ni kira ni nati hunji.&gt;&gt;Anyifa a ŋoh ka a hunji nana ŋoh nyi na ameh wohroh heri.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma vara Kyangwri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yeso ka yi atsi wohroh ata ta ka a na a ŋoh aki fini agba Galili. Ta ka a gǝga ka na atsi agbohgboh ta ka a tuma inzi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Duma agba maka a ba na a ŋoh, ma a de a ba amboh jigbirina, amboh hama yo, amboh agugrutu, amboh kpa ashotoh tasa vara amboh tswa, maka a fira mboh a ba ma tohmoh a ŋoh; a ka a nga mboh wuwana. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Kyangwri mboh maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma nza ma a nza amboh kpa ashotoh atsi tsifa, amboh jingbirina mboh atsi hinga, amboh gbo na a gboro atsi hinga hehndeh tasa amboh hama yo atsi nza. Tasa maka za riri Nnoh ata Israila mboh.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga irya ma Vara Kyangwri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mk 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yeso ka a fi amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh a ba na a ŋoh ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nza kwini kyangwri amboh areh; ma a yama na amya ma a te ibi atatoh nehnehreh ma a bu na andromboh irya kpeh. Meh kira meh ti ta mboh avoh ma ta a na amoh na nyo, akyo amoh anyi a na na a hwa a kwo ma aki kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka kira la, &lt;&lt;meh kǝ nati hunji irya gaga ma mma ma hohroh bini ata areh timi nga duma agba reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yeso ka luhu la, ni bu noh na afohfohnoh amama?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">&lt;&lt;Maka a kira la, atehrehkifi na anyi,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;tasa kpo shidi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yeso ka a bleh ma duma mboh reh la tama a tuma ma inzi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />ŋoh neh ka a gu afohfohnoh atehrehkifi na anyi reh tasa kpo reh, nza ka a kwende Nnoh a treh, ka a hwahwashi mboh ta ka a nga ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh, ma a sa a nga ma kyangwri mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Ma sa a rya hunu nambri ma amoh. A hwa mgbiri, ma a sohroh a rya a treh kpeh, amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh a fira ata nza na a hwa reh a su agbugba akukwri atehrehkifi na anyi. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Amboh nza ma a rya reh tsifa mboh ma bu dubu anneh ma a bleh ifiya mboh ma amehreh mboh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Yeso nza ka a tavoh duma mboh reh, a ka a hwa aniye a na ma gbogblondo amwo reh ta ka a na a ŋoh akpo Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ma A luhu Kpra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mk 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Farisiyawa mboh tasa Sadukiyawa maka a ba na Yeso ma a kira mata a tsara ŋoh a nza maka a luhu ŋoh la ta a tsana mboh kpra inza.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yeso neh ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza nvishi ka a ba reh, ni kǝ bleh noh la, &lt;Ikya atsifi a nati a zohhoh, nza ni nza noh avereh inza atsi sha ma reh,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />tasa ni nerebi ni kǝ bleh noh la, &lt;Andrehmeh awi a nati a ba, tsifa la avereh inza a sha ta ka a hwa shini.&gt; Ni kǝ nza wina noh avereh inza, feh ti wina nza noh kpra ameh wina noh kpeh! <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />mohnoh kyangwri amboh ameh ata areh, ni bu noh agugu tasa amboh tufa Nnoh yehlehleh kpeh. Ma a kira la mata a nza kpra feh. Akyo a nati tsana noh kpra andromboh kpeh, ta ka bu ata Ayunana reh ma.&gt;&gt; Yeso neh ka a yi mboh ata ta ka a na a ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisti Farisiyawa tasa Sadukiyawa mboh reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mk 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Nza maka a hwana fini agba a na ni ba ari, amboh tufa ŋoh mboh maka a te kohhroh mata a de irya. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh, kama sa noh yisti Farisiyawa tasa Sadukiyawa mboh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Maka atsifa ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ha a nza la mbohroh meh de irya andromboh ba kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />A ka a wina tsifa amoh reh, Yeso ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh amboh nga agohsoh shidi ma, Ni tuma tsifa nnoh ma itoh amohnoh lele ma ikpi la ni bu noh na irya kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Nehnehreh za ni sohroh wina noh kpeh? Ni kohnoh nnoh na ameh ata meh ti kǝ kya afohfohnoh atungu nga kyangwri dubu atungu reh kpeh? Tini fira nnoh akwri mboh reh amama? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ha afohfohnoh atehrehkifi mata nga kyangwri mboh dubu anneh, ma a nati a rya a hwa agbugba akukwri amama? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />A te lele feh ni wina noh la meh tsifa na amohnoh ma ikpi irya? mohnoh neh lisa nza noh yisti Farisiyawa tasa ata Sadukiyawa mboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ma huru amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a wina la atsifa na amoh ma ikpi yisti nza maka a were nimeh afohfohnoh reh kpeh, a buti bleh mboh la mata a lisa a nza tsana Farisiyawa tasa Sadukiyawa mboh reh.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A bleh na Aniye a ŋoh la Yeso a bu Almasihu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mk 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yeso nza ka a ba akpo anyi ma Kaisariya Filibi, ka luhu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh ma a nza la amehreh kyangwri reh bu anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Itswa ma a bleh la ni bu Ayohana kyangwri a wra batisma; itswa la ni bu Iliya; mgbiri tswa za la, ni bu Irimiya ha anyimbehreh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh nnoh neh?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ni bleh noh la meh bu anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Siman Abitrusu ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu Kristi, amehreh Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na anzoh Siman amehreh Ayohana!&gt;&gt; Andromboh nza ni bleh reh, a bu kyangwri na imya ma itoh a tsana noh kpeh, a bu Ada mya nza a bu ma inza mi. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Mya meh bleh noh la, a bu noh Abitrusu, tasa meh nati mina ida amboh tufa mboh ma ikpi kpakpa ata areh, inziyo kwo a tswa ta a ha kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Meh nati nga nnoh akpreh ata vuru anida Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza; andromboh ata nza ni lafa nnoh ma inziyo agba areh a nati a bu lafa ŋoh ma tohmoh Nnoh ma inza, tasa andromboh ata nza ni hingre nnoh ma inziyo agba areh a nati a bu hingre ma inza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />A ka akpi ashotoh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la ma kama a bleh ma akyo la ŋoh bu Kristi kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh kwo A ŋoh A wina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mk 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Nza ka anyi na ameh wohroh Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, ŋoh wa a nati a na a ŋoh Urushalima kanga ta a wa iya mboh reh gaga ma ivoh agbugba kyangwri mboh tasa Agba Firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh, tasa za la ma a nati a mla ŋoh a tavoh ta a gyuru a hinga a yiri a te alete ibi na atatoh ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Abitrusu neh ka kpi ŋoh a na ni nda ta ka a hwa ŋoh. Ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mbimbi kpeh, Ada!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Areh a nati bu dehreh na anzoh kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yeso neh ka gyuru a bleh ma Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Hinga ta meh aki, agugu! Ni bu meh kpakpa kpa hwana ma aki; ni bu na kohnoh Nnoh ma agohsoh anzoh kpeh, a bu kohnoh ata kyangwri mboh amoh mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Nza akyo ata nza a kira ta tufa meh a nati ata aki nana a ŋoh reh ta a gu gbohrohgboh ma ikpi a ŋoh ta tufa meh. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Akyo ata nza a kira ta nga nvara ma fene a ŋoh a nati hunji kpeh, akyo ata nza a kira ta mla ikpi a ŋoh tsifa amya a nati hunji. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />A nati a zohhoh lele la akyo ta a hunji inziyo agba areh nambri, fene a ŋoh ta a hunji nvara kpeh? Ha la ni kǝ nati gu fene anzoh sehneh ni umbo? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />amehreh kyangwri a nati a ba nimeh agba Ada tasa amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh mboh, a huru a nati a nga firoh ma kyangwri mboh reh ma a sa anyi na ndohmoh nza ma a lisa. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Mya meh bleh noh zizi la, mgbiri amohnoh tswa ni nati kwo nnoh feh si nza noh amehreh Kyangwri atsi ba nimeh kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A sehnehna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mk 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />A gǝga ibi atehrehkifi Yeso ka a gu Abitrusu, tasa Yakubu, tasa Ayohana atsini Yakubu, ka a wa mboh a na ma ikpi agbohgboh izeh anyi, maka a bu ma a huru mboh tsimoh. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Ma huru a ka a sehnehna ma tomo amoh. tomo a ŋoh ka a zanana tswanza noh reh, tasa kuri a ŋoh ka a gyuruna a kasa kpakpaa tswanza shira. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Heriheri Musa mboh ma Iliya maka a hinga a kate mboh ma tomo amoh, maka a shi atsifa na Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a zohhoh meh ti bu ma mareh. Nza ni kira reh, meh ti la dasa Nnoh akehreh atatoh ma mareh, anyi anzoh, anyi Musa a ŋoh tasa anyi ta a bu Iliya a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Maka a treh ka tsifa dehreh ma, avereh zanana anyi ka a hama mboh, mata ka a sehreh agba ma hohroh avereh reh ti a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu amehreh Nnoh, ata mya nza ni kira na a ŋoh; na a ŋoh agohsoh amya a kukuna. Sehreh nnoh tsifa a ŋoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh maka a hwa a kwese tohmoh a tamba ma inzi, maka nyiri gaga. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yeso neh ka a ba ba a babara mboh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga shi nnoh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Nza maka a vuru iyo a nza ka, maka a nza akyo kpeh ka bu Yeso reh ma.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Nza maka buti tamba anyi ma agbohgboh reh, Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama na ni bleh noh ma akyo andromboh ata nza ni nza noh reh kpeh, ta nnoh, amehreh Kyangwri ta a kwo a yiri feh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa mboh la amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh ma a bleh la Iliya a nati a jiji a ba feh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ma a zizi, Iliya a nati a jiji a ba ti lisa atsifi mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Mya neh meh buti bleh noh la, Iliya kǝ jiji ba, ma a nza ŋoh a wina kpeh, maka a lisa ŋoh andromboh ata agohsoh amoh nza a kira. Ma aki wohroh za amehreh kyangwri a nati a wa iya ika wohroh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ma huru amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a wina la a bu ti tsifa ma ikpi Ayohana kyangwri a wra batisma.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma amehreh Anyi Nza a bu na Bishi Inyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mk 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Nza maka a ba ma atsi duma mboh reh, kyangwri anyi ka a ba ba a hunji Yeso ta ka a susuna na a gboro ma tohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Ta ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ada, nza kwini amehreh amya,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A bu na bishi inyo tasa za a wa iya gaga. Ka hinga a hwa a na nimeh shira ha nimeh amwo. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Meh gu ŋoh ba na amboh tufa anzoh mboh, ma a wina nga ŋoh wuwana kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh kyangwri amboh ika ata areh, amboh sa tsifa leke tasa amboh lisa abibi, meh nati tuma na amohnoh yanda lele? Meh nati de ikpi ahroh na amohnoh yanda lele? De amehreh reh ba nnoh na amya uwe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yeso ka a bleh ma Huru inyo reh, a ka a kate anyi ma itoh amehreh reh, a ka hunji wuwana anyi ma a huru.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Ma huru amboh tufa ŋoh reh maka a hunji Yeso na nda maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh lisa lele feh mbohroh meh ti wina katsi inyo reh kate kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nga agohsoh amohnoh a bu shidi ma, ta meh ti bleh noh zizi, nza nga agohsoh amohnoh a bu akehreh tswanza yohroh agbeh kumu, ni nati wina a bleh noh ma agbohgboh areh la, &lt;Kpusu hinga nyi ma ma areh na ari&gt; a nati a kpusu. Andromboh a nati a keh wuwana amohnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />&lt;&lt;Ika ata areh ka a kate kpeh ni nati kwere nnoh Nnoh ti de noh aniye feh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A gyuru Atsifa za Ma Ikpi Kwo a ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nza maka a ba ba a dohsohna ma Galili reh, Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nati a de amehreh Kyangwri a nga kyangwri mboh, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />ma a nati mla ŋoh a kwo, ibi na atatoh ŋoh a nati gyuru a hinga a yiri na fene.&gt;&gt; amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka kohnoh gaga.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fanga Agandu ata Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Yeso tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh nza maka a ba Kafarnahum, amboh sa gandu maka a ba na Abitrusu ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana amohnoh reh ka fanga gandu da kwere Nnoh reh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Ka kira la, &lt;&lt;Haa a ka fanga,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Abitrusu nza ka aniye a na mgba afiya reh, Yeso ka a jiji atsifa la, &lt;&lt;Ni kohnoh lele, Siman? A bu anyi ka a fanga hungroh gandu ha hungroh inzi ma Agohmoh ata inziyo mboh reh? A ka anyi na amboh inzi mboh reh ha a ka anyi na sene mboh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Abitrusu ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A ka anyi na sene akyo mboh.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;amboh inzi mboh reh maka a fanga kpeh.&gt;&gt; Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh dehreh. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />&lt;&lt;Mbohroh neh meh ti kama kira meh ti kputu mboh agohsoh kpeh, na nnoh fini ti na ni kya nnoh akpehreh. Gu nnoh kpo ata nza ni jiji de noh reh; ti vuru nnoh aniye a ŋoh ni nati nza noh hungroh kohkohna nimeh. Ti gu ba ibi nga mboh nnoh a nati tswa fanga gandu amya tasa amohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ata Nza A keh Agba Ma Akpo Afiya Inza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Na ameh wohroh amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba na Yeso maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu anyi ata nza a keh agba nimeh kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yeso ka a fi ameh amehreh akehreh anyi la ta a hinga a shi nimeh amoh, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />a ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh zizi, nza ti sehnehna nnoh tswa nza amehreh mboh kpeh, akyo a nati hunji niye na nimeh kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Akyo ata nza akuku ikpi ŋoh a tswanza amehreh akehreh ata areh, a bu ŋoh a nati a bu agba nimeh kpra Agohmoh ata inza. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />&lt;&lt;Tasa akyo ata nza a sa amehreh akehreh a tswanza ata areh nimeh isa amya, a bu mya ŋa a sa meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsara Amboh ata A nati A de Kpakpana a ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mk 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Akyo ata neh nza a de amehreh akehreh anyi nimeh amboh ata nza ma sa tsifa amya reh kira mata kpakpana, a nati a keh zohhoh mata a lafa kanji kpakpa hwa ma agba akyo wohroh mata a gu ŋoh a tavoh a na nimeh amwo agba atsi niye ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba ma inziyo reh a nati a bu lele ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a nati a bu kpakpa kpa hwana kyangwri mboh mata a kpakpana reh! Andromboh ika wohroh a nati a ba kanga, iya agba a nati a bu na akyo ata nza a te ndohmoh ika wohroh reh!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Nza ivoh anzoh ha hwana anzoh ka a de noh a fi ma aki kpakpana, fa tavoh. A nati a keh zohhoh ti hunji fene ata tuma ti bu na mgbiri ivoh ha hwana grugutu na ata mata a bleh la ni niye nimeh shira ata tuma atono na ivoh anzoh na afri ma ha na hwana anzoh na afri ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Tasa za ha a bu iyo anzoh ka a de noh a fi ma aki kpakpana, hre kate ti tavoh. A nati a keh zohhoh ti hunji fene na iyo anyimbehreh na ata la ti bu na iyo anzoh afri mata a gu nnoh a fi a na nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Atashi Ata Nza a bleh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh ti kama rina nnoh anyimbehreh nimeh amehreh akǝkehreh amboh areh kpeh. Meh bleh noh la amehreh tohmoh amehreh mboh reh ma inza maka a tuma a nza tohmoh Ada amya ma inza na tutu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />amehreh kyangwri a ba neh ta sa amboh ata nza ma a bleh reh a hwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kohnoh nnoh lele? Kyangwri ta a bu na atashi mboh agrumavoh ida agrumavoh, anyimbehreh amoh ta a bleh, a nati a yi agrumavoh ida atsiyatsiya na anyi reh ata ma agbohgboh ta a na ŋoh na a leh hehndeh a fa ata nza a bleh reh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />meh ti a bleh noh zizi, nza ta ka a hunji feh agohsoh a ŋoh a nati ka a kukuna ma ikpi atashi anyimbehreh wohroh reh a keh agrumavoh ida atsiyatsiya na anyi amboh ata nza ma a bleh kpeh reh. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />A bu atsifi dehreh, Ada mohnoh nza a bu ni inza a kira la anyimbehreh nimeh amehreh akǝkehreh mboh areh ta a bleh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atsi Nza A kpakpana Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />&lt;&lt;Nza atsi anzoh a kpakpana nnoh, na ti na ni tsana ŋoh kpakpana reh, mohnoh afri ma itoh amohnoh. Nza a sehreh noh reh, ni wa atsi anzoh ba ma aki. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Nza a sehreh noh kpeh reh, gu kyangwri anyimbehreh ha afri de, tswanza amgbasho Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;tsifa ka a zohhoh sehreh anyi ma aniye kyangwri afri ha atatoh mata a bleh ma ikpi akyo reh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Nza a sisehreh mboh kpeh reh, na ti na ni bleh ma amboh tufa mboh; tasa za nza a sisehreh agbugba amboh ida Nnoh mboh reh kpeh, ti gu ŋoh tswanza amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh tasa amboh amboh sa hungroh gandu.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lafa Tasa Hingre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />&lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh zizi, andromboh ata nza ni lafa gya nnoh ma inziyo areh ma a nati a bu lafa ŋoh ma tohmoh Nnoh ma inza, andromboh nza ni hingre nnoh ma inziyo areh ma a nati a hingre ma inza.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />&lt;&lt;Tasa za, meh ti bleh noh zizi la, nza mohnoh afri ma inziyo areh ni dohsoh noh ikpi amohnoh ti luhu nnoh ha bu mboh, Ada amya ata inza a nati a lisa nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Atsi ata kyangwri afri ha atatoh ma a dohsohna nimeh isa amya, meh bu na amoh ma a huru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Ahwra Ata Ka A nza Kwini Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Abitrusu ka a ba na Yeso ta ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ada, atsi amya a nati kpakpana meh a te na amama feh meh ti kǝ te kohhroh na a ŋoh? A nati a te na atehrehkifi na anyi feh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;meh bleh noh, A nati a bu na atehrehkifi na anyi kpeh, a nati a bu na atehrehkifi na anyi ida agrumavoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />&lt;&lt;A bu dehreh, kpra Agohmoh ata inza reh a tswanza Agohmoh ata nza a nati a kira la ŋoh ta a bleh asabara a ŋoh ata nza a bu ma ivoh ahwra a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Agohmoh nza ka a leh a bleh asabara a ŋoh reh, maka a de kyangwri anyi a ba na Agohmoh reh ŋoh a tufa ŋoh hungroh gaga ata kyangwri reh a nati a wina fanga a treh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Ahwra reh a za a wina fanga kpeh, Ada reh ka a bleh la ma a de ŋoh a rifa tswanza ahwra, tasa afya a ŋoh tasa mara a ŋoh mboh tasa awumu a ŋoh mboh mata a de hungroh reh a ba ba a fanga.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />&lt;&lt;Ahwra reh ka a hwa a susuna na a gboro ma tohmoh a ŋoh ta ka krumusu ŋoh la, &lt;Soh meh ivoh yira,&gt; &lt;Meh nati fanga nnoh nambri,&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Ada ka nza kwini ahwra reh, ka a te kohhroh na hungroh ata nza ma a tufa ŋoh reh, ta ka ata ŋoh avoh la ta a na ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />&lt;&lt;Ahwra wohroh neh nza ka a kate, ka a nza atohngoh ahwra anyi ŋoh nza a tufa ŋoh hungroh shidi ma. Ka a fla ŋoh a de ma agba ta ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;Fanga meh firoh amya!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />&lt;&lt;Atohngoh ahwra reh ka a hwa a dohnoh na a gboro kwere ŋoh la,&lt;Kavohshama soh ivoh ma yira na amya meh nati fanga nnoh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />&lt;&lt;Atohngoh ahwra reh neh ka a leke. Ka a de ŋoh a na na a fi ma ida ka, la akyo ata ŋoh nza a tufa ŋoh hungroh reh a fanga firoh reh feh masa ata ŋoh avoh. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Atohngoh ahwra amboh anyi ma a nza andromboh reh a wa mboh aniye maka a na na a bleh Ada andromboh nza a lisa reh.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru Ada reh ka a gyuru a tohmoh a na la ma a fi ŋoh ahwra reh. Ka a bleh la, &lt;Nnoh bu kyangwri te nyi,&gt; &lt;Ni kwere meh, meh te kohhroh na kohfoh amya gaga ata nza a bu ma ikpi anzoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />A bu lele feh ti nza kwini atohngoh anzoh ahwra tswanza mya nza ni nza kwini anzoh reh kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Nimeh gofo a ŋoh Ada reh ka a de ŋoh a nga amboh ka kyangwri mboh mata a leh a nga ŋoh iya, la ta a fanga firoh ma amboh ata ma a tufa ŋoh hungroh reh a treh sehsehseh feh masa a yi ŋoh a tavoh.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A nati a bu dehreh Ada amya ata nza a bu ma inza a nati a lisa ika ata Agohmoh reh, nza ni te nnoh kohhroh na kpakpana atsi anzoh nyi ma agohsoh kpeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Gafana Atsifa Mboh Ma Afiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mk 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yeso nza ka a bleh tsifa amboh ata areh a treh, ka a na a ŋoh Galili ta ka a gǝga aniye a na mgba Yahudiya nza a bu na ba Fini Urdu. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Duma agba maka a tufa ŋoh, ta ka nga amboh bishi mboh bishi wuwana.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Farisiyawa amboh tswa maka a ba na a ŋoh la mata a tsara ŋoh a nza. Maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ma ikpi tsana akpi Musa reh, a zohhoh kyangwri ta a katsi afiya a ŋoh ha ka a bu ma ikpi umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni hehreh bleh wina noh andromboh ata nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh la, nza anyi jiji ŋoh reh Nnoh a lisa atsifa tasa afiya?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Nnoh reh ka a bleh la, &lt;Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh kyangwri a nati ata alehmeh tasa akre ta ka a handana ma afya ŋoh, na afri ma amoh ma a nati ka bu uwo itoh anyimbehreh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Ma a za a nati a bu mboh afri za kpeh, maka a bu itoh anyimbehreh. Andromboh Nnoh kǝ dohsoh akyo ta a gafa za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Tana a bu tsifa umbo, Musa ta ka bleh la atsifa a nati a nga amgbasho gafana ta ka a katsi afya a ŋoh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Musa tana a nga noh kira la ti katsi nnoh ifiya amohnoh mboh tsifa la tini bu noh na wuwa ikpi. Ta a bu dehreh kpeh anyi jiji. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Meh bleh noh za la, akyo ata nza a katsi afiya a ŋoh, nza la ma a de ŋoh atsi leh ahohndoh kpeh. Nza ni gyuru sa afiya anyi tse ni za kǝ leh ahohndoh ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh nimeh tuma atsifa tasa afiya, a keh zohhoh atsifa ta kama a sa afiya kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nati a sa tsifa ata areh kpeh, a bu amboh ata Nnoh nza a kira na amoh mi. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Andromboh ata nza ka a ha mgbiri tsifa mboh sa ifiya mboh reh ma a yama gaga, mgbiri feh a bu kyangwri maka a de mboh a lisa dehreh; amboh tswa neh ma a leke sa afiya tsifa kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza. Akyo ata nza a nati a sa tsana ata areh ta a sa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amehreh Akǝkehreh Mboh Tasa Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Mgbiri kyangwri maka a leh a fira amehreh akǝkehreh mboh a ba na Yeso ta a gya mboh ivoh a ŋoh ta ka kwere Nnoh ma ikpi amoh za. amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh neh maka a hwa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a leh a fira amehreh mboh a ba reh.<verse eid="MAT 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ta nnoh amehreh akǝkehreh mboh mata a ba na amya, kama shwa mboh nnoh kpeh, kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a bu ata amboh ika wohroh ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Nza ka a gya mboh ivoh a treh ta ka a yi atsi wohroh ata.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kafa Kyangwri Anyi Na Asabara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Kyangwri anyi ka a ba na Yeso ta ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, meh nati lisa umbo alindeh kanga meh ti hunji fene ata tuma atono?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ luhu meh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; Yeso ka a kira ŋoh dehreh. &lt;&lt;A bu akyo anyimbehreh ma nza a bu alindeh. Nza ni kira ti hunji fene ata tuma atono reh, tufa doka mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Kyangwri reh ka luhu la&lt;&lt;A ka bu amboh atamaa?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yeso ka nga ŋoh kira la, &lt;&lt;Kama mla akyo tavoh kpeh, kama leh ahohndoh na akyo kpeh, kama te ayuhu kpeh, kama kama aniye ma akyo kpeh, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />nga agba ma atsiyoh tasa atono,&gt; tasa &lt;kira atohngoh anzoh tswanza nza ni kira ikpi anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Kafa kyangwri reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;amboh areh mya meh lisa mboh nambri&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A bu umbo nza a treh a hwa la meh ti lisa reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni kira ti bu yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh, na ni rifa na awumu anzoh nambri ti nga amboh iya mboh, ni nati gya asabara ma inza. Feh ti ba bu tufa meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Kyangwri kafa reh nza ka a sehreh dehreh ta ka a gu aki a na a ŋoh ni kputu agohsoh, telema feh ŋoh za bu na asabara.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh nati bleh noh zizi la, a nati a te iya ma kyangwri asabara ta a hunji niye ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Tasa za meh bleh noh la, a nati a bu na iya kpeh ma nyama ta aniye ma nvitsi akusu mata la kyangwri asabara ta aniye a na ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, a ka nga mboh nyiri maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Anyi wohroh nza a ka a nati a hunji nvara?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yeso ka a nza mboh a na ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kyangwri a nati a tswa kpeh, nza a bu ni Nnoh awumu mboh reh nambri a nati tswa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Abitrusu ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh mi ta awumu mboh reh nambri meh ti tufa nnoh! a ka a bu mboh ka a nati a bu ambohroh ma a huru nza meh nati hunji?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, ameh ata nza a buti ba reh, amehreh kyangwri a nati a tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh agba a ŋoh ma inziyo afeh reh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni tufa meh noh reh ni nati tuma noh za ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh mboh agrumavoh hwa afri, ti de noh Agohmoh ma arimi agrumavoh hwa afri ata Israila mboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Akyo ata nza ata afiya a ŋoh mboh ha atsini mboh ha asra mboh ha alehmeh ha akre mboh ha ayeye a ŋoh mboh la ma ikpi isa amya, a nati a hunji gaga a keh amboh areh, agrumavoh da agrumavoh tasa za a nati a hunji fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />amboh ata neh nza ma a bu jitomo reh ma a nati a gyuru a na amoh nyina, amboh nza ma a bu ma nyina reh ma a nati a gyuru a bu amboh jitomo.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Amboh Te Ndohmoh Ma Aye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />&lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a tswanza kyangwri ata nza a bu na aye, ka a kate na nerebi shishini ma atsi fa amboh mata a te ŋoh ndohmoh ma aye agbeh inabi a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />A kira la ŋoh a nati a fanga mboh hungroh jwa anyimbehreh ata maka a fanga amboh ndohmoh mboh ibi anyimbehreh, ta ka a fira mboh a were a na la mata a te ŋoh ndohmoh ma aye agbeh inabi a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />&lt;&lt;A ka te na nnoh a nza a ka kate a nza mgbiri kyangwri atsi shi ma kprakpranda ma a tuma wusu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh za na ni te noh ndohmoh ma aye agbeh inabi amya reh, meh nati fanga nnoh yehlehleh za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Maka a na amoh. A ka gyuru a na aye reh za na atsitsi fi noh tasa za ni mgba nnoh atatoh, ta ka a fira amboh ndohmoh mboh za a de. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />A gyuru a na za na mgba nnoh nvishi a hunji amboh anyi za atsi shi ma a huru. Ka luhu mboh la, &lt;Ni shi nnoh wusu ma nyi nnoh avoh ibi tsifa umbo?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />&lt;Akyo a sohroh a nga reh ndohmoh andromboh kpeh,&gt; maka a kira ŋoh dehreh. Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;mohnoh za na ni te noh ndohmoh ma aye agbeh inabi amya reh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />&lt;&lt;Nvishi nza ka a ba, Ada aye agbeh inabi reh ka a bleh ma kyangwri ata ka a nza amboh te ndohmoh ma aye reh la, &lt;Fi amboh te ndohmoh ma aye reh ma a ba ba a sa hungroh te ndohmoh amoh mboh, jiji fanga nyi amboh nyina reh gu na ni te amboh nza ma a jiji a te ndohmoh reh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />&lt;&lt;amboh nza ma a jiji ndohmoh amoh na mgba nnoh nvishi reh ma a sa hungroh amoh anyinyimbehreh nambri ata ndohmoh ibi anyimbehreh. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />amboh nza ma a jiji a te ndohmoh reh ma a bleh amoh la ha ma a nati a sa amoh ta a keh. Wa, ma a sa hungroh reh jwa anyimbehreh ika wohroh. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Nza maka a sa hungroh reh, maka atsifa alulu ma ikpi kyangwri aye reh. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Maka a bleh la,&lt;Kyangwri amboh nza ma a fira mboh a ba nyina ma a te ndohmoh shidi ma,&gt; &lt;Ni nga mboh tswa na na ambohroh, Mbohroh amboh ata nza meh jiji te ndohmoh nyi avoh nerebi ma nnoh agba.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />&lt;&lt;Ŋoh neh ka a kira ma anyimbehreh amoh la, &lt;Iza amya, mya meh lisa nnoh andromboh abibi kpeh. Meh kama bleh la ni kira la ni nati te noh ndohmoh ata hungroh jwa anyimbehreh ata ibi anyimbehreh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Sa firoh anzoh ti na anzoh. A bu kira amya meh ti nga ata mya nza ni fira mboh nyina reh a tswa na amohnoh. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Meh tswa meh ti lisa andromboh mya nza ni kira meh ti lisa na hungroh amya kpeh? Ha ni te vene la mya bu ngǝnga ma?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />&lt;&lt;amboh nza ma a bu ma nyina ma a nati a jiji, amboh nza ma a jiji ma a nati a ba nyina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh A wina Za ma Ikpi kwo a ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yeso nza ka bu ti ka a na a ŋoh Urushalima, ka a fira amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh a na ni nda ta ka a bleh mboh la, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />&lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh nati kǝ na ambohroh Urushalima, ma a nati a de amehreh Kyangwri a nga Agba Firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh. Ma a nati lofo ŋoh a kwo <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />tasa ma a nati a wa ŋoh a nga amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh mata a biya ŋoh nyi tasa mata a mla ŋoh na anvinviri mata kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh. Ibi na atatoh neh a nati a gyuru a yiri a te alete!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwere Nna anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ma huru akre mara Zabadi mboh maka a ba na Yeso mboh ma mara a ŋoh mboh afri, maka a ba ba a susuna krumusu ŋoh la ta a shingi mboh.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yeso ka a luhu ŋoh la&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kira umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Afya reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Bleh meh la mara amya mboh afri reh, anyi ta tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa anyi ta a tuma na mbga ivoh a mina anzoh ma kpra Agohmoh anzoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la&lt;&lt;Ni wina andromboh ata nza ni luhu meh reh kpeh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ni nati wina wa nyi nnoh ma hohndoh ata mya mi nza ni nati wa reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Maka a kira la&lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh nati wina,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati wina wa nyi nnoh ma hohndoh wa amwo amya, tsifa tuma ma ivoh rya a kpa amya ha ivoh a mina amya reh a bu mya meh nati seh atsifi amboh nza ma a nati a tuma nda amya kpeh. Atsifi amboh ika wohroh a nati a bu ma amboh Ada nza a lisa a gya mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh nza maka a sehreh dehreh reh, maka a kputu agohsoh amoh na atsi amoh mboh amboh afri reh. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yeso ka a fi mboh a suhru ma akpo anyimbehreh ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni wina noh la agba amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh maka kira tsana wuwana, agbugba amoh mboh za maka a tsana wuwana ma ikpi kyangwri amoh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />A nati a sohroh a bu dehreh nimeh amohnoh kpeh. Akyo ata a kira ta a bu agba nimeh amohnoh reh a nati gyuruna a te ndohmoh ma mgbiri mboh reh kanga, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />tasa akyo ata nza a kira ta a bu ata anyimbehreh ŋoh a nati gyuruna te ahwra kanga. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Avoh tswanza amehreh Kyangwri a sohroh a ba la kyangwri mata shingi ŋoh kpeh, a ba la ŋoh neh ta shingi mboh, tasa la ta nga fene a ŋoh ma ikpi tsifa kyangwri gaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh Hama Yo Mboh Afri Ma A hunji nza Atsifi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh nza maka a bu ti yi Jeriko ata, duma agba maka a tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Kyangwri mboh afri ma a bu amboh hama iyo ma a bu ti tuma ma akachi aki, nza maka a sehreh la Yeso a bu ti hehndeh a gǝga, maka a vuru agba mama la, &lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh, amehreh Dawuda nza kwini ambohroh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Duma mboh reh la mata a hwa mboh la ma a hama aniye, maka a lisa ka a vuru agba mama ka a keh, &lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh, amehreh Dawuda nza kwini ambohroh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yeso ka a shi a fi mboh. Ka a luhu mboh La,&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kira nnoh meh ti lisa nnoh umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Maka a kira la,&lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;mi kira meh ti nza atsifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yeso ka nza kwini amoh ta ka a bara iyo amoh mboh. heriheri iyo amoh ka a vuruna a nza atsifi mata a ka a wa ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso Aniye A na Urushalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Nza maka a ba ma nda Urushalima maka a ba ma akpo afiya anyi ata maka a fi la Betafaji, akpo afiya reh a bu ma agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh, Yeso ka a tohmoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh afri, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Na nnoh ma akpo afiya akehreh ata nza a bu ma tohmoh amohnoh reh, ni nati nza noh ma lafa ameh Nyama tasa akre ma a huru, hingre mboh ti de ba meh noh. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Nza akyo ka a bleh noh andromboh, a bleh noh la a bu Ada mi a kira mboh, a nati a gyuru ata mboh mata a na amoh ma hwana anyimbehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ma a lisa andromboh areh la tsifa kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh ta a su:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />&lt;&lt;Bleh nnoh ma anyifa Sihiyona reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">&lt;Nza, Agohmoh anzoh a buti ba na anzoh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">a ka ma ikpi nyama a leh a ba ve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">a leh a hehndeh ma ikpi ameh nyama akehreh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a na amoh na a lisa andromboh ata Yeso nza a bleh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Maka a de nyama reh mboh ma ameh nyama a ba, maka a were mboh kuri amoh mboh, Yeso ka a tuma ma ikpi amoh. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Duma agba maka a leh fese kuri amoh mboh ma aki, mgbiri feh maka a leh a shishimba avohvoh asho mboh anyi ma agbeh a were ma ikpi aki. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Duma amboh ata ma a na amoh ma tohmoh a ŋoh tasa amboh ata ma a treh ma nyina maka a vuru agba amoh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Hosanna na anzoh amehreh Dawuda!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Ma a te atoh ma akyo ata nza a ba nimeh isa Ada reh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Hosanna na Nnoh nimeh nga agba.<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yeso nza ka aniye nimeh Urushalima, akpo afiya reh na agba ma, ma a hinga a shi na a hwana maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Duma maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu Yeso, kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh nza anyi Nazaret ma Galili reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A lisa Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Ibi anyi Yeso ka aniye a na nimeh ida Nnoh ka a katsi amboh rifa na awumu kawa amboh sa awumu nimeh ida Nnoh reh, a ka a druhu ateburu amboh sene hungroh mboh, tasa kpra tuma amboh rifa na ikukuba mboh, <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la, &lt;Ma a nati a fi ida Nnoh amya la ida kwere Nnoh.&gt; mohnoh neh ni gyuru de te nnoh atsi huho ayuhu mboh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Kyangwri hwra iyo tasa ata agugrutu hwana maka a ba na a ŋoh ma ida Nnoh reh, ŋoh ka a nga mboh wuwana. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Agba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh nza maka a nza andromboh ata nza a leh a lisa reh, amehreh za maka a leh lulu agba nimeh ida Nnoh maka a leh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Hosanna na amehreh Dawuda,&gt;&gt; maka te gofo.<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ma a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ni sehreh andromboh ata amehreh mboh nza ma a leh a bleh reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ha,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mohnoh ni hehreh a bleh noh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh nza kpeh,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">&lt;&lt;Anyi ma aniye amehreh akǝkehreh tasa amehreh atisha mboh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">ni a bleh la mata krumusu nnoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Ka a de a hinga ata mboh ta ka a na a ŋoh Betani, ka a leh a yanda ibi na a huru.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A te Aniye Ma Agbeh Mgbungba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mk 11:12-14</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ni nerebi, a gyuru a buti ba ŋoh akpo afiya agba reh, inyo ka a de ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Nza ka a nza agbeh mgbungba anyi ma aki ka a na ma a huru, ka a nza la agbeh reh a bu na asho wusu ma a sohroh a mara kpeh. Ka a bleh ma agbeh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati mara za kpeh tswa tsi tuma atono!&gt;&gt; Agbeh mgbungba reh ka a hwara ma hwana anyimbehreh.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />amboh tufa Yeso nza maka a nza areh, maka a ŋara aniye, maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;A bu lele feh agbeh mgbungba reh a hwara na gbugbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, nza ni bu noh ni nga agohsoh ma Nnoh, ti sohroh bu noh na kohnoh anyi tse kpeh, ni nati nza wina keh nnoh andromboh ata mya nza ni lisa ma agbeh mgbungba reh tasa za, ni nati wina bleh noh ma agbohgboh la, &lt;Hinga ma mareh ti na ni hwa nimeh fini agba,&gt;a nati ka bu dehreh. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Nza ni sa tsifa reh kira nnoh, awumu ata nza ni kwere Nnoh reh, ni nati hunji noh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A luhu ma Ikpi Wuwana Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yeso nza ka aniye nimeh ida Nnoh, nza ka a bu nimeh leh tsana mboh, Agba Firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh maka a ba na a ŋoh maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu na wuwana atamaa nnoh nza ni leh lisa awumu amboh reh reh?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tasa za la a ka bu anyi ka a nga noh wuwana ata areh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya za meh nati luhu nnoh tsifa anyimbehreh. Nza ni a bleh ma nnoh, mya za meh nati a bleh noh wuwana ata mya nza ni leh lisa awumu mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Wra batisma Ayohana reh anyi ma? Anyi na Nnoh ma inza, ha anyi na kyangwri mboh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Maka a leh a yaha aniye ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati kǝ bleh la umbo? Nza timi bleh la, &lt;Anyi na Nnoh ma inza,&gt; a nati a gyuru a luhu reh la, &lt;A bu umbo ka a te feh ni sohroh sa nnoh tsifa Ayohana reh kira nnoh kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Nza Mbohroh timi bleh la, &lt;Anyi na kyangwri mboh&gt; Mbohroh mi nyiri kyangwri mboh reh, nambri ma a gu la a bu Ayohana mi nza bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Maka a kira ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya za meh nati a bleh noh ha ka bu anyi a nga meh wuwana ata mya nza ni leh lisa awumu mboh reh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda ma ikpi amehreh Afri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kohnoh nnoh lele? Kyangwri anyi tana a bu na amehreh afri. Ka a na, na ata jiji ŋoh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;amehreh, na ni timi ndohmoh ma aye agbeh inabi amya reh andrehmeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati na kpeh,&gt; ka a gyuru a sehneh agohsoh a ŋoh neh ka a na aye reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />&lt;&lt;Alehmeh neh ka a gyuru a ba na ata afri ŋoh ka a bleh ŋoh za dehreh. Ka kira la, &lt;Ada, meh nati na,&gt; ŋoh ka na kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />&lt;&lt;A bu atamaa nimeh mboh afri reh a lisa andromboh ata alehmeh nza a kira reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yeso ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi. amboh sa hungroh gandu tasa angra mboh ma a nati a jiji aniye ma kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh na amohnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ayohana reh tana a ba na amohnoh la ŋoh ta tsana noh aki tufa yehlehleh, mohnoh ni sohroh sa nnoh tsifa a ŋoh kira nnoh kpeh, amboh sa hungroh gandu mboh tasa angrangra mboh neh ma sa a kira. mohnoh nza ni nza noh ata areh, ni sohroh sene agohsoh amohnoh ti sa tsifa a ŋoh reh kira nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Amboh sa Aye Inabi Kohfoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />&lt;&lt;Sehreh nnoh kakranda tsifa anyi uwe,&gt;&gt;Yeso a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi tana a bu na aye agbeh inabi. Ka a kpafa aye agbeh inabi reh a goh nambri, ka a shumu itsiyo firu amwo mara agbeh reh tasa za ka a mina ida kyangwri sumu. Ka a gu aye inabi reh a nga amboh hafa mboh kohfoh a treh feh sa ka a na a ŋoh hehndeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />ameh fira awumu nyi aye ba afiya nza ka a ba hwiri, ka a tohmoh ahwra a ŋoh mboh a na na amboh ta nza ma a sa aye kohfoh reh mata a na na a sa mara agbeh reh a ba ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />amboh hafa mboh reh maka a de ahwra ŋoh mboh reh, maka a mla anyimbehreh, maka a mla mgbiri ka kwo, maka a dadafa ata atatoh ŋoh ni kpakpa. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Ka a gyuru ka tohmoh mgbiri ahwra amboh tswa nza ma a keh amboh jiji ŋoh reh gaga, ma lisa mboh kafa ata jiji ŋoh reh za. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Ni trina nambri, ka a tohmoh amehreh a ŋoh a na na amoh. Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nati a nga amehreh amya agba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Amboh hafa reh nza maka a nza amehreh reh maka a bleh ma tohmoh la ata areh a bu ata nza a nati a de aye alehmeh reh; ba nnoh, meh ti mla ŋoh kwo, meh ti sa aye alehmeh reh hwana. <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Maka a gu ŋoh a kate ma aye agbeh inabi reh maka a mla ŋoh a kwo.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Nza Ada aye agbeh inabi reh ka a ba, a nati ka a lisa mboh lele? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Maka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A nati a mla agugu mboh reh a kwo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ta a gu aye agbeh inabi reh a gyuru a nga akyo mboh ata nza ma a nati ka a nga ŋoh avoh a ŋoh na ameh fira awumu nyi aye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni hehreh bleh nza noh ma amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh kpeh?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">&lt;&lt;Kpakpa ata amboh mina nza ma leke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">a bu wohroh ma a nati a gu a gya ma chuhu ida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ata areh a bu ndohmoh Ada mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">ka bu tsifa agba ma iyo ambohroh!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />&lt;&lt;Nza bu dehreh meh bleh noh la ma a nati a sa kpra Agohmoh Nnoh a hwana anyi ma ivoh amohnoh mata a nga ma kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a nati a bu na agohsoh alilehndeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Akyo ata nza a hwa ni kpi kpakpa reh a nati vavasana, akyo ata kpakpa reh nza a hwa ni kpi a ŋoh kyangwri reh a nati a mblihinina.<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />agba firist mboh tasa Farisiyawa mboh nza maka a sehreh kakranda Yeso reh, maka a wina la atsifa ni kpi amoh. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Maka fa aki la mata a de ŋoh, mboh neh maka nyiri duma mboh la kyangwri mboh tama a gu la ŋoh bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Kira wa Afiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yeso za ka a gyuru a bleh mboh tsifa za nimeh kakranda, la: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />&lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a tswa a nza Agohmoh anyi ata nza sa afya ma amehreh a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Agohmoh ka tohmoh ahwra a ŋoh mboh a na na amboh ata nza ma a bleh mboh tsifa sa afya amehreh a ŋoh reh la ma ba. Mboh neh ma leke mata a ba.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Ka a gyuru a tohmoh ahwra a ŋoh amboh anyi za la, &lt;Na ni bleh noh ma amboh nza ma a bleh mboh na wa afya amehreh amya reh la, &lt;Meh lisa irya gaga, ma mla agbugba londo atsifaa mboh, tasa za awumu mboh reh ma a yama na a sa nambri. Ba nnoh atsi wa afiya amehreh amya reh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh reh ma a sohroh a sa ŋoh aniye kpeh maka a na amoh, anyi a na a ŋoh aye ŋoh, anyi feh ka a na a ŋoh atsi rifa awumu a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />amboh tswa za maka de ahwra mboh reh a mla mboh ka kwo. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Agohmoh reh ka te gofo gaga. Ka tohmoh amboh de ita a ŋoh mboh maka a na ni a mla kyangwri mboh reh a kwo tasa za maka afiya akpo afya amoh nambri.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru ka a bleh ma ahwra a ŋoh mboh reh la, ibi wa afya nga amehreh amya reh kǝ ba, amboh nza ma a bleh mboh reh ma a ba kpeh mboh reh ma a tswa mata a ba kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Kate na nnoh ma akeki mboh reh, akyo ata ni nza noh ma aki ti bleh noh la ta ba atsi wa afya nga amehreh amya reh. <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Ahwra ŋoh mboh reh maka a na ma akeki mboh reh maka suhru kyangwri amboh nza ma a hunji mboh reh nambri, kawa alilehndeh tasa abibi mboh, atsi wa afya reh ka a su na kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />&lt;&lt;Agohmoh nza ka a ba ba a nza sene mboh reh, ka a nza kyangwri anyi ma a huru a sohroh a were kuri wa afya reh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Agohmoh reh ka luhu la,&lt;Iza, a bu lele feh ni ba mareh ni sohroh were kuri kira reh kpeh?&gt; Kyangwri reh neh ka a shi gbalala ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />&lt;&lt;Agohmoh reh ka a bleh ma amboh ata nza ma a te ndohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;Lafa nnoh ivoh tasa hwana kyangwri reh, ti gu nnoh shebiri kate ma inziyo, nimeh shini agba, ma huru a nati kpanga a rya anyini.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, ma a fi kyangwri mboh gaga, nimeh amoh neh ma a seh mboh mbimbi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A luhu ma Ikpi Fanga Hungroh Agandu ma Kaisar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Ma huru Farisiyawa mboh neh maka na na tuma a fa aki nza ma a nati a de ŋoh ni kpakpana nimeh tsifa ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Maka a tohmoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh tasa kyangwri Hirudus mboh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh wina la noh ni bu kyangwri bleh zizi, ni leh tsana aki Nnoh reh zizi, telema la kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma bu anyimbehreh ma tohmoh anzoh, ni kama gu la kyangwri mboh reh ma bu atsetse ma tohmoh anzoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Bleh reh nehnehreh, nza anzoh a bu lele? A zohhoh Mbohroh meh ti fanga hungroh gandu nga Agohmoh kaisar ha meh ti fanga nga ŋoh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Yeso feh ka a wina agugu amoh reh, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh amboh agugu mboh reh, ni kira ti tsara ma nnoh nza tsifa umbo? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Tsana meh noh akpreh ata ni kǝ fanga nnoh hungroh gandu na wohroh reh.&gt;&gt; Maka a gu akpreh reh a kate, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu yafa anyi mboh? tasa za la ata areh a bu sa anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Ma ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu yafa kaisar.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nga noh ma kaisar andromboh ata a bu kaisar a ŋoh tasa za ti nga nnoh ma Nnoh andromboh ata a bu Nnoh ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Farisiyawa mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a ŋara aniye, maka a na amoh ata ŋoh na a huru.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luhu Tsifa Ma Ikpi Kwo Hinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Ibi wohroh Sadukiyawa mboh, nza maka a bleh la akyo a nati a wina kwo ta hinga kpeh, ma ba na ŋoh, maka luhu ŋoh tsifa anyi. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Musa tana a bleh reh la nza akyo a kwo ta bu na amehreh kpeh, atsini a nati a sa afiya akwri reh ta a mara amehreh ma kunu reh. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Nehnehreh Kyangwri amboh anyi mboh atehrehkifi na aniye mboh ma atsini mboh, ma yama nimeh ambohroh. Ata anyimbehreh a sa afiya a treh neh ka a kwo, ŋoh nza a bu na amehreh kpeh reh, ka ata afya ŋoh ma atsini. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ka wohroh za a hunji ata afri tasa ata atatoh ka a gu ka a nina na ata atehrehkifi na anyi reh. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Nza ka a ba ma trina ŋoh neh, afiya reh a kwo. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Nehnehreh, ibi ata kyangwri amboh ata ma kwo ma nati gyuru hinga reh, ka a nati bu afya anyi nimeh amohnoh atehrehkifi na anyi reh, mohnoh ni sa nnoh nambri ma amohnoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yeso ka kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh ni kpakpana nnoh, mohnoh neh ni wina noh andromboh ata ma ŋa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh kpeh ha wuwana Nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ibi ata kyangwri amboh kwo nza ma a nati a gyuru hinga reh, sa afya ha sa atsifa a nati a yama za kpeh; kyangwri mboh ma a nati tswanza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh mboh ata inza reh. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ma ikpi ibi ata kyangwri amboh ata ma kwo a nati gyuru hinga reh, ni hehreh bleh nza noh andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh noh reh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />&lt;Mya meh bu Nnoh ata Ibrahim, tasa ata Ishaku, tasa ata Yakubu&gt;Ŋoh a bu Nnoh ata amboh kwo mboh kpeh a bu Nnoh amboh ta ma a bu na fene.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Duma mboh nza ma ka a sehreh andromboh ata Yeso nza a bleh reh, maka a ŋara aniye ni a bleh tsifa ŋoh mboh reh.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doka Ata nza A keh Agba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Farisiyawa mboh nza maka a sehreh la Yeso kǝ keh Sadukiyawa mboh na aniye reh, maka dohsohna ma akpo anyimbehreh. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />anyimbehreh nimeh amoh, nza bu kyangwri tsana akpi Musa reh, a tsara ŋoh na luhu ata areh:<verse eid="MAT 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, a bu atamaa nza bu doka ata wuwana nimeh akpi reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati kira na Ada Nnoh anzoh na agohsoh anzoh nambri tasa fene anzoh nambri tasa kohnoh anzoh nambri.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ata areh a bu doka ata jiji tasa ata wuwana. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ata na afri a tswanza ata jiji ŋoh reh: &lt;Kira akyo ata a bu ma nda anzoh tswanza ikpi anzoh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Akpi Musa mboh reh nambri tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh reh a kohrohna ma ikpi doka amboh afri areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luhu ma Ikpi Almasihu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Farisiyawa mboh nza maka a dohsohna ma akpo anyimbehreh reh, Yeso ka a luhu mboh la, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Ni kohnoh lele ma kpi akyo kristi reh? A ka bu amehreh anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Maka kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu amehreh Dawuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yeso ka luhu la, &lt;&lt;A bu lele feh Dawuda nza bu na wuwana huru neh ka gyuru a fi ŋoh la &lt;Ada&gt;? Dawuda ka a bleh la,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />&lt;Ada ka a bleh ma Ada mya:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa amya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">mya neh meh ti fira amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh were mboh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">na ma hohroh hwana anzoh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Nza Dawuda ka a fi ŋoh la &lt;Ada,&gt; ka bu lele feh ŋoh ka bu amehreh ŋoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Akyo a wina sa aniye tsifa reh kpeh, ka a gu nyi ni ibi wohroh akyo za a wina luhu ŋoh andromboh za kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso Akpi Ashotoh Ma Amboh Tsana Akpi Musa tasa Farisiyawa mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mk 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11:43</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Yeso ka a bleh ma duma mboh tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh la: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />&lt;&lt;amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa Farisiyawa mboh reh, ma nga mboh wuwana ata tuma ma ikpi kpra mata a lisa a tsana akpi Musa reh. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Nza bu dehreh ni nati kira mboh nnoh ti lisa nnoh awumu mboh nza ma a bleh noh reh nambri. Mohnoh neh ti kama lisa nnoh andromboh ata mboh nza ma a lisa reh kpeh, mboh reh maka a wina tufa andromboh ata mboh nza ma a bleh reh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Maka a fira awumu rishi ata nza a bu na iya gu ŋoh, ma a fira a gya ma kyangwri ma agba. Mboh neh ma kama a gu ameh ivoh shingi mboh yi awumu reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />&lt;&lt;Andromboh ata nza ma a lisa reh ma lisa la kyangwri mboh mata a nza mboh: Maka a leh a lafa a kpanga tsifa Nnoh a hehndeh de ma gbomo, iya akuri amoh mboh reh a zeh a tamba a ba ma gboro; <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Maka a kira atsi tuma agbugba kyangwri mboh ma atsi kira reh, tasa za maka a kira mata tuma ma tohmoh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh; <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />maka kira la kyangwri mata atsifa na amoh ma kpakpranda la kyangwri mboh mata leh a fi mboh la &lt;Kyangwri tsana.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />&lt;&lt;A zohhoh mata a fi noh la &lt;Kyangwri tsana kpeh,&gt; Kyangwri tsana amohnoh a bu ŋoh anyimbehreh, ni bu noh atsi ni itoh amohnoh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Kama fi noh akyo la &lt;Ada&gt; ma inziyo areh kpeh, ni bu noh na Ada anyimbehreh ma, ata nza a yama ma inza. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Ha neh akyo ta a fi noh la, &lt;Kyangwri agba&gt;, agba amohnoh a bu Kristi ŋoh tsene ma. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Akyo ata nza bu agba nimeh amohnoh a bu ŋoh a nati a te ndohmoh amohnoh. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Akyo ata nza a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka inza, Nnoh a nati a de ŋoh akuku, akyo ata nza akuku ikpi ŋoh Nnoh a nati a gu ŋoh a ka inza.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nasa Amboh Huru Tsifa Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mk 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk 11:39-42</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa ata Farisiyawa mboh reh, mohnoh amboh agugu mboh! Ni hama nnoh aki ma kyangwri mboh ata niye nimeh kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza. mohnoh ni leke ti niye nnoh na ikpi amohnoh! <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Iya agba amohnoh, amboh tsana akpi tasa ata lomo Farisiyawa mboh reh, mohnoh amboh agugu mboh! mohnoh ni kǝ sa awumu fya kunu mboh hwana nnoh tasa za ni kǝ kwere nnoh Nnoh yanda nnoh la tama a nza noh. Nza bu dehreh ma a nati a shimba hwra akpi anzoh na iya gaga.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa lomo Farisiyawa mboh reh! mohnoh amboh agugu mboh! mohnoh ni kǝ hehndeh treh nnoh atsifi ti hwana nnoh fini akre la ti gyuru nnoh fene kyangwri anyimbehreh, nza ni hunji noh kyangwri anyimbehreh reh, ni kǝ gu nnoh la a bu ŋoh tsene nza a nati aniye nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh reh a keh nnoh a te hwana afri.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh tsana noh aki ma amboh ata maka a nza atsifi kpeh reh! Ni bleh noh la, &lt;Nza akyo ka faku na ida Nnoh, andromboh a yama kpeh; nza akyo neh ka faku na hungroh zinariya ata da kwere Nnoh reh, a nati a tufa faku a ŋoh reh kanga.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mohnoh amboh hwra yo mboh, amboh duduna! Atamaa a bu agba, hungroh zinariya, ha ida Nnoh ata ka hwara kpakpa hungroh reh? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Ni gyuru tsana noh za la, &lt;Nza akyo a gu faku na bagadi, andromboh a yama kpeh, akyo ata neh nza a gu faku na ngǝnga ata maka a gya ma ikpi bagadi reh, a nati a tufa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a gu faku ma ikpi reh kanga.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />mohnoh amboh hwra iyo mboh! A bu atamaa a keh agba, a bu ngǝnga ha a bu bagadi ata nza ka hwara ngǝnga ta a bu na zanana reh? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Nza a bu dehreh, Akyo ta nza faku na bagadi, a faku na wohroh tasa na andromboh ata a bu ma ikpi ŋoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Tasa za akyo ata nza faku na ida Nnoh a faku na wohroh tasa za a faku na Nnoh ata nza a bu nimeh a ŋoh, <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Tasa akyo ata nza faku na inza, a faku na kpra Agohmoh Nnoh tasa na akyo ata nza tuma ma ikpi kpra reh.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa lomo Farisiyawa mboh reh, mohnoh amboh agugu! Ni kǝ fufa nnoh anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh ata awumu asho wra tasa ata asho angǝshi shifa amohnoh mboh. mohnoh ni gyuru ta nnoh awumu ata nza a zohhoh nimeh akpi reh, tswanza hwra akpi a zizi, tasa kwini tasa nga agohsoh. Awumu amboh areh a zohhoh ti lisa nnoh nambri ti kama gu nnoh anyi shebiri nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />mohnoh amboh tsana noh aki ma amboh ata maka a nza atsifi kpeh! Ni kǝ chehcheh nnoh ameh alulu a su ibi ti mina nnoh nyama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa lomo Farisiyawa mboh reh, mohnoh amboh agugu mboh! Ni kǝ hwara nnoh iji hohndoh wa amwo tasa ata gbugba amohnoh ta bu fyafya, nimeh neh a bu na agohsoh abibi ata sa awumu kyangwri mboh hwana tasa kira ikpi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Nnoh kyangwri Farisiyawa ata hwra iyo, jiji hwara nimeh gbugba tasa hohndoh mata bu fyafya, tasa mgba nyina za a nati a bu na zanana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Iya agba na amohnoh, amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa ata Farisiyawa mboh reh, mohnoh amboh agugu! Ni tswa nnoh nza ikpi nyifo ata ma awo a mla tasa, a zohhoh nza anyi ma inziyo, nimeh neh ka bu akofo kohmoh kyangwri ata kǝ hwina te arishi. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />A bu ma aki wohroh dehreh, ni kǝ tsana noh ma kyangwri mboh nyi nnoh ma inziyo la ni bu noh amboh tufa yehlehleh, nimeh neh ni bu noh amboh te inyi tasa amboh te agugu mboh.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh Iya Ata ma a nati A wa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luk 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa lomo Farisiyawa mboh reh, mohnoh agugu mboh! Ni mina nnoh ikpi nyifo alilehndeh ma amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh, tasa za ni kǝ jimi nnoh kpikpi nyifo amboh tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Ni bleh noh la, &lt;Bu tama a bleh la mbohroh meh yama na ada mboh na kiri reh, bu mbohroh reh timi wina shingi mboh sangra imya amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh mboh reh kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ka bu dehreh ni bleh tsifa ma ikpi amohnoh la ni mla nnoh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />mohnoh ti rya nnoh tohmoh na agugu ata ada amohnoh mboh tama ka a jiji a leh lisa reh.<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />&lt;&lt;mohnoh agugu kyangwri mboh, ni bu noh tswanza anu, biroh iyoh abibi reh! ni nati hwana nnoh avoh na hwra akpi ata ma a nati a lofo nnoh nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh reh lele? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nza a bu dehreh meh ti a bleh noh zizi meh nati tohmoh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh tasa amboh lomo mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh tama a ba na anzoh. Ni nati mla nnoh mgbiri mboh kwo, ti kpa nnoh mgbiri mboh ma gbohrohgboh; ti mla nnoh mgbiri amoh mboh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, tasa za ti katsi nnoh mgbiri mboh nyi nnoh akpo afiya anyi na akpo afiya. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Tsifa wohroh la vari imya amboh tufa yehlehleh ta ka a sangrana ma ikpi amohnoh ma inziyo reh, zaka a gu ka anyi na imya Habila kyangwri tufa yehlehleh reh ka a gu ka a na na imya Zakariya amehreh Berekiya ata ti kǝ mla nnoh kwo ma atsitsifi ida Nnoh tasa ma bagadi atsi kwere Nnoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Meh bleh noh zizi, iya ata ma a nati nga ma amboh mla kyangwri mboh kwo reh, a nati a hwa ma ikpi kyangwri amboh ika ata ameh ata areh!<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A kira na Urushalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />&lt;&lt;Mohnoh kyangwri Urushalima, mohnoh kyangwri Urushalima, mohnoh nza ni mla nnoh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh tasa za ni dafa nnoh amboh ata nza ma a tohmoh mboh a ba na amohnoh reh na kpakpa, a bu hwana amama meh kira meh ti de mara amohnoh mboh ba ma akpo anyimbehreh tswanza a de ka hama mara adeh mboh na amgba, mohnoh neh ni leke nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Nza nehnehreh, ma ta noh afiya anzoh wusu. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nza ka a gu anyi nehnehreh, meh bleh noh la ni nati za gyuru nza meh noh za kpeh, nza tini gyuru bleh meh noh za feh, Ma a te atoh ma akyo ata nza a ba nimeh isa Ada reh. &gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Kpra mboh Ata Trina Nziyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mk 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yeso ka yi ida Nnoh reh ata ta ka a buti a na a ŋoh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba na a ŋoh maka a leh atsifa ma ikpi mina dida Nnoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ni nza noh awumu amboh reh nambri?&gt;&gt; meh ti a bleh noh zizi, ma a nati mishi ata kpakpa anyimbehreh mareh ma ikpi atohngoh kpeh, Nambri ma amoh ma a nati a sangra mboh a tamba.<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iya Amboh jiji reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yeso nza ka a buti tuma ma agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh mboh, amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh maka a ba na a ŋoh na ayuhu la, &lt;&lt;Bleh reh, a bu ameh atamaa andromboh ata areh a nati bu dehreh? Tasa a bu umbo a nati bu kpra ba anzoh tasa trina inziyo reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh akyo ata a landa nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati ba nimeh isa mya, ma a nati a bleh noh la, meh bu Kristi; ma a nati a landa kyangwri mboh gaga, <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Ni nati sehreh noh la gofo a te tasa alulu tsifa gofo mboh, kama nyiri nnoh kpeh. Awumu amboh ka wohroh ma a nati te kanga, trina hehreh ba kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Kyangwri ma akpo inzi anyi ma a nati a mla na na kyangwri mboh ma akpo inzi anyi, tasa za kpra Agohmoh mboh ma a nati a hinga ma kpra Agohmoh. Inyo a nati yama tasa inzi a nati a zuzuna ma akpokpo atsifi mboh. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />amboh areh nambri ma a nati a tswanza rina mara ikpi afeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />&lt;&lt;Ma a nati a de noh a nga amboh nza ma a nati a nga noh iya mata a mla nnoh a kwo, tasa kyangwri ma a nati a leke nnoh a treh akpokpo atsifi mboh nambri ma ikpi isa amya. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Na ameh wohroh kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati gyuruna nyi ma aki tufa Nnoh mata a leke itoh amoh. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa gaga ma a nati hinga a te, ma a nati a landa kyangwri mboh gaga. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Te agugu a nati kpiri a bu gaga, kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati a za kira na itoh amoh za kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Akyo ata neh nza a shi a wuwana a gu a na a gya ma trina ŋoh, a nati hunji nvara. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Tsifa nana Nnoh ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh ma a nati hwra a bleh a treh inziyo agba areh la ti bleh na aniye anzoh ma kyangwri mboh, neh trina ka a nati a ba.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abibi Iya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mk 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />&lt;&lt;Ni nati nza noh andromboh abibi ata nza a nati a de kwo a ba &lt;Ata Daniyel kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh, nza a leh a shi ma atsi zanana,&gt;akyo ata nza a bleh amgbasho ta a sehreh a wina. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />amboh nza ma a yama nimeh yahudiya maka a gbo a na agbohgboh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Akyo ata nza a bu ma ikpi tsitsi ida ta a kama a gyuru a na la ŋoh a nati a gu andromboh a kate nyi ma afiya reh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Akyo ta nza a bu ma aye ta kama a gyuru a na la ŋoh a nati gu kuri ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Iya agba na amohnoh ifiya amboh vru mboh tasa amboh nga behneh ma amehreh mboh ni ibi wohroh! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Kwere nnoh Nnoh la hinga anzoh ta kama bu na ameh awi kpeh ha ibi asabar kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Na ameh wohroh reh, iya agba a nati a ba, ibiroh iya ika wohroh reh ma a hehreh a nza kpeh nza a gu anyi jiji inziyo a gu a ba a te nehnehreh, ma a nati a za a lisa ika wohroh za kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Mata a bleh la ma shimba ibi amboh wohroh kpeh, itoh akyo a nati mishi nvara kpeh, a bu tsifa amboh nza ma a seh mboh reh nza ma a nati a shimba ibi amboh wohroh reh. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Na ameh wohroh reh nza akyo ata a bleh noh la, &lt;Nza nnoh, Kristi reh uwe! ha nza ŋoh ari!&gt; kama sa tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kristi ata huru tsifa tasa Amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa ma a nati a kate, ma a nati a tsana kpra agbugba tasa ndohmoh ŋara aniye la mata landa kyangwri mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a seh mboh reh; nza a nati bu ma atsifi reh. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Nza, Mya tini jiji a bleh noh na ameh ata ari feh sa a bu dehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />&lt;&lt;Nza akyo a bleh noh la, &lt;Nza ŋoh ari, nimeh bini,&gt; Kama kate nnoh kpeh; ha, &lt;Nza ŋoh uwe, nimeh ida mboh,&gt; kama sa tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />A nati tswanza kpalala nza ka a rya a nza ni mgba nnoh nerebi ta a zana a na a hwa ni mgba nnoh nvishi reh a nati bu dehreh ni ba amehreh kyangwri. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Atsifi ata kohmoh nza a yama akpabi maka a nati a dohsohna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amehreh Kyangwri A nati a ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />&lt;&lt;Heriheri iya amboh wohroh nza ka a gǝga reh&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">&lt;nnoh a nati a hungwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">tasa nara a nati a zana za kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">akpukpa mboh ma a nati a hwa anyi inza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">tasa wuwana Nnoh ata inza a nati a zuzu atsifi mboh reh nambri.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />&lt;&lt;Na ameh wohroh reh kpra amehreh kyangwri a nati a kate ma inza, tasa arimi mboh nambri ma inziyo ma a nati kpanga. Ma a nati a nza amehreh kyangwri atsi ba ma avereh ata inza, na wuwana tasa nga agba gaga. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Tasa a nati a tohmoh amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh na gohroh drumu mama atsi fi tasa ma a nati a suhru ŋoh amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh anyi avohvoh anneh ata inziyo areh, anyi mgba anyimbehreh ata inza a na mgba anyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana Ma Ikpi Agbeh Mgbungba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />&lt;&lt;Nehnehreh, nza noh kakranda reh nyi nnoh na agbeh mgbungba. Nza avohvoh a ŋoh waka a fana reh, asho mboh za ma a nati ka a fana, wina nza noh la ameh awi kǝ ba whiri. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Nza ni nza noh andromboh amboh ata areh nambri, ti wina noh la Nnoh kǝ ba nda ma anida yehlehleh. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Meh bleh noh zizi, ika amboh areh a nati gǝga kpeh, andromboh amboh areh ma a nati feh. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Inza tasa inziyo ma a nati a trina, tsifa mya neh a nati a sohroh a trina kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibi Tasa ameh Wohroh reh Akyo A wina Kpeh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mk 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17:26-30</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />&lt;&lt;Akyo a wina ibi ha ameh wohroh kpeh, kawa amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata inza, ha amehreh Nnoh. A bu Ada ma tsene. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Tswanza na ameh Anuhu reh, a nati bu dehreh za na ba amehreh kyangwri. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Na ameh wohroh neh amwo reh kǝ hehreh su kate kpeh kyangwri ba maka rya irya tasa mata a wa, ifiya tasa tsifa mboh maka a leh a sa itoh amoh, a gu a ba neh Anuhu nza ka a ba ba aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh; <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />ma a za a wina andromboh ata nza a nati a hunji mboh reh za kpeh, awi ka a ba a yanda neh amwo ka a su ma fini a ba ba a fira mboh nambri a na a ŋoh. A nati a bu dehreh ibi ata amehreh kyangwri a nati a ba reh. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Kyangwri afri ma a nati bu na aye ma a nati gu anyimbehreh, tama ata anyimbehreh: <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Ifiya mboh afri ma a nati a bu ti hwa ma kpakpa; ma a nati a gu anyimbehreh tama ata anyimbehreh.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />&lt;&lt;Lisa shi nza noh, tsifa ni sohroh wina noh ibi ata Ada nza a nati a ba reh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Mohnoh neh wina noh ata areh, bu ma bleh la kyangwri afiya a nati a wina ibi ata ayuhu a nati a ba reh, a nati a tuma a sumu ta a kira la mata a vasa afiya reh aniye kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Tuma noh na iyo alete, amehreh kyangwri a nati a ba, na ameh ata nza ni nati wina noh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahwra Alindeh ha Ahwra Abibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />&lt;&lt;Ka bu anyi ka lisa yehlehleh tasa ahwra wina lomo? Ata Ada a ŋoh nza a gu ŋoh a gya la ta a sumu mgba afiya a ŋoh, tasa za ta ka a nga mboh irya yehlehleh. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ahwra reh a nati hunji te atoh nza Ada a ŋoh ka a ba ba a hunji ŋoh atsi te ndohmoh a ŋoh reh. A nati a zohhoh ma ahwra wohroh ata kyangwri agba a ŋoh ta a hunji ŋoh a bu ti lisa alindeh ta a nati gyuru ba. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Meh bleh noh zizi, a nati a gu ŋoh a gya ta ka a nza ŋoh awumu ŋoh mboh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Mata a bleh la ahwra reh a bu agugu ta ka a kohnoh ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, &lt;Ada amya reh kǝ kama keh yanda a ba kpeh,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />tasa za a nati ka a leh a mla atohngoh ahwra mboh reh tasa za ta ka leh a rya irya tasa wa mboh ma amboh wa mboh. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Ada ahwra reh a nati a hinga a ba ma ibi ata nza a nati a wina kpeh, tasa ameh ata nza a nati wina kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Agba ahwra reh a nati a nga ŋoh iya gaga tasa ta a gu ŋoh a fi a na na amboh agugu mboh, a huru a nati a kpanga ta a rya anyini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Nyifa Agrumavoh Amboh Nza ma A hehreh A wina Tsifa Mboh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />&lt;&lt;Na ameh wohroh reh kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a nati a tswanza nyifa agrumavoh mboh amboh ata ma a hehreh wina atsifa kpeh, ma a de afitila amoh mboh a na atsi dohsohna sa atsifa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Atungu nimeh amoh ma a duduna atungu ma a bu na lomo. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Amboh ata duduna reh ma a de afitila amoh ma a sohroh a de amehneh kpehngeh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Amboh ata nza ma a bu na lomo reh neh maka a de amehneh kpehngeh amoh ma amgbo tasa afitila amoh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Atsifa reh ka a yanda a sohroh a ba na gbugbo kpeh, maka a leh a zoh mla, mla ka a sa mboh gu.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />&lt;&lt;Na atsitsifi shini jima ka a hwa la, &lt;Nza nnoh atsifa reh! kate ba nnoh meh ti na ni hunji ŋoh!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru nyifa amboh ata ma a hehreh wina atsifa kpeh reh nambri ma amoh maka a de a hinga a mloh afitila amoh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />amboh duduna reh maka a bleh ma amboh lomo reh la, &lt;Nga turoh amehneh kpehngeh amohnoh reh shidi; afitila ambohroh waka a nati kwo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Maka a kira la, &lt;Mma,&gt; &lt;A nati a tswa reh kpeh. Ni nati na nnoh na amboh nza maka a rifa na amehneh reh ti sa nnoh shidi ma ikpi amohnoh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />&lt;&lt;Nza maka a buti ti na atsi sa amehneh reh, atsifa akehreh reh kǝ ba. Nyifa amboh nza ma a bu ni amehneh reh maka niye a na na a ŋoh atsi wa afiya reh. Ma a yi anida ka a hama.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />&lt;&lt;A yanda kpeh neh mgbiri nyifa amboh ata ma a hehreh wina atsifa kpeh reh maka a ba za, maka leh a kpanga a kate la, &lt;Ada vuru turoh anida!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />&lt;&lt;Ka kira la, &lt;meh bleh noh zizi, mi wina noh kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />&lt;&lt;Leh nnoh mla kpeh, ni wina noh ibi ha ameh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda lomo wina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />&lt;&lt;Tasa za, kpra Agohmoh inza reh a nati tswanza kyangwri nza a nati a na ŋoh hehndeh gbugba, ka a fi ahwra a ŋoh mboh ta ka ata mboh awumu ŋoh ma ivoh amoh. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />A nga anyi hungroh zinariya atungu, anyi za nga ŋoh hungroh zinariya afri, nga ma anyi za hungroh zinariya anyimbehreh, a nza anyi na wuwana a ŋoh feh sa nga mboh. Ta ka a na ŋoh hehndeh. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Ata nza a sa hungroh zinariya atungu reh a gu a na ŋoh na a de a gyugyuru ka a hunji atungu a mishi za. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ata nza a sa hungroh zinariya afri reh, ŋoh a hunji afri a mishi za. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Kyangwri ata nza a sa hungroh zinariya anyimbehreh reh neh ka a gu a ŋoh a na na a shumu itsiyo ma inzi ta ka a huho hungroh Ada a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />&lt;&lt;Nza ka a mehheh neh Ada ahwra mboh reh ka a gyuru a ba la ma a de firoh reh a ba mata a bleh mboh ma amoh a nza. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Kyangwri ata ta ka a sa hungroh zinariya atungu reh ka a gu atungu ata nza a hunji a mishi reh a de a ba ta ka a bleh la, &lt;Ada&gt; &lt;Ti ni nga meh hungroh zinariya atungu. Nza meh gyuru hunji hungroh zinariya atungu anyi za mishi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Ada reh ka a kira la, &lt;Nnoh reh feh, ahwra alindeh, ni kǝ lisa yehlehleh! Ni lisa yehlehleh ma ikpi andromboh akehreh meh nati gu nnoh gya agba atsi nza awumu mboh gaga. Ba meh ti johjoh mbohroh ma anzoh!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata nza a bu na hungroh zinariya afri reh za a ka a ba ba a bleh la, &lt;Ada,&gt; &lt;Tini nga meh hungroh zinariya afri; nza, meh hunji afri mishi za.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />&lt;&lt;Ada a ŋoh reh ka kira la, &lt;Nnoh reh feh, ahwra alindeh, ni kǝ lisa yehlehleh! Ni lisa yehlehleh ma ikpi andromboh akehreh, meh nati gu nnoh gya agba atsi nza awumu mboh gaga. Ba meh ti johjoh mbohroh ma anzoh!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />&lt;&lt;Ahwra ata ta ka a sa hungroh zinariya anyimbehreh reh, ŋoh za ka a ba ba a bleh la, &lt;Ada, meh wina la ni bu kyangwri wuwa agohsoh, ni kǝ fira nyi atsi ata ni sohroh hafa kpeh tasa ni kǝ suhru nyi atsi ata ni sohroh hwina biroh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />A ka a te meh nyiri meh kǝ gyuru gu hungroh na ni shumu inzi gu huho. Nza! sa andromboh anzoh yama.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />&lt;&lt;Ada a ŋoh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Ni bu agugu, ahwra yangru! Ni wina la meh kǝ fira nyi atsi ata meh sohroh hafa kpeh tasa meh kǝ suhru nyi atsi ata meh sohroh hwina biroh kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ma a keh a zohhoh ti gu hungroh reh na ni gya ma ganzi hungroh, nza meh ba amya reh meh ti sa hungroh mboh reh mishi mboh ma ata nza a ka ma ikpi reh. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Nehnehreh, sa nnoh hungroh reh nyi nnoh na a ŋoh ti nga nnoh kyangwri ata nza a bu na akpreh hungroh dubu agrumavoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Akyo ata nza a bu na andromboh reh, ma a nati a nga ŋoh a mishi, a ka a nati a bu na wohroh gaga. Akyo ata nza a bu na wohroh kpeh, ata ashidi nza a bu na wohroh reh ma a nati sa a hwana nyi na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Mata ka a yi abibi ahwra reh a fi a kate a na ma inziyo, hohroh shini agba a huru a nati a kpanga ta a rya anyini.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atashi mboh tasa Ibibi mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />&lt;&lt;Na ameh ata amehreh kyangwri a nati a ba na agba a ŋoh, tasa amehreh tohmoh Nnoh mboh nambri ma a nati a bu na a ŋoh, a nati tuma ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh ma inza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Kyangwri mboh ma a nati anyi akpokpo inzizi mboh nambri a ba mata a dohsohna ma tohmoh a ŋoh, tasa a nati a gafa kyangwri mboh tswanza kyangwri sumu nza ka a gafa atashi mboh anyi na ibibi mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />A nati gya atashi mboh na mgba ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh ta gya ibibi mboh na mgba ivoh a mina a ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />&lt;&lt;Agohmoh reh neh ka a nati a bleh ma amboh na mgba ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh reh la, &lt;Ba nnoh, mohnoh amboh ata Ada amya a te atoh na amohnoh reh! Ba ti sa nnoh kpra Agohmoh ata Nnoh ta ka a lisa a gya nnoh nyi avoh ameh jiji lisa inziyo agba reh. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Nyo tana a keh meh ni nga meh noh irya, yohroh amwo tana a keh meh ni nga meh noh amwo meh ti wa, meh tini bu sehneh ni wa meh noh na mgba afiya, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Meh tini kira kuri ni nga meh noh kuri, Meh tini leh bishi ni sumu meh noh, Meh tini bu ma ida ka ni ba bu were nnoh na amya.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru amboh tufa aki yehlehleh reh ma a nati kira la, &lt;Ada, tana a bu na ameh atamaa timi nza noh la nyo a keh meh kǝ nga nnoh irya, ha yohroh amwo tana a keh nnoh meh kǝ nga nnoh amwo wa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Na ameh atamaa timi nza noh la ni bu sehneh meh kǝ wa nnoh na mgba afiya, ha la ni bu na kuri kpeh meh kǝ nga nnoh kuri? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Tana a bu na ameh atamaa ata nnoh nza ni leh bishi ha la ni bu ma ida ka, Mbohroh meh ba na anzoh?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />&lt;&lt;Agohmoh reh ka a nati kira la, &lt;meh bleh noh zizi, ha bu umbo ni lisa noh ma anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa mboh ata nza bu akehreh reh, ni lisa meh noh mi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru a nati a bleh ma amboh ata nza ma a bu na mgba ivoh a mina ŋoh reh la, &lt;Yi meh noh ta, mohnoh nza ma a te nnoh aniye reh, na nnoh nimeh shira ata tuma atono nza ma a lisa a gya ma agugu mboh ma amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Nyo ta a te meh ni sohroh nga meh noh andromboh ti irya kpeh, Yohroh amwo ta a keh meh ni sohroh nga meh noh andromboh ti wa kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Mya tini bu sehneh ni sohroh wa meh noh na nimeh kpeh, mya tini kira kuri ni sohroh nga meh noh kuri kpeh, mya tini leh bishi tasa mi bu ma ida ka ni sohroh sumu meh noh kpeh.<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />&lt;&lt;Mboh za ma a nati a kira la, &lt;Ada mbohroh, na ameh atamaa timi nza nyo a keh nnoh ha la yohroh amwo a keh nnoh ha la tini kira kuri ha la ni leh bishi ha ni bu ma ida ka, meh shingi nnoh kpeh?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />&lt;&lt;A nati kira la, &lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, ha a bu mboh nza ni lisa noh ma akehreh amoh nimeh amboh ata areh kpeh, ni sohroh lisa meh noh kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru amboh nza ma a tufa aki yehlehleh kpeh ma a nati a na amoh atsi nza iya ata tuma atono, amboh nza ma tufa aki yehlehleh reh neh maka a nati a hunji fene ata tama atono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Agbugba Mboh Ma A dohsoh Aniye la mata A mla Yeso A kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yeso nza ka a bleh tsifa amboh areh a treh nambri, ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Tswanza nza ni wina noh reh la, kira gǝga handa reh a treh hwa ibi afri tasa za ma a nati a de amehreh kyangwri a nga mboh mata a de kpa a gya ma gbohrohgboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Agba firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh neh maka a dohsohna ma mgba afiya agba firist anyi ata nza maka a fi isa a ŋoh la Kayafa, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />maka a tuma a dohsoh aniye ata nza ma a nati a de Yeso mata a mla a kwo na ayuhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />&lt;&lt;Maka a bleh la, ma a kama a de ŋoh ni ibi kira reh kpeh, kyangwri tama a fi agǝshi&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A wo Ma Yeso amehneh Angǝshi Ma Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yeso nza ka a bu ma Betani ma Afiya Siman, kyangwri anyi a bu na bishi kohmoh. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Afiya anyi ka a ba na a ŋoh, a bu na da anyi ata ma a lisa na kpakpa onis, a bu na amehneh wo angǝshi ata maka sa na hungroh gaga, ka a wohsoh a were a na ma ikpi a ŋoh, ŋoh a kasa atsi tuma rya irya. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh nza maka a nza dehreh, maka te gofo maka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ma a nasa ata areh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Bu ma ata amehneh reh mata a rifa ni hungroh gaga mata a gu hungroh reh a shingi amboh ata nza ma a bu na asabara kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yeso nza ka wina dehreh, ka luhu mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh wa nnoh afiya reh aniye tsifa umbo? A lisa meh andromboh alindeh. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Ni bu noh na amboh iya ni tutu, mya meh nati sohroh yama na amohnoh na tutu kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />amehneh wo angǝshi nza a were meh ma itoh reh, a were meh ta lisa meh a gya ata ma a nati anyifo meh. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Meh ti bleh noh zizi, akpokpo atsifi nza ma a nati hwra tsifa nana reh a treh ma inziyo areh, andromboh ata afya nza a lisa reh ma a nati ka a bleh ma ta ka kohnoh na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahuda A kira la ŋoh ta A de Yeso A rifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh neh nza maka a fi ŋoh la Yahuda Iskariyoti, ka a na a ŋoh na Agba Firist mboh, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu umbo ni nati nga meh noh, nza meh de ŋoh nga nnoh reh?&gt;&gt; Maka a bleh azurfa agrumavoh ida atatoh a nga ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Ka anyi na wohroh Yahuda reh ka a leh a fa akeki la ŋoh ta ka a de ŋoh a nga mboh.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A rya Awumu Rya Handa mboh ma Amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ibi na anyimbehreh ŋoh ata nza maka a rya afohfohnoh ata maka a fi atoh nimeh kpeh reh, amboh tufa mboh reh maka a ba ba a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni kira meh ti lisa nnoh atsi tuma rya irya kira gǝga handa reh ma mgbata?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Na nnoh nimeh akpo afiya agba reh ti na ni hunji noh kyangwri anyi ti bleh noh la, &lt;Kyangwri tsana a bleh la, ameh amya kǝ ba hwiri, meh nati rya kira gǝga handa Mbohroh ma amboh tufa amya mboh nimeh nashi anzoh.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka lisa tswanza Yeso nza a bleh mboh reh, maka lisa atsi tuma rya irya kira gǝga handa reh. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Na mgba Nvishi, Yeso ka tuma a rya irya ma ikpi ateburu mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Maka a bu nimeh rya irya reh, ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh zizi, anyimbehreh nimeh amohnoh a nati a de meh a rifa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Maka kputu agohsoh tasa za maka luhu ŋoh anyinyimbehreh la &lt;&lt;Mbimbi a bu mya kpeh ŋoh Ada?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ata nza a rya awumu irya ni gbugba anyimbehreh na amya reh a bu ŋoh a nati a de meh a nga mboh. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />amehreh kyangwri a nati a kwo tswanza nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh, iya agba na akyo wohroh nza a te agugu a de amehreh kyangwri a nga mboh reh, a nati a keh zohhoh tama a mara akyo wohroh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yahuda neh, ŋoh nza a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh reh, ka a bleh la &lt;&lt;Ha a bu mya, kyangwri tsana?&gt;&gt;Yeso ka kira ŋoh la&lt;&lt;Ha, a bu noh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Irya Ada Ata Nvishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-26">Ama 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Nza ma a ka a bu nimeh rya irya reh, Yeso ka a gu afohfohnoh reh, ta ka a te atoh ma afohfohnoh reh, ka mblimblishi afohfohnoh reh ka a nga amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Sa ti rya nnoh; areh a bu itoh amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />A treh neh ka a gu Gandu imiya reh, ka kwende Nnoh, ka nga mboh la &lt;&lt;Wa nnoh nambri ma amohnoh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />&lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu imya amya ata ma ta ka atsifa bleh gya reh, ata ma a nati a sangra ni ikpi kyangwri gaga la mata te kohhroh na kpakpana amoh mboh. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Meh bleh noh, meh nati za wa amwo mara agbeh inabi reh za kpeh, ka anyi nehnehreh a gu a na ibi ata meh nati wa afeh na amohnoh nimeh kpra Agohmoh Ada amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Nza maka a gu amumu riri Nnoh, maka a kate a na amoh agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh La Abitrusu A nati A tana Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nimeh shini areh nambri ma amohnoh ni nati gbo ta meh noh, ma a ŋa a gya la, &lt;Nnoh a nati a mla amboh sumu alondo tasa atashi mboh nimeh reh a kwo, tasa atashi mboh nimeh avavara reh ma a nati a te atsetse.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Nza tama a yiri meh anyi ma kwo reh, meh nati jitomo na amohnoh na amya Galili.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh a de aniye la&lt;&lt;Nza ma a nati a gbo nambri ma amoh la tsifa anzoh, mya meh nati gbo kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la meh ti bleh noh zizi, &lt;&lt;Nimeh shini areh, ni nati jiji leke meh te na atatoh feh agba sa a wri. <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Ha meh nati kwo Mbohroh ma anzoh, meh nati sohroh tana la mi wina noh kpeh&gt;&gt; Mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a bleh dehreh za.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A kwere Nnoh Ma Getsemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka na atsifi anyi maka a fi sa la Getsemani, ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Tuma bana meh noh ni mareh ta meh ti ka na ni mgba shwa ari meh ti na ni kwere Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ka a fi Abitrusu mboh ma mara zabadi mboh afri la mata a wa ŋoh, ka a bu nimeh hungwa agohsoh a ŋoh agohsoh a ŋoh ka rishi ŋoh za, <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Agohsoh amya a kputuna gaga tswanza meh ti kǝ kwo ma. tuma noh ma mareh, ti shingi meh noh were iyo alindeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ka a kpusu ka a na tohmoh shidi, ka a hwa a tamba ni tohmoh a ŋoh na inzi ka kwere Nnoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada amya, nza a nati a tswa ma tohmoh anzoh, gu iya ata areh hinga meh ma itoh amya. Awuhu areh a bu nza amya kpeh, nza a tswa nnoh feh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ka a gyuru a ba na amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh neh ka a ba ba a nza mboh ma a kasa atsi leh mla, ka luhu Abitrusu la. &lt;&lt;mohnoh feh a bu tsifa mboh ni nati wina tuma shingi meh noh were iyo hungroh nnoh anyimbehreh kpeh?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />&lt;&lt;Were nnoh iyo, ti kwere nnoh Nnoh la akyo ta kama a tsara nnoh kpeh. Huru reh a kira dehreh neh, itoh a bu luhutu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Ka a gyuru a na na kwere Nnoh na afri za la, &lt;&lt;Ada, nza gandu areh a nati a gǝga meh kpeh, kira anzoh ta ka a su <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ka a gyuru a ba ba a hunji amboh tufa a ŋoh maa a leh mla, ma a za a wina tuma iyo amoh alete za kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ka a gyuru a yi mboh ata, ka a na a ŋoh na kwere Nnoh za na atatoh, ka a na na a gyuru a bleh tsifa ikata anyi reh za.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Yeso ka a gyuru a ba na amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni treh leh fo nnoh nehnehreh tasa za ni treh leh nnoh mla fya? Nza nnoh, ameh kǝ ba hwiri, tasa za ma a nati a de amehreh kyangwri a nga amboh kpakpana mboh. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Hinga nnoh, meh ti na ambohroh! Nza nnoh akyo ata nza a nati a de meh a nga amboh agugu reh kǝ ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A de Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yeso nza ka a treh a bu nimeh tsifa, Yahuda, nza a bu anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh, ka a ba. Duma agba maka a tufa ŋoh tasa za ma a de ambyambya gara tasa agbohndoh tasa awumu gofo, ma a tohmoh mboh anyi afya Agba Firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Ŋoh ata nza a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh reh maka atsifa a gya kpra mboh ma amoh la: &lt;&lt;Ata nza mya tini tsifa na a ŋoh meh ti fla ŋoh de reh a bu kyangwri wohroh; ti de noh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Nza ka a ba nda ni Yeso Yahuda ka a bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Meh tsifa na anzoh kyangwri tsana,&gt;&gt; a ka a fla ŋoh a de ta ka atsifa na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Iza amya, lisa andromboh nza a de noh a ba reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Kyangwri mboh reh maka kpusu a na tohmoh, maka a sa Yeso reh a de. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Dehreh neh anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa Yeso reh ka a wro ambya gara a ŋoh a kate, ka a shimba ashotoh anyimbehreh nimeh ahwra agba firist mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Soh ambya gara anzoh na nimeh behreh ŋoh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;amboh ata nza ma a gu ambya a kate a bu ambya reh a nati a mla mboh a kwo. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />mohnoh ni nza noh la meh nati wina kwere Ada amya ta a shingi meh, a nati a tohmoh amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh mboh nza ma a keh amboh de ita mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh kpeh? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ma a nati a lisa lele feh tsifa ata nza ma a ŋa nimeh Amgbasho Nnoh reh ta a su la a nati a bu dehreh kanga reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Na ameh wohroh Yeso ka a bleh ma duma mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni ba nnoh na ambyambya gara mboh tasa na agbohndoh mboh ti de meh noh tswanza meh bu ayuhu? Meh kǝ tuma tsana noh nimeh ida Nnoh na tutu, ni sohroh de meh noh kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />amboh areh ma a bu dehreh nambri neh la tsifa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh ma ta ka a ŋa gya nimeh amgbasho reh ta a su.&gt;&gt; amboh tufa Yeso mboh nambri maka te atsetse ha atamaa ka a gbo a gu aki a ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Ma Tomwo Amboh Hwra Akpi Yahudawa Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mk 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh 18:13-14</ref>; 19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Amboh ata nza maka a de Yeso reh maka a de ŋoh a na na Kayafa, ŋoh nza bu anyimbehreh nimeh agba Firist mboh reh, ma atsi ata amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh nza maka dohsohna reh. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Abitrusu neh ka a hehndeh a tufa mboh a yi gbugba, a na na were ma afiya anyimbehreh nimeh agba Firist mboh reh. Ka a na na a tuma ma mgba afiya mboh ma ahwra mboh reh la ŋoh ta sehreh ha ma a nati ka hwra akpi reh lele. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />agba firist mboh ma agbugba amboh hwra akpi mboh maka a leh a fa akeki mata a hunji akyo ta a bleh huru tsifa ni ikpi Yeso neh la mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Ma a sohroh a hunji akyo anyi kpeh, neh kyangwri mboh gaga maka a de huru tsifa mboh a kate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">Nza ka a ba ma trina ŋoh reh, kyangwri amboh anyi mboh afri maka kpusu a ba tohmoh <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />Maka a ba ba a bleh la, &lt;&lt;kyangwri areh a bleh la, &lt;Ŋoh a nati a wina druhu ida Nnoh, ŋoh ta a gyuru a mina a treh ni ibi atatoh.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Agba Firist ka a de a hinga a shi ka a bleh ma Yeso la &lt;&lt;Ni bu na andromboh ata ni nati bleh kpeh? a ka bu tsifa mboh kyangwri amboh areh nza ma atsifa ni ikpi anzoh reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Yeso neh ka a bu gbalala ma. Agba firist reh ka bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Meh dohsoh nnoh na Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene: Bleh reh fya ha a bu noh ni bu Kristi, amehreh Nnoh reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Haa, a bu dehreh tswanza mohnoh nza ni bleh reh. Mya neh meh bleh noh nambri ma amohnoh: Nza ka a gu anyi na ameh ata areh, ni nati nza noh amehreh kyangwri atsi tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa ata wuwana a ŋoh tasa za a nati tamba ma avereh inza!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Agba firist reh ka de kuri a ŋoh akpi a hwashi ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh bu a kya Nnoh! meh treh gyuru fa anyi ta a ba ba a bleh ma ikpi a ŋoh? Nza nnoh, mohnoh ni kǝ sehreh noh tsifa a kya Nnoh reh. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Ni kǝ kohnoh nnoh lele?&gt;&gt; Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A tswa atsi mla a kwo&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Maka tofo ata a were ŋoh ma tohmoh tasa za maka jwara ŋoh mla na awarada. Amboh tswa neh ma a mla ŋoh na ambasa ivoh <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza tohmoh wina ti sa tsifa bleh reh, Kristi! A bu anyi a mla nnoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A tana Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mk 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh 18:15-18</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Abitrusu reh ka tuma ma mgba afiya ma atsi hwra akpi reh, ahwra anyifa anyi ata nza bu ma afiya agba Firist reh ka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Nnoh za tini bu noh mohnoh ma Yeso ata Galili reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Ka tana ni tohmoh amoh nambri. &lt;&lt;Meh sohroh wina tsifa amohnoh nza ni bleh ba nnoh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Nza ka kate a na ma anida afiya reh, anyifa anyi ka a ba ba a nza ŋoh za ka a bleh ma kyangwri mboh nza ma bu ma a huru reh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh za tama bu mboh ma Yeso ata Nazaret reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Ka a gyuru a tana za, ni gu faku la: &lt;&lt;Meh sohroh wina kyangwri reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Asohroh a yanda kpeh, amboh ata nza ma a shi ma a huru reh maka a na na Abitrusu maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu zizi noh ni bu anyi nimeh amoh, nnoh ni tsifa ika ata amoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ŋoh ka a jiji a kya ikpi a ŋoh tasa za ka a gu fa aku ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kama wina kyangwri areh kpeh &gt;&gt; Heriheri ma neh Agba ka a wri. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Abitrusu reh ka kohnoh heri ni tsifa ata Yeso ta ka a bleh ŋoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh nati tana la nnoh sohroh wina meh kpeh ti na atatoh feh agba sa wri.&gt;&gt; Ka kate a na a ŋoh inziyo ka a na a ŋoh na a kpanga jijiha.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yahuda A kohhroh Ikpi A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Na nerebi shishini ma, Agba Firist mboh nambri tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh amboh wina tsifa ata duma mboh maka a dohsoh aniye la mata a mla Yeso a kwo. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Maka a tsitsiya ŋoh, maka a de ŋoh a na amoh, maka a de ŋoh a nga Bilatus Agohmoh agba.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yahuda ata ta ka a de Yeso a rifa reh, nza ka a nza la ma a shimba akpi la mata lofo Yeso, ka sene agohsoh a ŋoh, ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh na Agba Firist mboh reh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh reh, ka a gyuru a na a nga mboh hungroh azurfa agrumavoh ida atatoh reh yama. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh kpakpana,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh gu imya akyo ata nza a wina andromboh kpeh rifa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu umbo a wa reh aniye?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu tsifa anzoh mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yahuda Ka a sangra hungroh reh a na mboh nimeh ida Nnoh amoh reh, ta ka a kate a na a ŋoh.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />agba firist mboh reh maka a gu hungroh reh maka a bleh la A zohhoh meh ti gya hungroh reh ma ganzi hungroh kpeh, la a bu hungroh imya. <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Maka kohnoh a nza dehreh neh maka a gu hungroh reh a sa atsifi kyangwri mina azo lo anyi, la atsi wohroh ta bu atsi nyifo sene mboh nza ma a kwo reh. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ka bu wohroh ŋa nza ma a ka a fi akpo atsifi reh la atsifi imya a ka a gu a ba a te andrehmeh areh. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ma huru andromboh ata Irimiya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ta ka a bleh reh ta a su la: &lt;&lt;Maka a gu hungroh reh zinariya agrumavoh ida atatoh, ifiro ata kyangwri Israila mboh mata ka ahwra ma ikpi a ŋoh reh, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />maka a gu hungroh reh a sa atsifi kyangwri mina azo lo na wohroh, tswanza Ada ta ka a bleh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ni Tomwo Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yeso neh kǝ shi ma tohmoh Agohmoh agba ata gomnati reh, Agohmoh agba reh ka luhu ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Nnoh bu Agohmoh yahudawa mboh reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yeso ka kira la, &lt;&lt;Ha, ka bu dehreh tswanza nza ni a bleh reh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />agba firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh neh maka a kya ŋoh, ka a sohroh a sa mboh aniye kpeh. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Bilatus neh ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni sehreh vara tsifa mboh nza ma a leh a ŋa nnoh reh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Yeso neh a kama a sa mboh aniye tsifa mbimbi kpeh, ha ta a sa mboh aniye ni ikpi tsifa anyimbehreh Agohmoh agba reh a ka shi a ŋara aniye ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A shimba Akpi Kwo ma Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Tana a ka a bu dehreh na ameh dohsoh ikpi handa kyangwri mboh maka a seh kyangwri anyimbehreh nimeh amboh nza ma a de mboh a ka reh. A nga Agohmoh agba reh ta ka a sa ata avoh. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Na ameh wohroh reh kyangwri wuwa ikpi anyi a yama ma ida ka reh, sa a ŋoh a bu Barabba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Duma mboh nza maka dohsohna, Bilatus ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu atamaa nimeh amboh afri reh ni kira nnoh meh ti ta ŋoh avoh nga nnoh: A bu Barabba, ha Yeso ata nza ma a fi sa a ŋoh la kristi reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Bilatus a wina la a bu tsifa vene ŋa nza ma a de Yeso a nga ŋoh reh.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Bilatus nza ka tuma ma ikpi kpra hwra akpi reh, Afiya a ŋoh ka de tohmoh ata areh a na na a ŋoh: &lt;&lt;Fufa ivoh anzoh kate ma ikpi tsifa kyangwri tufa yehlehleh ata nza a wina andromboh kpeh reh, meh wa iya ma lohtoh abibi andrehmeh areh ma ikpi a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Agba firist mboh tasa Agbugba kyangwri mboh maka a leh ata duma mboh na aniye la ma ata avoh Barabba mata nga mboh Yeso la mboh mata a mla kwo.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Agohmoh agba reh ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu atamaa nimeh amboh afri reh ni kira nnoh meh ti ta ŋoh avoh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Maka kira la,&lt;&lt;Barabba,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Bilatus ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu umbo meh nati lisa ma Yeso nza maka a fi ŋoh la kristi reh? nambri ma amoh maka a bleh ŋoh la ma kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh.<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Bilatus Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu tsifa umbo? A ka lisa umbo abibi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Kyangwri mboh neh maka a gyuru a vuru agba mama la, &lt;&lt;ma kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Bilatus a nza kyangwri mboh reh ma a kira ni tsifa a ŋoh za kpeh, ka a nza la agǝshi waka hinga, ka a gu amwo ka a wra ivoh a ŋoh mboh ma tohmoh duma mboh reh. Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh gu ivoh amya kate ma ikpi imya kyangwri ata nza a wina tsifa andromboh kpeh reh. Ata areh a bu tsifa amohnoh mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Vari imya a ŋoh ta tuma ma ikpi ambohroh tasa mara ambohroh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />A ka hingre Barabba a nga mboh: Yeso neh maka a mla ŋoh, tasa za maka a de ŋoh a nga mboh la mata kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh De Ita ma A te Nyi Ma Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />amboh de ita ata Agohmoh mboh reh maka a de Yeso aniye a na afiya Agohmoh reh, maka a dohsoh amboh de ita ata gofo mboh reh nambri maka a goh ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Maka fufa ŋoh kuri, maka were ŋoh kuri atisha anyi ikata agohgohmoh mboh reh. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Maka tsyumu gbama ikpi anyi na atohtoh, maka a gya ŋoh ma ikpi, tasa za maka a nga ŋoh ikpoh kokro ma ivoh rya a kpa, tasa za maka gbo na a gboro ma tohmoh a ŋoh maka a rya ŋoh a sa ata inyi ŋoh. Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ibi anzoh ta a na gbugba, Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Maka tofo ata a were ŋoh ma itoh, maka sa ikpoh kokro reh a hwana maka a leh tsinga ŋoh ni ikpi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Nza maka ti ŋoh nyi a treh maka fufa ŋoh kuri Agohmoh reh maka a gyuru a were ŋoh kuri a ŋoh. Maka wa ŋoh a na aki kpa reh.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A kpa Yeso ma Gbohrohgboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Nza maka a bu nimeh kate, maka a nza kyangwri anyi a bu kyangwri Sayirin, isa a ŋoh a bu Siman, maka a de ŋoh ni wuwana la ta a gu gbohrohgboh Yeso reh. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Nza maka a ba na akpo anyi, maka a fi la golgota, (wohroh a bu atsifi akohkohroh ikpi). <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Maka a nga ŋoh amwo inabi maka tofo na amwo agbiriri ŋoh, la ta a wa: ka a nza dehreh ka a bara a nza ka leke ta a wa. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Nza maka kpa ŋoh reh, maka a hwashi kuri a ŋoh a gafa ma itoh amoh ma aki fi seh. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Tasa za maka tuma a leh a sumu ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ma ikpi a ŋoh reh maka a ŋa la, &lt;&lt;AREH A BU YESO, AGOHMOH YAHUDAWA MBOH.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Maka kpa ayuhu mboh afri, anyimbehreh na ivoh rya a kpa, anyimbehreh na ivoh a mina.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />amboh nza ma a leh a gǝga ma aki reh maka a leh a gohgoh ikpi amoh a kya Nnoh. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ata nza ni nati wina druhu ida Nnoh ti gyuru mina nimeh ibi atatoh reh, nvara ikpi anzoh feh reh! nza ni bu amehreh Nnoh reh, tamba nyi ma gbohrohgboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />A bu dehreh za Agba Firist mboh tasa, amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh maka leh a te ŋoh nyi la. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />&lt;&lt;A nga nvara ma amboh tswa ŋoh neh a wina nvara ikpi a ŋoh kpeh! A bu ŋoh nza a bu Agohmoh Israila mboh reh kpeh? Nza ŋoh nza a nati a wina tamba anyi ma gbohrohgboh reh, mbohroh meh nati sa tsifa a ŋoh kira. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Ŋoh gya agohsoh a ŋoh na Nnoh. Ta Nnoh reh ta a sa ŋoh hwana nehnehreh, nza a kira na a ŋoh reh, a bleh la ŋoh bu &lt;amehreh Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Tasa ayuhu amboh ata ma ta ka a kpa mboh ma ŋoh za.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwo Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ka anyi na atsitsi fi noh, atsifi ka a hungwa akpo inzi reh nambri, a ka a gu a na na a te na mgba nnoh nvishi atsifi ka hungwa ma kpra Agohmoh reh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ni mgba nnoh hungroh atatoh Yeso ka a te kpiriga la &lt;&lt;Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani?&gt;&gt; wohroh reh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh amya, Nnoh amya, ni kǝ leke meh ta tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />amboh nza ma a shi na a huru nza maka a nza dehreh, maka a bleh la &lt;&lt;A fi Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Anyimbehreh nimeh amoh ka gbo ni gbugbo ka a gu asohsoh ka soh nimeh amwo inabi ata jwa, ka soh ma ikpoh kokro, ta ka a gu a nga ŋoh la Yeso ta a wa.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Mgbiri kyangwri mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ta nnoh tsehe meh ti nza ha Iliya reh a nati a ba ta a nga mboh nvara!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yeso nza ka a gyuru a vuru agba a te kpiriga za, ka a gu huru a ŋoh ata avoh.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ma a huru reh kuri hama anida ata ida Nnoh reh ka a hwashina a te afri anyi nza a tamba a ba ba a te ma inzi. Inzi ka a zuzuna kpakpa mboh maka a vasana. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Ikpi nyifo kohmoh mboh maka a vuruna, itoh kyangwri amboh zanana mboh nza ma a kwo ma aki tufa yehlehleh reh maka a gyuru a yiri mboh a hinga na fene. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Maka a kate anyi ikpi nyifo reh, tasa za Yeso nza ka a hinga anyi ma ikpi nyifo reh, maka aniye a na ma akpo afiya zanana, kyangwri gaga maka a nza ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Agba amboh de ita tasa amboh nza ma a yama na a ŋoh nza ma a tuma a sumu Yeso reh nza maka a nza inzi atsi zuzuna tasa mgbiri awumu mboh nza maka a lisa reh, maka nyiri gaga maka a bleh la &lt;&lt;zizi tana a bu amehreh Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />ifiya mboh tama a yama ma a huru ma a shi a nza ŋoh anyi gbugba, tama a tufa Yeso reh anyi Galili la mata shingi ŋoh lisa awumu. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Nimeh amoh a bu Maryamu nza anyi Magadala tasa Maryamu akre Yakubu, tasa Yusufu, tasa afya Zabadi mboh.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyifo Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Na mgba Nvishi, kyangwri Asabara anyi ka a ba anyi Arimatiya, isa a ŋoh a bu Yusufu, ŋoh za tana a bu kyangwri tufa Yeso reh. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Nza ka a na na Bilatus, ka luhu ŋoh itoh Yeso reh, Bilatus neh ka a bleh la mata a nga ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu ka a gu itoh Yeso reh a lafa ma kuri lilin ata zanana ŋoh, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Ka a na na anyifo ŋoh ma ikpi nyifo a ŋoh afeh ata ŋoh nza ahre nimeh kpakpa reh. Ka a yi kpakpa agba anyi ka a hama anida ikpi nyifo reh ta ka a na a ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala tasa Maryamu anyi za reh maka a tuma ma tohmoh ikpi nyifo reh.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amboh Sumu Ma Ikpi Nyifo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ibi na afri ŋoh reh, a bu ibi Asabar, Agba Firist mboh tasa Farisiyawa mboh maka a na na a hunji Bilatus, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Ka a bleh la&lt;&lt;Ada, Mbohroh meh kohnoh la kyangwri huru tsifa ta ka a treh a bu na fene reh, tana a bleh la, &lt;Ma a nati gyuru a yiri meh meh ti bu na fene yama ibi na atatoh tana reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Nza a bu dehreh a bleh mata a lisa a sumu ikpi nyifo reh alindeh a gu a na na a te ibi na atatoh. Kavoh kpeh reh neh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh tama a ba ba a gu ŋoh na ayuhu mata a bleh ma kyangwri mboh la ma a yiri ŋoh anyi ma ikpi nyifo. Huru tsifa ata trina ŋoh areh a nati a keh ata jiji ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Bilatus ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Fira nnoh amboh sumu mboh, ti na ni sumu nnoh ikpi nyifo reh na wina amohnoh nambri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Maka a na na a sumu ikpi nyifo reh, maka gya hama ma kpakpa ikpi nyifo reh maka a gya amboh sumu mboh ma a huru.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A yiri Anyi ma kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Asabar nza ka a gǝga, na nerebi shishini ma, ma ibi ata jiji ŋoh nimeh sati, Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala tasa Maryamu anyi maka a na la mata a nza ikpi nyifo reh.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Inzi a zuzuna ta ka a vuru na, amehreh tohmoh Ada ka tamba anyi inza, ka a gu aki a na ikpi nyifo reh, ka a yiyi kpakpa a kate ka tuma ma ikpi ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Ŋoh reh ka a zanana tswanza irya a nza, tasa kuri a ŋoh mboh ma a kasa tswanza alulu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />amboh sumu mboh reh maka a nyiri ŋoh gaga maka nyiri itoh tasa za maka te tswanza kohmoh kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ka bleh ma ifiya mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh, mya meh wina la ni leh fa nnoh Yeso, ata mata ka a de ŋoh kpa ma gbohrohgboh reh.<verse eid="MAT 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Ŋoh a yama ma mareh kpeh; ma a yiri ŋoh kǝ hinga. tswanza ta ka a bleh reh. Ba ti nza noh atsifi ata ta maka a gu ŋoh a fi reh. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />mohnoh neh na nnoh ti na ni bleh noh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;Ma a yiri ŋoh kǝ hinga nyi ma ikpi nyifo tasa za kǝ jitomo na amohnoh na a ŋoh Galili. Ni nati nza noh ma a huru!&gt; Ata areh a bu andromboh ata mya nza ni ba la meh ti bleh noh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ifiya mboh reh ma ka a gbo ata ikpi nyifo reh na gbugbo, ma a nyiri dehreh neh tsifa reh a nga mboh johjoh ma agohsoh, ma ka a gbo a na na a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ma huru heri Yeso ka a hunji mboh ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh.&gt;&gt; Maka a kpusu a ba ma nda a ŋoh, maka a de ŋoh ma hwana tasa za maka krumusu ŋoh. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh. Na ni bleh noh ma amboh tufa mboh mata a na Galili; ma a huru ma a nati a nza meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Amboh Sumu Mboh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />ifiya mboh nza maka a bu ma aki na amoh, mgbiri amboh sumu ikpi nyifo mboh reh maka a jitomo a na ma akpo afiya reh maka a na na a bleh ma Agba Firist mboh andromboh nza ma a nza reh nambri. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />agba firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh maka a dohsohna a lisa atsifa, maka a nga amboh de ita mboh hungroh gaga. <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Bleh nnoh ma kyangwri mboh reh la, &lt;A bu amboh tufa ŋoh mboh ma a ba ni shini a ba ba a gu kohmoh reh na ayuhu ata reh Mbohroh ma atsi leh mla,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Nza kyangwri agba ata akpo afiya agba reh ta a sehreh tsifa ata areh, a nati a nza nana ambohroh ta nga reh iya kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Amboh de ita mboh neh maka a gu hungroh reh a lisa andromboh ata nza ma a bleh mboh reh. Tsifa reh ka a treh atsifi na Yahudawa mboh reh ka a gu a ba ba a te andrehmeh areh.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndohmoh Agba Yeso nza A nga ma Amboh Tufa a ŋoh mboh Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />amboh tufa Yeso mboh agrumavoh a hwa anyimbehreh maka a na amoh Galili, ma a na agbohgboh atsi ata Yeso nza a bleh mboh la mata a na reh. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Nza maka a nza ŋoh reh, mboh za maka krumusu ŋoh; amboh tswa neh ma a sa a leke. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yeso neh ka a ba nda amoh ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Ma a nga meh wuwana nambri anyi inza a ba ba a te ma inziyo. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Nza a bu dehreh na ni bleh noh ma kyangwri mboh ma inziyo la ma tufa meh, ti lisa mboh nnoh mata bu amboh tufa amya mboh, ti wra mboh nnoh batisma nimeh isa Ada tasa ata amehreh a ŋoh tasa ata huru zanana, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />tasa za ti tsana mboh nnoh mata tufa andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh noh nambri reh Nza nnoh meh nati yama na amohnoh na tutu na ni te ma trina inziyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>